{"source_id": "YHZP-001-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論五行所生之始", "text_id": "YHZP-T-001-001", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "（页顶批）混沌胚腪，猶言如雞子，清濁未分。沓合，俱不分混沌貌。一判、乃分，已有天地之意。啄，鳥之嘴也。巢處穴居，結巢於樹枝，上爲天以安其身。飲血茹毛，無火食吃生物。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-001", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/001/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_001.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著；「妖怪，謂嗤尤神」为通行整理本所补、非国图本p19眉批原文，剔出正文", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-001-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論五行所生之始", "text_id": "YHZP-T-001-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "蓋聞天地未判，其名混沌；乾坤未分，是名胚腪。日月星辰未生，陰陽寒暑未分也。在上則無雨露、無風雲、無霜雪、無雷霆，不過杳合而冥冥；在下則無草木、無山川、無禽獸、無人民，不過昧昧而昏作。是時一氣盤中結，於是太易生水，未有氣，曰太易；太初生火，有氣未有形，曰太初；太始生木，有形未有質，曰太始；太素生金，有質未有體，曰太素；太極生土，形體已具，乃曰太極。所以水數一、火數二、木數三、金數四、土數五。迨夫三元既極，混沌一判，胚腪乃分，輕清爲天，重濁爲地，二氣相成，兩儀既生，化而成天。其始也，或人形鳥喙，或人首蛇身，無嗜慾、無姓名、無邦國、無君臣，巢處穴居，任其風雨，親疏同途，莫知其父子。五穀未植，飲血茹毛，其名蕩蕩，其樂陶陶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-001", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/001/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_001.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-001-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論五行所生之始", "text_id": "YHZP-T-001-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "及其聖賢一出，謂伏義、神農、黃帝也，智愚兩分，遂有君臣父子之分，禮樂衣冠之制。嗚呼！大道廢而奸詐生，妖怪出，是時天開於子、地闢於丑、人生於寅，始立天地之義，萬物生焉，奸詐並起，妖怪騰出。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-001", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/001/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_001.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-002-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天干地支所出", "text_id": "YHZP-T-002-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "竊以奸詐生、妖怪出。黃帝時有蚩尤神擾亂，當是之時，黃帝甚憂民之苦，遂戰蚩尤於涿鹿之野。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-002", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/002/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_002.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-002-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天干地支所出", "text_id": "YHZP-T-002-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：涿鹿，郡名。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-002", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/002/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_002.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-002-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天干地支所出", "text_id": "YHZP-T-002-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "流血百里，不能治之。時帝始制干戈刀劍之器，帝乃齋戒，築壇祀天，方丘禮地。天乃降十干，即甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛壬癸；十二支，即子丑寅卯辰巳午未申酉戌亥。帝乃將十干圓布象天形，十二支方布象地形，始以干爲天、支爲地，合光仰職，門放之，然後乃能治也。此十干十二支之所出也。自後有大撓氏，爲後人憂之曰：「嗟吁！黃帝乃聖人，尙不能治其惡煞，萬一後世見災被苦，將何奈乎？」遂將十干十二支分配成六十甲子云。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-002", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/002/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_002.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-002-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天干地支所出", "text_id": "YHZP-T-002-004", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "（页顶批）蚩尤善變，帝蚩尤姓姜，炎帝之臣，好兵喜亂，蚩尤暴虐於天下。妖怪蚩尤神。天圓地方之說始此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-002", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/002/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_002.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-003-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "天干相合", "text_id": "YHZP-T-003-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲與己合：甲屬木，己屬土，木以土爲妻財，所以得合。乙與庚合、丙與辛合、丁與壬合、戊與癸合，同上相合之義。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-003", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/003/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_003.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-004-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "十干所屬方位十二支所屬論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-004-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲乙木屬東方，寅卯辰之位爲東方青龍之象；丙丁火屬南方，巳午未之位爲南方朱雀之象；戊己土主中央，辰戌丑未位爲中央；庚辛金屬西方，申酉戌之位爲西方白虎之象；壬癸水屬北方，亥子丑之位爲北方玄武之象。是時大撓氏雖以甲乙屬木、丙丁屬火、戊己屬土、庚辛屬金、壬癸屬水。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-004", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/004/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_004.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-004-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "十干所屬方位十二支所屬論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-004-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：支元寅卯屬木，巳午屬火，申酉屬金，亥子屬水，辰戌丑未屬土。其理何義？或曰：東方有神太昊，乘震執規，司春，生仁風和氣，萬物發生，所以木居之，故甲乙寅卯同也。南方有神炎帝，乘離執衡，司夏，生炎陽酷氣，萬物至此咸齊，所以火居之，故丙丁巳午同也。夏天主長育萬物，草木茂盛，咸賴火德之功也。西方有神少昊，乘兌執矩，司秋，生肅殺靜氣，萬物到此收斂，所以金居之，故庚辛申酉同也。草木凋零，成熟收斂之時。北方有神顓帝，乘坎執權，司冬，生凝結嚴氣，萬物到此藏伏，所以水居之，故壬癸亥子同也。中央有神黃帝，乘坤執繩，司中土，況木火金水皆不可無土，故將戊己居中，辰戌丑未散四維，各得所主。四維今春三月、夏六月、秋九月、冬十二月。何公論曰：天若無土不能圓蓋於上，地若無土不能厚載於下，五穀不生，人若無土不能營運於中。此所以五行皆不可無土，土居中央，支散四維，建立五行而成也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-004", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/004/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_004.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-004-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "十干所屬方位十二支所屬論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-004-003", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "（页顶批）太昊伏羲氏木主仁，子平云木盛多仁；炎帝神農氏火主禮；少昊黃帝之子元囂也金主義；顓帝高陽氏黃帝之孫水主智；土主信，土色黃，故以土鎮治天下，故曰黃帝。此論十干之所屬也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-004", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/004/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_004.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-006-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十二支六合", "text_id": "YHZP-T-006-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "子與丑合土，寅與亥合木，卯與戌合火，辰與酉合金，巳與申合水，午與未合。午太陽、未太陰也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-006", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/006/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_006.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-007-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十二支三合", "text_id": "YHZP-T-007-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "申子辰局，亥卯未局，寅午戌局，巳酉丑局。辰戌丑未，命以三合取用爲局，入格。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-007", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/007/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_007.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-008-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十二支相沖", "text_id": "YHZP-T-008-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "子午相沖，寅申相沖，卯酉相沖，巳亥相沖，丑未相沖。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-008", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/008/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_008.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-008-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十二支相沖", "text_id": "YHZP-T-008-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：子宮癸水，午宮丁火，水能剋火之故也；寅宮甲木，申宮庚金，因金剋木之故也。以支中暗害爲沖，餘倣此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-008", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/008/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_008.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-009-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十二支相穿", "text_id": "YHZP-T-009-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "子未相穿，丑午相穿，寅巳相穿，卯辰相穿，申亥相穿，酉戌相穿。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-009", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/009/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_009.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-010-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十二支相刑", "text_id": "YHZP-T-010-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "寅刑巳，巳刑申，申刑寅，爲恃勢；丑刑戌，戌刑未，未刑丑，爲無恩；子刑卯，卯刑子，爲無禮；辰午酉亥自刑之刑。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-010", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/010/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_010.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-011-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論干支字義", "text_id": "YHZP-T-011-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "蓋攷漢書曰：萬物初生，而後也，萬物壯實之形，故邦國圖籍曰成。丁，戊茂也，言物之茂盛，故漢志曰：孽戊於戌是也。己，紀也，言物有萬物初生曲孽而未伸也。丙，言萬物炳然著見。丁，言萬物壯實之形，故邦國圖籍曰成。戊，茂也，言物之茂盛。己，紀也，言物有形可紀識也。庚，堅強貌，言物收藏而有實也。辛，言萬物方盛而見制，故辛痛也。壬，妊也，陰陽之交，言物懷妊至子而萌也。癸者，冬時土既平，萬物可揆度也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-011", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/011/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_011.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-012-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十二支生肖", "text_id": "YHZP-T-012-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "子鼠、丑牛、寅虎、卯兔、辰龍、巳蛇、午馬、未羊、申猴、酉雞、戌犬、亥豬。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-012", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/012/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_012.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-012-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十二支生肖", "text_id": "YHZP-T-012-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：豈止十二不全者哉。子鼠以地支在下，各取其足爪於陰陽上分之。如子屬陽，上四刻昨夜之陰，下四刻今日之陽；鼠前足四爪象陰，後足五爪象陽，故也。丑屬陰，牛蹄分也；寅屬陽，虎有五爪；卯屬陰，兔缺唇。辰屬陽，乃龍五爪；巳屬陰，蛇舌分也；午屬陽，馬蹄圓；未屬陰，羊蹄分也；申屬陰，猴五爪；酉屬陰，雞四爪也；戌屬陰，狗五爪；亥屬陰，豬蹄分也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-012", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/012/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_012.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-013-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論六十花甲子納音并註解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-013-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫甲子者，始成於大撓氏，而納音成之於鬼谷子，象成於東方曼倩子。時曼倩子既成其象，因號曰花甲子。然甲子者，自子至亥十二宮，各有金木水火土之屬，始起於子是一陽，終於亥爲六陰。其五行所屬，但如人之世事也。何以謂之世事？大率五行金木水火土，在天爲五星，於地爲五嶽，於德爲五常。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-013", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/013/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_013.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-013-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論六十花甲子納音并註解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-013-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：五聲金爲角，木爲徵，水爲羽，火爲宮，土爲宮；於人爲五臟，其爲命也爲五行。是故甲子之屬，乃應之於命，則一世之事。故甲子納音，象之時聖人喻之，亦如人一世之事體也。一世之事者，宣聖所謂「三十而立，四十而不惑，五十而知天命，六十而耳順，七十而從心所欲」。其甲子之象，自子而至於亥，其理灼然而可見矣。且如子丑二位者，陰陽始孕，人在胞胎，物藏根核，未有涯際也；寅卯二位者，陰陽漸闢，人漸生長，物以拆甲，羣葩漸剖，如人將有立身也；辰巳二位，陰陽氣盛，物當華秀，人至三四十而有立身之地，進取之象；午未二位者，陰陽彰露，物色成齊，人至五六十，富貴貧賤可知，凡百興衰可見矣；申酉二位者，陰陽肅殺，物已收成，人已龜縮，各得其靜矣；戌亥二位者，陰陽閉塞，物氣歸根，人當休息，各有歸着也。但只詳此十二位先後，灼然可見於六十甲子，可以次第而知矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-013", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/013/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_013.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-013-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論六十花甲子納音并註解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-013-003", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "（页顶批）五行金木水火土，五常仁義禮智信，五臟心脾肝肺腎。其金形行水路，性弱體寒。批（逐句旁批）：始孕如婦人懷妊在腹；甲發芽，有藥滿有皮；蘭猶言花，有葩，禾有秀；立身言束帶立於朝，盛旺行道；五十六人之貴賤興衰於此可見；見至於七十，此待人精神衰弱，以待命數，感無能爲也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-013", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/013/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_013.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲子乙丑海中金：子屬水，又爲湖，又爲金水旺之地，兼金死墓於丑，水旺而金死墓，故曰海中之金也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：氣在包藏，使極則沉潛。其金形行水路，性剛體寒。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙寅丁卯爐中火：以寅爲三陽，卯爲四陽，火既得位，又爲寅卯之木以生之，此天堦開爐，首領爐生，故曰爐中火也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-004", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：天堦爲爐，陰陽爲炭。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "戊辰己巳大林木：以辰爲原野，巳爲六陽，木至六陽則枝葉茂，以茂盛之大林木而生原野之間，故曰大林木也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-006", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：聲播九天，陰生萬頃。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚午辛未路旁土：以未中之木生午之旺火，火旺則土於斯而受利，土之所生，未能育物，猶路旁土也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-008", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-008", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：壯以及時，乘厚載，木多不喜木。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/008", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-009", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-009", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "壬申癸酉劍鋒金：以申酉金之正位，臨官申、帝旺酉，金既生旺則誠剛矣，剛則無蹤於劍鋒，故曰劍鋒金也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/009", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-010", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-010", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：虹光射斗牛，白刃凝霜雪。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/010", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-011", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-011", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲戌乙亥山頭火：以戌亥爲天門，火照天門，其光至高，故曰山頭火也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/011", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-012", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-012", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：天門余照，山更落日清和，因以返照餘霞，木自餘光。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/012", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-013", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-013", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙子丁丑澗下水：以水旺於子、衰於丑，旺而反衰則不能爲江河，故曰澗下水也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/013", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-014", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-014", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：山環細浪，雪湧飛濤，源流三峽之傾，澗壑千尋之倒。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/014", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-015", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-015", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "戊寅己卯城頭土：以天干戊己屬土，寅爲艮山，土積而爲山，故曰城頭土也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/015", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-016", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-016", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：天京玉壘，帝里金城，龍蟠千里之形，虎踞四維之勢也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/016", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-017", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-017", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚辰辛巳白蟻金：以金養於辰、生於巳，形質初成，未能堅利，故曰白蟻金也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/017", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-018", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-018", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：氣漸發生，金弱在鑄，交樓日月之光，凝象陰陽之氣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/018", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-019", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-019", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "壬午癸未楊柳木：以木死於午、墓於未，木既死墓，得天干壬癸之水以生之，終是柔木，故曰楊柳木。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/019", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-020", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-020", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：萬棟不營之絲，千條不針之線。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/020", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-021", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-021", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲申乙酉泉中水：金臨官在申、帝旺在酉，金既生旺則水由以生，然方生之際力量未洪，故曰井泉水也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/021", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-022", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-022", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：氣息而靜，過而不竭，出而不竭。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/022", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-023", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-023", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙戌丁亥屋上土：以丙丁屬火，戌亥爲天門，火既炎上，則土非在下而生，故曰屋上土也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/023", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-024", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-024", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：以火木而生旺，是從增其勢，至於死絕，喜以安。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/024", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-025", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-025", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "戊子己丑霹靂火：丑屬土、子屬水，水居正位而納音乃火，水中之火，非龍神則無，故曰霹靂火。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/025", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-026", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-026", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：電掣金蛇之勢，雲驅鐵騎之奔，變化之氣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/026", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-027", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-027", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚寅辛卯松柏木：以木臨官在寅、帝旺在卯，木既生旺則非柔弱之比，故曰松柏木也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/027", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-028", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-028", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：揚雪凌霜，參天獨立，風撼奏笙簧，雨餘張旌旗。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/028", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-029", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-029", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "壬辰癸巳長流水：辰爲水庫，巳爲金長生之地，金則生水，水性已存，以庫水而逢生金，泉源終不竭，故曰長流水也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/029", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-030", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-030", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：勢居東南，貴安靜。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/030", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-031", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-031", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲午乙未沙中金：午爲火旺之地，火旺則金敗；未爲火衰之地，火衰則金冠帶。敗而方冠帶，未能研伐，故曰沙中金也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/031", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-032", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-032", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙申丁酉山下火：申爲地戶，酉爲日入之門，日至此時而藏光也，故曰山下火。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/032", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-033", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-033", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：酉沉兌位，復喜東南，出震明離，其光愈曄，曄暗惡火，明喜清。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/033", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-034", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-034", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "戊戌己亥平地木：戌爲原野，亥爲生木之地，夫木生於原野，則非一根一林之比，故曰平地木也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/034", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-035", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-035", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：惟資雨露之功，不喜雪霜之刑。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/035", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-036", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-036", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚子辛丑壁上土：丑雖土家正位，而子則水旺之地，土見水多則爲泥也，故曰壁上土也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/036", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-037", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-037", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：氣居閉塞，物尚包藏，掩形遮體，內外不及故也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/037", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-038", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-038", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "壬寅癸卯金箔金：寅卯爲木旺之地，木旺則金廢，且金絕於寅、胎於卯，乃金無力，故曰金箔金。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/038", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-039", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-039", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：木氣在寅則金爲絕地，薄若槁稿，乃云。其形金行水路，性剛體寒。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/039", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-040", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-040", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲辰乙巳覆燈火：辰爲食時，巳爲日中，日之將午，陽之盛，光於天下，故曰覆燈火。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/040", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-041", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-041", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：金盞搖光，玉臺吐蛇，照日月不照，蔑明於天地未明時，猶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/041", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-042", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-042", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙午丁未天河水：丙丁陽火，午爲火旺地，而納音乃水，水自火出，非銀漢之功能有也，故曰天河水。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/042", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-043", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-043", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：氣當升隆，沛然作霖，生旺有濟物之功。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/043", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-044", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-044", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "戊申己酉大驛土：申爲坤，坤爲地；酉爲兌，兌爲澤。戊己之土加於坤澤之上，非其他浮薄之土，故曰大驛土。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/044", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-045", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-045", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：氣以歸息，物當收斂，故云。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/045", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-046", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-046", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚戌辛亥釵釧金：金至戌而衰、至亥而病，金旣衰病則誠柔矣，故曰釵釧金。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/046", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-047", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-047", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：形已成器，華飾光發，厭乎生旺，貴乎藏體，火盛傷形，終爲不喜。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/047", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-048", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-048", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "壬子癸丑桑柘木：子屬水、丑屬金，火方生木，金則伐之，猶桑柘方生人便以伐，故曰桑柘木也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/048", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-049", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-049", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：氣居盤屈，居於水地，未施刀斧之勞，故無功未得主。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/049", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-050", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-050", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲寅乙卯大溪水：寅爲東旺，卯爲正東，水流正東，則其性順而川濁池沼俱合而得效，曰大溪水。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/050", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-051", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-051", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：氣出陽明，水勢恃源，東流滔注，故云。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/051", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-052", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-052", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙辰丁巳沙中土：土庫在辰而絕在巳，丙丁火至辰而臨官、在巳既庫絕，旺火復興之，故曰沙中土。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/052", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-053", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-053", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：土冠帶而疏氣，故不宜。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/053", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-054", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-054", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "戊午己未天上火：天上火，古本作炎上火，火性炎上，逢生地，故土爲火旺之地，未中木能相食，炳靈交光，發焰上，故云天上火。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/054", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-055", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-055", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：炎上火，火作天火，又復生之火性炎上。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/055", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-056", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-056", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚申辛酉石榴木：申爲七月、酉爲八月，此時則絕矣，惟石榴之木復實，故曰石榴木。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/056", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-057", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-057", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：氣歸靜肅，物漸成實，木居金生，其味秋果成實云。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/057", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-058", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-058", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "壬戌癸亥大海水：水冠帶在戌、臨官在亥，水則力厚矣，兼亥爲江，非他水之比，故曰大海水。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/058", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-014-059", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "納音三十組注解", "text_id": "YHZP-T-014-059", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：門歷事畢，生旺不泛，死絕不涸云。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-014", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/014/059", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_014.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-015-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天干生旺死絕", "text_id": "YHZP-T-015-001", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "（卷页有掌诀图，十干十二支生旺死絕掌诀图）", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-015", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/015/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_015.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-015-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天干生旺死絕", "text_id": "YHZP-T-015-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲木生亥，沐浴在子，冠帶在丑，建祿在寅，帝旺在卯，衰在辰，病在巳，死在午，墓在未，絕在申，胎在酉，養在戌。乙木生午，沐浴在巳，冠帶在辰，建祿在卯，帝旺在寅，衰在丑，病在子，死在亥，墓在戌，絕在酉，胎在申，養在未。丙火生寅，沐浴在卯，冠帶在辰，建祿在巳，帝旺在午，衰在未，病在申，死在酉，墓在戌，絕在亥，胎在子，養在丑。丁火生酉，沐浴在申，冠帶在未，建祿在午，帝旺在巳，衰在辰，病在卯，死在寅，墓在丑，絕在子，胎在亥，養在戌。戊土生寅，沐浴在卯，冠帶在辰，建祿在巳，帝旺在午，衰在未，病在申，死在酉，墓在戌，絕在亥，胎在子，養在丑。己土生酉，沐浴在申，冠帶在未，建祿在午，帝旺在巳，衰在辰，病在卯，死在寅，墓在丑，絕在子，胎在亥，養在戌。庚金生巳，沐浴在午，冠帶在未，建祿在申，帝旺在酉，衰在戌，病在亥，死在子，墓在丑，絕在寅，胎在卯，養在辰。辛金生子，沐浴在亥，冠帶在戌，建祿在酉，帝旺在申，衰在未，病在午，死在巳，墓在辰，絕在卯，胎在寅，養在丑。壬水生申，沐浴在酉，冠帶在戌，建祿在亥，帝旺在子，衰在丑，病在寅，死在卯，墓在辰，絕在巳，胎在午，養在未。癸水生卯，沐浴在寅，冠帶在丑，建祿在子，帝旺在亥，衰在戌，病在酉，死在申，墓在未，絕在午，胎在巳，養在辰。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-015", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/015/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_015.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-015-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天干生旺死絕", "text_id": "YHZP-T-015-003", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：陽生陰死，陽死陰生，循環無窮。如甲木生亥、乙木生午，順逆之別也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-015", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/015/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_015.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-016-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "五行發用定例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-016-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "長生、沐浴、冠帶、臨官、帝旺、衰、病、死、墓庫、絕、胎、養。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-016", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/016/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_016.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-016-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "五行發用定例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-016-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：但臨官長生爲冠帶，但臨長生爲沐浴，但臨沐浴爲冠帶，但臨冠帶爲帝旺，但臨帝旺爲衰，但臨衰爲病，但臨病爲死，但臨死爲墓，但臨墓爲絕，但臨絕爲胎，但臨胎爲養，但臨養爲長生。陰陽順逆生旺死絕之圖。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-016", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/016/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_016.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-017-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日上起時例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-017-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲己還加甲，乙庚丙作初，丙辛從戊起，丁壬庚子居，戊癸何方發，壬子是真途。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-017", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/017/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_017.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-017-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日上起時例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-017-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：其法以甲己日從子上起甲子，至人本生時止，餘皆倣此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-017", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/017/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_017.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-018-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論年上起月例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-018-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲己之年丙作首，乙庚之歲戊爲頭，丙辛之歲尋庚上，丁壬壬位順行流，若言戊癸何方發，甲寅之上好追求。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-018", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/018/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_018.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-018-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論年上起月例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-018-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：其法假如甲己年生，寅上起丙寅，以正月爲丙寅，二月爲丁卯，一順數去。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-018", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/018/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_018.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-019-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論起胎法", "text_id": "YHZP-T-019-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "胎元受胎之月也。子平有曰：「先推胎息之由，次斷變通之理。」精命者不可不用此例也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-019", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/019/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_019.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-019-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論起胎法", "text_id": "YHZP-T-019-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：推法但從本生月前四位是也。其法如己巳月，則前申上是胎，卻數退回一位於未上，將生月天干己字喚起己未，數至庚申，乃是受胎之月也，餘皆倣此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-019", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/019/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_019.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-020-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論起息法", "text_id": "YHZP-T-020-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "取日主上天干合處、地支合處是也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-020", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/020/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_020.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-020-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論起息法", "text_id": "YHZP-T-020-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：假如甲子日生人，天干年月時有己字，乃甲與己合；又取地支年月時有丑字，卽己丑也。餘倣此例而推。此胎息之由。取時上天干合處、時下地支合處。如柱中天干無辛字、地支無亥字，乃只虛邀爲是，不可拘攬。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-020", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/020/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_020.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-021-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論起通法", "text_id": "YHZP-T-021-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "假如甲子月寅時生，卯上安命，取「甲己之年丙作首」起丙寅，即丁卯是通。通者，通月中之通，而未相氣相通也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-021", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/021/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_021.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-021-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論起通法", "text_id": "YHZP-T-021-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：其法寅卯相通、辰巳相通、午未相通、申酉相通、戌亥相通、子丑相通是也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-021", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/021/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_021.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-022-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論起玉堂天乙貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-022-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲戊庚牛羊，乙己鼠猴鄉，丙丁豬雞位，壬癸兔蛇藏，六辛逢馬虎，此是貴人方，命中如遇此，定作紫微郎。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-022", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/022/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_022.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-022-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論起玉堂天乙貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-022-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：十干臨十支，皆貴人所臨之方，惟辰戌二宮貴人不臨。何也？殊不知辰戌乃魁罡惡煞之地，天乙不臨，所以不爲貴也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-022", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/022/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_022.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-023-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "起天官貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-023-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "天官遁甲入羊羣，乙誨青龍事可陳，丙見巳兮爲官貴，丁見酉兮戊。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-023", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/023/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_023.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-023-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "起天官貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-023-002", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：天官要天元清秀，不反傷納音。批：貴人乃上天之神，故曰太陽所臨之方，有惡煞相渾，神之落空亡之地，不爲貴也。批：通者，通月中之氣而相貫串，而實卯未氣相通。批：此等法例，時師罕見，不知此義，安能與士大夫談命哉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-023", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/023/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_023.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-024-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論太極貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-024-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲乙生人子午中，丙丁雞兔定亨通，戊己兩干臨四季，庚辛寅卯祿盈豐，壬癸巳申偏喜美，值此應當福氣鍾。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-024", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/024/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_024.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-025-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論三奇貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-025-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "天上三奇甲戊庚，地下三奇乙丙丁，人中三奇壬癸辛。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-025", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/025/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_025.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-025-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論三奇貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-025-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：甲戊庚者，以甲爲日、以戊爲月、以庚爲星。既有日月星，須得戌亥爲天門，方得爲奇。若無戌亥，須有日月星而無天門，則不奇矣。而有天門，若有丑卯酉巳，又不爲奇。寅中有箕星好風，酉中有畢宿主雨，丑卯爲風雷，則三光失明，奇不得時也。地下三奇，以乙爲君，丁爲陰火之相，此地有之爲奇。須用乙，乙屬坤土，若無則不吉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-025", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/025/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_025.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-026-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論月德貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-026-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "寅午戌月在丙，申子辰月在壬，亥卯未月在甲，巳酉丑月在庚。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-026", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/026/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_026.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-026-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論月德貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-026-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：其法從寅上起丙甲壬庚，逐月順數，周而復始，亦須在日上見之，更有福神助爲吉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-026", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/026/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_026.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-027-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論月德合", "text_id": "YHZP-T-027-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "寅午戌月在辛，申子辰月在丁，亥卯未月在己，巳酉丑月在乙。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-027", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/027/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_027.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-027-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論月德合", "text_id": "YHZP-T-027-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：其法從寅上起辛丁乙，逐位順數。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-027", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/027/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_027.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-028-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天德貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-028-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "正丁二坤中，三人四辛同，五乾六甲上，七癸八寅同，九丙十歸乙，子巽丑庚中。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-028", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/028/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_028.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-028-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天德貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-028-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：其法以生月分取之，正月生人見丁，二月見申，即是也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-028", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/028/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_028.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-029-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論福星貴人", "text_id": "YHZP-T-029-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲丙相邀入虎鄉，更逢鼠穴最高強，戊猴己未乙丁亥，丙人惟喜戌中藏，庚趁馬頭辛到巳，壬騎龍背喜非常，更有丁人愛尋酉，癸乙宜牛祿自昌。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-029", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/029/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_029.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-030-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論三元", "text_id": "YHZP-T-030-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "假令甲子，以甲木爲天元，子爲地元，子中所藏癸水爲人元。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-030", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/030/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_030.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-031-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十干祿", "text_id": "YHZP-T-031-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲祿在寅，乙祿在卯，丙戊祿在巳，丁己祿在午，庚祿在申，辛祿在酉，壬祿在亥，癸祿在子。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-031", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/031/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_031.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-031-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十干祿", "text_id": "YHZP-T-031-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：夫祿者，以天干地支所旺之鄉。如甲祿在寅，乃東方甲乙之地支辰寅卯配之，餘皆同此。辰戌丑未乃魁罡惡殺，祿神不臨也。凡人命帶祿，或吉或凶、或貴或賤，何以論之？天乙妙旨云：祿馬貴人無準托，考究五行之善惡。天元贏弱未爲災，地氣堅牢足備藥。源鑑歌曰：祿馬更有多般說，自衰自死兼敗絕。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-031", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/031/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_031.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-032-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "日主橫看十神定例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-032-001", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "（p36–37 十干配十神表，日主橫看。）", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-032", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/032/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_032.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-032-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "日主橫看十神定例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-032-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "日主橫看（甲）（丙）（戊）（庚）（壬）：", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-032", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/032/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_032.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-032-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "日主橫看十神定例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-032-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "| 日主 | 陽干 | 陰干 | 陰陽干 ||------|------|------|--------|| 甲丙戊庚壬 | 甲丙戊庚壬 | 乙丁己辛癸 | 丙戊庚壬甲 |", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-032", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/032/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_032.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-032-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "日主橫看十神定例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-032-004", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "五干屬陽喜合：爲比肩兄弟之類；爲劫財敗財尅父及妻；爲食神天廚壽星爲男。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-032", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/032/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_032.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-032-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "日主橫看十神定例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-032-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "日主橫看（乙）（丁）（己）（辛）（癸）：", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-032", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/032/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_032.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-032-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "日主橫看十神定例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-032-006", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "| 日主 | 十神 | 斷語 ||------|------|------|| 丁己辛癸乙 | 傷官 | 退財耗氣，子甥 || 戊庚壬甲丙 | 偏財 | 偏妻偏妾，尅子 || 己辛癸乙丁 | 正財 | 正妻，尅母爲合神 || 庚壬甲丙戊 | 偏官 | 七煞官鬼，將星 || 辛癸乙丁己 | 正官 | 祿馬榮神，父母 || 壬甲丙戊庚 | 倒食 | 偏印梟神，尅女 || 癸乙丁己辛 | 印綬 | 正人君子，產業 || 乙丁己辛癸 | 比肩 | 兄弟朋友 |", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-032", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/032/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_032.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-032-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "日主橫看十神定例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-032-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "五干屬陰喜冲：丙戊庚壬甲 爲傷官，小人盜氣，爲姪。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-032", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/032/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_032.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段内嵌现代【校记/存疑】标记，原文与校勘混排；已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著；text_layer UNVERIFIED→ORIGINAL：剥离校記后为纯原著正文", "evidence_grade": "A"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-033-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論驛馬", "text_id": "YHZP-T-033-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "申子辰馬在寅，寅午戌馬在申，巳酉丑馬在亥，亥卯未馬在巳。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-033", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/033/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_033.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-033-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論驛馬", "text_id": "YHZP-T-033-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：其法以水生申，病寅，木生木，爲水子，此乃病處見子來相接，如人病不諳進，待子來接之，如驛馬來接，餘倣此推。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-033", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/033/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_033.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-034-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天赦", "text_id": "YHZP-T-034-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "春戊寅，夏甲午，秋戊申，冬甲子。凡人生日干遇之方得用。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-034", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/034/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_034.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-034-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天赦", "text_id": "YHZP-T-034-002", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：此星解人災禍。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-034", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/034/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_034.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-035-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論華蓋", "text_id": "YHZP-T-035-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "寅午戌見戌，巳酉丑見丑，申子辰見辰，亥卯未見未。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-035", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/035/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_035.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-035-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論華蓋", "text_id": "YHZP-T-035-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：華蓋本爲吉，凡人命中得之，多主孤寡縱貴，亦不免爲孤獨也。遇之者多爲僧道術。壺中子曰：華蓋爲藝術之星，主孤。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-035", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/035/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_035.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-036-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十干學堂", "text_id": "YHZP-T-036-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "金生人見巳，辛巳爲正；木生人見亥，己亥爲正；水生人見申，甲申爲正；土生人見申，戊申爲正；火生人見寅，丙寅爲正。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-036", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/036/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_036.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-037-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十干食祿", "text_id": "YHZP-T-037-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲食丙，乙食丁，丙食戊，丁食己，戊食庚，己食辛，庚食壬，辛食癸，壬食甲，癸食乙。歌曰：時人欲識食神名，甲人食丙乙人丁，丙食戊兮丁食己，己食辛兮戊食庚，庚壬辛癸偏相喜，壬甲癸乙最光榮。若遇食神騎祿馬，必居豪富立功名。不食空亡羊刃煞，不食休囚并死絕，食生食旺食貴神，食印食財別優劣。若能推究得其真，祿食天厨無休歇。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-037", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/037/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_037.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-038-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論金輿祿", "text_id": "YHZP-T-038-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "十干祿前第二位是也。如甲祿在寅，辰上是也，餘皆倣此而推。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-038", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/038/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_038.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-039-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論拱祿", "text_id": "YHZP-T-039-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "假如戊辰生人見丙午，丙午生人見戊辰，丁巳生人見己未，己未生人見丁巳，前後相拱，只此四位，其餘不是。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-039", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/039/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_039.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-040-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論交祿", "text_id": "YHZP-T-040-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "假如甲申生人見甲寅，庚寅生人見甲申，是甲祿在寅、庚祿居申，互換往來。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-040", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/040/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_040.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-041-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論暗祿", "text_id": "YHZP-T-041-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "假如甲生人逢亥，是甲祿在寅，寅與亥合；乙生人逢戌，是乙祿在卯，卯與戌合是也，其餘倣此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-041", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/041/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_041.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-042-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論夾祿", "text_id": "YHZP-T-042-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "假如甲生人遇丑卯，是甲祿在寅，前有卯、後有丑；乙生人遇寅辰，是乙祿在卯，前有辰、後有寅，他倣此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-042", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/042/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_042.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-043-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論垣城", "text_id": "YHZP-T-043-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "垣城者，主有淫。其法取日上天干長生是也。如甲日生長生在亥，即亥是也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-043", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/043/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_043.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-044-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論帝座", "text_id": "YHZP-T-044-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "其法取時上納音旺處是也。如甲子時納音屬金，金旺於酉，即酉上是也，其餘倣此。帝座主見女宮也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-044", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/044/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_044.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-045-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論六甲空亡（一名天中煞）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-045-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲子旬中無戌亥，甲戌旬中無申酉，甲申旬中無午未，甲午旬中無辰巳，甲辰旬中無寅卯，甲寅旬中無子丑。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-045", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/045/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_045.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-045-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論六甲空亡（一名天中煞）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-045-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：甲子屬金，至酉而十干足矣，以獨無戌亥，是爲空亡。陽宮爲空，陰宮爲亡，是戌爲空、亥爲亡。對宮辰巳爲孤虛，餘並倣此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-045", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/045/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_045.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-046-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論截路空亡", "text_id": "YHZP-T-046-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲己申酉最爲愁，乙庚午未不須求，丙辛辰巳何勞問，丁壬寅卯一場空，戊癸子丑君須記，人生值此也多憂，忽然更得胎中遇，白髮盤簪苦未休。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-046", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/046/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_046.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-046-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論截路空亡", "text_id": "YHZP-T-046-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：以日取時見之方是，以年在日時論者非也。甲己日通十二時中有申酉二時，上見壬癸爲水，故甲己見申酉是也，餘皆倣此。假如甲子日見申酉時，乃爲正犯，其餘者見之非也。此空亡非但命中見之不美，以至百事損一。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-046", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/046/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_046.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-047-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論四大空亡", "text_id": "YHZP-T-047-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲子并甲午，旬中水絕流；甲寅與甲申，金氣杳難求。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-047", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/047/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_047.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-047-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論四大空亡", "text_id": "YHZP-T-047-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：六甲中只有甲辰甲戌二旬之中有金木水火土全。甲子甲午旬中無水，甲寅甲申旬中無金。甲子甲午旬主人生見水者，謂之正犯，如生命中不犯，亦主夭折。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-047", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/047/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_047.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-048-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十惡大敗日", "text_id": "YHZP-T-048-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲辰乙巳與壬申，丙申丁亥及庚辰，戊戌癸亥加辛巳，乙丑都來十位神。邦國用兵須大忌，龍蛇出穴也難伸。人命若遇逢此日，倉庫金銀化作塵。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-048", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/048/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_048.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-048-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論十惡大敗日", "text_id": "YHZP-T-048-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：謂之大敗，故曰十惡大敗也。謂六甲旬中有十個日值祿入空亡，此十日皆可犯。以寅爲十惡之若，卯爲吉神之扶，辰爲祿入空亡，巳爲甲辰乙巳者敗，午爲申戌，申戌爲十惡之空亡，以此推之，餘皆倣此，故曰十惡大敗日。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-048", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/048/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_048.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-049-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論四廢日", "text_id": "YHZP-T-049-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "春庚申，夏壬子，秋甲寅，冬丙午。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-049", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/049/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_049.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-049-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論四廢日", "text_id": "YHZP-T-049-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：春庚申死金，夏壬子水死囚，秋甲寅木死囚，冬丙午火死囚，因死囚而無用謂之廢。春乃木神用事，金囚而無用，故以庚金爲廢；夏之火旺，而壬水爲廢；秋用金，而甲木爲廢；冬用水，而丙火爲廢。凡命中既有之，十神對取其吉凶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-049", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/049/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_049.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-050-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天地轉殺", "text_id": "YHZP-T-050-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "春兔夏馬天地轉，秋雞冬鼠便爲殃，行人在路須憂死，造屋未成先架喪。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-050", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/050/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_050.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-050-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天地轉殺", "text_id": "YHZP-T-050-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：物極而反謂之轉。春見卯乃天轉，連納音曰天轉，謂之地轉，如木旺時見乙丙爲天轉，地轉謂之地轉；如夏乃旺時見乙丙爲天轉，戊子午爲天地轉；秋見辛卯乃連納音地轉，見辛酉爲轉，見癸酉爲；冬轉旺見水午爲天轉，金旺見辛酉爲轉，見丙納音爲見其。日最忌上官受職出賈，嫁娶必主凶，命逢此日必主夭折。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-050", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/050/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_050.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-050-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天地轉殺", "text_id": "YHZP-T-050-003", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：春乙卯天轉、夏丙午天轉、秋辛酉地轉、冬壬子地轉。春見丙爲天轉，夏見反謂，秋旺時見水，冬轉旺見午。經曰：丙丁被誅，只信子地轉殺。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-050", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/050/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_050.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-051-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天羅地網", "text_id": "YHZP-T-051-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "辰爲天羅，戌爲地網，又爲魁罡所占，天乙不臨之地也。向以見辰與亥爲天羅，辰與巳爲地網。凡火命人逢戌亥是爲天羅，水土命人逢辰巳是地網。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-051", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/051/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_051.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-051-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天羅地網", "text_id": "YHZP-T-051-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：行墓絕處也，乃暗昧不明之謂也。女命無忌於地網，多主蹇滯，加惡必之至於死亡。人生忌入於地網，男子忌於天羅。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-051", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/051/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_051.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-051-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天羅地網", "text_id": "YHZP-T-051-003", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：戌亥爲天羅、辰爲地網，火命人犯辰巳、水土命犯戌亥，男女忌忌不同，要分春夏秋四季看方準。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-051", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/051/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_051.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-052-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論羊刃", "text_id": "YHZP-T-052-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "陰飛羊刃，對宮即飛刃。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-052", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/052/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_052.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-052-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論羊刃", "text_id": "YHZP-T-052-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲生人羊刃在卯，酉刃飛；乙生人羊刃在辰，戌刃飛；丙生人羊刃在午，子刃飛；丁生人羊刃在未，丑刃飛；戊生人羊刃在午，子刃飛；己生人羊刃在未，丑刃飛；庚生人羊刃在酉，卯刃飛；辛生人羊刃在戌，辰刃飛；壬生人羊刃在子，午刃飛；癸生人羊刃在丑，未刃飛。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-052", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/052/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_052.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-053-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論行小運法", "text_id": "YHZP-T-053-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "凡小運不問陰陽二命，男一歲起丙寅，二歲丁卯順行（截法），十二丙子，二十一丙戌，周而復始；女一歲起壬申，二歲辛未逆行（截法），一歲壬申，十二壬戌，二十一壬子，周而復始。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-053", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/053/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_053.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-053-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論行小運法", "text_id": "YHZP-T-053-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：皆倣此。陰男陽女逆運。假如乙丑年，乙庚之歲戊爲頭，正月起戊寅，初一日立春後十五日生男，逆數至初一立春節止，得五十日，五日起五歲運，逆行丁丑。如甲子年，甲己之年丙作首，正月丙寅，初一立春後十日生女，逆數至初一日立春止，得九日，三三覃九日起三歲運，逆行乙丑。餘皆倣此。若多一日減一日，少一日增一日。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-053", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/053/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_053.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-054-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論五行相生相尅", "text_id": "YHZP-T-054-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "論五行相生：金生水，水生木，木生火，火生土，土生金。論五行相尅：金尅木，木尅土，土尅水，水尅火，火尅金。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-054", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/054/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_054.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-054-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論五行相生相尅", "text_id": "YHZP-T-054-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：生我者爲父母，我生者爲子孫，尅我者爲官鬼，我尅者爲妻財，比和者爲兄弟。詳五陽五陰。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-054", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/054/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_054.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-055-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論節候歌", "text_id": "YHZP-T-055-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "正月立春雨水節，二月驚蟄及春分，三月清明併穀雨，四月立夏小滿方，五月芒種併夏至，六月小暑大暑當，七月立秋還處暑，八月白露秋分忙，九月寒露又霜降，十月立冬小雪張，子月大雪冬至節，丑月小寒大寒昌。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-055", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/055/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_055.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-056-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論天地干支暗藏總訣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-056-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "立春念三丙火用，餘日甲木旺提綱；驚蟄乙木未用事，春分乙未正相當；清明乙木十日管，後來八日癸水洋；穀雨前三戊土盛，其中土旺要消詳；立夏又代戊土取，小滿過午丙火光；芒種己土相當好，中停七日土高張；夏至陰生陽極利，丙丁火旺有土張；小暑十日丁火旺，後來三日乙木芳，己土三日威風盛，大暑己土十日黃；立秋十日壬水漲，處暑十五庚金良；白露七日庚金旺，八日辛兮祇獨行；寒露七日辛金管，八日丁火又水降；霜降己土十五日，其中雜氣取無妨；立冬七日癸水旺，壬水八日更流忙；小雪七日壬水急，八日甲木又芬芳；大雪七日壬水管，冬至癸水更潺汪；小寒七日癸水養，八日辛金五庫藏；大寒十日己土勝。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-056", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/056/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_056.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-057-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "又論節氣歌", "text_id": "YHZP-T-057-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "看命先須看日主，八字始能究奧理。假如子上十日壬，中旬下旬方是癸；丑宮九日癸之餘，除却三辛皆屬己；寅宮戊丙各七朝，十六甲木方堪器；卯宮陽木朝初旬，中下兩旬陰木是；三月九朝仍是乙，三日癸庫餘戊奇；初夏九日生庚金，十六丙火五戊時；午宮陽火屬上旬，丁火十日九日己；未宮九日丁火明，三朝是乙餘是己；孟秋己七戊三朝，三壬十七庚金備；酉宮還有十日庚，二十辛金屬旺地；戌宮九日辛金勝，三丁十八戊土具；亥宮七戊五日甲，餘皆壬旺君須記。須知得一擬三分，此訣先賢與驗秘。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-057", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/057/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_057.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-058-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "又地支藏遁歌", "text_id": "YHZP-T-058-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "子宮癸水在其中，丑癸辛金己土同；寅宮甲木兼丙戊，卯宮乙木獨相逢；辰藏乙戊三分癸，巳中庚金丙戊叢；午宮丁火并己土，未宮乙己丁共宗；申位庚金壬水戊，酉宮辛金獨豐隆；戌宮辛金及丁戊，亥藏壬甲是真踪。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-058", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/058/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_058.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-059-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論四季大節訣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-059-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "今歲要知來年春，但加五日三時辰；立春三日便逢秋，隔岸退位夏；更臨再過三朝冬又到，六郎又去打春牛。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-059", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/059/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_059.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-059-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論四季大節訣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-059-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此法如嘉靖十九年戊申年臘十二月十七日甲子午時立春，是二十年令。餘令要知來年春，但加五日三時辰，如甲子日立春至己巳日立春，便足五日三時辰，本年十二月二十八日己巳酉時交春。二十二年節，立春三日便逢秋，甲子日春至丁卯日丑時是三日六個時辰，六月二十四日丁卯丑時交秋。隔岸退位夏，丁卯日秋對丁酉，乃是隔岸，天干不加，卯中是守申一立。乙未日酉時是三月二十七日，立春無氣則謂之閏。二十三朝冬又到，或二日乙未日，夏戊戌巳時，冬至九月二十六日戊戌巳時立冬。年年以立春爲主，餘皆倣此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-059", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/059/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_059.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-060-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論未來月朔節氣奧歌", "text_id": "YHZP-T-060-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "月朔原來自古有，前九將來對後九；大月五干連九支，小月四干八支偶；六六之年仔細思，任君走盡風寒路。便做今年立春數，算來又本無差誤；四十七年前有閏，閏前二月是今逢；分毫不漏眞消息，盡在先生掌訣中。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-060", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/060/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_060.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-060-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論未來月朔節氣奧歌", "text_id": "YHZP-T-060-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：但氣中無所逢。閏之前之月中氣在晦，閏後之月中氣在朔，無氣則謂之閏月。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-060", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/060/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_060.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-061-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論截流年節氣日時刻數要訣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-061-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "審詳春日莫他求，時正刻真節自酬；五時二刻驚蟄是，十時四刻清明頭；立夏一日三時六，芒種一日九時收；二日二時二小暑，二日七時四刻秋；白露三朝畢六刻，寒露三朝六時遇；立冬三朝十二二，大雪四四雨雙流；小寒四時九時六，五日三時打春牛。節遇子時加一日，此爲捷法記心頭。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-061", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/061/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_061.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-062-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日爲主", "text_id": "YHZP-T-062-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "予嘗觀唐書所載，有李虛中者，取人所生年月日時干支生尅，論命之貴賤壽夭之說，已詳之矣。至於宋時方有子平之說，取日干爲主，以年爲根、以月爲苗、以日爲花、以時爲果，以生旺死絕休囚制化決人生休咎，其理必然矣，復有何疑哉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-062", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/062/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_062.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-062-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日爲主", "text_id": "YHZP-T-062-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "一曰官，分之陰陽曰官曰殺。甲乙見庚辛也，甲見庚爲殺，陽見辛爲官也，官陽見陰；乙木庚爲官，見辛爲殺，乙見庚爲官，陰見陽爲殺。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-062", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/062/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_062.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-062-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日爲主", "text_id": "YHZP-T-062-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "二曰財，分之陰陽曰正財偏財。甲乙見戊己是也，陰見陰爲正財，陽見陽爲偏財。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-062", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/062/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_062.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-062-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日爲主", "text_id": "YHZP-T-062-004", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "三曰生氣之陰陽曰印綬曰倒食。甲乙見壬癸是也，甲見癸、乙見壬爲印綬也，乙見癸爲偏印。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-062", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/062/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_062.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-062-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日爲主", "text_id": "YHZP-T-062-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "四曰竊氣之陰陽曰食神曰傷官。甲乙見丙丁是也，甲見丙爲食神，乙見丁爲食神；甲見丁爲傷官，乙見丙爲傷官。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-062", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/062/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_062.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-062-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日爲主", "text_id": "YHZP-T-062-006", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "五曰同類之陰陽曰劫財曰羊刃。甲乙見甲乙是也，陽見陽爲羊刃，陰見陰爲羊刃。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-062", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/062/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_062.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-062-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日爲主", "text_id": "YHZP-T-062-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "大抵貴賤壽夭死生皆不出於五者。倘有妄立格局，從列其名而無實用，其飛天祿馬、倒沖井欄，又即傷官析而爲之，舉此一端，餘可知矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-062", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/062/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_062.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-063-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論月令（出淵源）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-063-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "以日干爲主，年爲本，月爲提綱，時爲輔佐。以日主大要看日加臨於甚度，或身旺或身弱，又看地支有何格局，金木水火土之數，後看月令中金木水火土何者旺，又看歲運有何旺，却次日下消詳，此非是拘之一隅之說也。且如甲子日生，四柱中有個申字，合用子辰爲水局，次看餘辰有何損益，四柱中有何字損其甲子日主之秀氣，有壞其用神，則要別制之，不要益之。論命者切不可泥之月令消詳，故表而出之。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-063", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/063/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_063.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-063-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論月令（出淵源）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-063-002", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：以日干爲主人之己，年干爲甲母，月支爲印，日干爲甲，年干爲兄，比肩及支，時干爲妻，女命爲子。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-063", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/063/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_063.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-064-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論生旺", "text_id": "YHZP-T-064-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "常法以金生巳、木生亥、水生申、火生寅，土居中央寄母生，如戊在巳、己在午。又土爲四季各旺一十八日，共七十二日，并金木水火土各七十二日，共得三百六十日以成歲功，此良法也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-064", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/064/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_064.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-065-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "又論五行生旺衰絕吉凶（淵源）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-065-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "觀陰陽家書有曰：生旺有陰死陽生、陽死陰生。假如甲木生於亥而死於午，乙木生於午而死於亥，餘同此例，故命十有九失，又非的法也。如論命豈可拘於生旺之說？且丙寅屬火，而絕於亥，本爲不好，孰不知亥中有木爲印綬而生丙火，丙日亥時乃多貴格；亦戊屬土而旺於巳，兼又建祿，本作貴格，孰不知巳反生金之地而傷官星，凡戊日巳時官祿不顯。舉此一例，則論命切不可耑泥於生旺而吉、衰敗而凶也，又當以活法推之。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-065", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/065/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_065.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-066-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論五行墓庫財印（淵源）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-066-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙丁生人以辰庫官，水土庫於辰故也。須年月時中有木，或亥卯未并寅卻清；如無木，則土奪丙丁之官，則濁卑而不清，亦不顯。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-066", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/066/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_066.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-067-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論官殺混雜要制伏（淵源）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-067-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "官星要純不要雜。假如甲木用辛金爲官，若年是辛、月是酉、時上亦是，死官雖多儘不妨，儘純一儘好。若有金或庚申，則混雜爲殺，以傷官星，要行水鄉制伏則發福也，餘倣此也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-067", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/067/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_067.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-068-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論五行生尅制化各有所喜所害例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-068-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "金旺得火，方成器皿；火旺得水，方成相濟；水旺得土，方成池沼；土旺得木，方能疏通；木旺得金，方成棟樑。金賴土生，土多金埋；土賴火生，火多土焦；火賴木生，木多火熾；木賴水生，水多木漂；水賴金生，金多水濁。金能生水，水多金沈；水能生木，木盛水縮；木能生火，火多木焚；火能生土，土多火埋；土能生金，金多土變。金能尅木，木堅金缺；木能尅土，土重木折；土能尅水，水多土流；水能尅火，火多水熱；火能尅金，金多火熄。金衰遇火，必見銷鎔；火弱逢水，必爲熄滅；水弱逢土，必爲淤塞；土衰遇木，必遭傾陷；木弱逢金，必爲砍折。金得水方挫其鋒，水得木方泄其勢，木得火方化其頑，火得土方止其熒，強土得金方制其害。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-068", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/068/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_068.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-068-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論五行生尅制化各有所喜所害例", "text_id": "YHZP-T-068-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：五行各得其氣，不爲身弱反爲身強。此乃身弱遇鬼，得物以化之則吉。如甲日被金殺來傷，若時上一位壬癸水或申子辰解之，卽能化凶爲吉，餘者倣此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-068", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/068/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_068.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-069-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "二至陰陽相生理", "text_id": "YHZP-T-069-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "一至之內細分五行，配氣候於一月之中，各主旺相休囚死；五行又分陰陽爲兩股，於一年之中各主生旺之氣。如冬至一陽，則有木先生旺之理。何則？試以甲乙日干生人，在冬至之前陽氣未動，木方死絕，其木不甚吉利；若甲乙日生人在冬至之後，陽氣已生，木乘煖氣，其命壽祿皆全，只要用神入格。又如丙丁日干生人，在冬至之前遇水卽滅，若在冬至之後不甚忌水，蓋丙丁乘木之生也。夏至一陰生，則有金生水用之理。如官曆所載，夏至後逢庚爲三伏，蓋謂一陰生後金生而火囚，明乎此則庚辛生於夏至之後金露有氣，不甚忌火，其理尤明，學者不可不知矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-069", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/069/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_069.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-070-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "子平舉要歌", "text_id": "YHZP-T-070-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "造化先須詳日主，坐官坐印衰旺取。若甲子日生於申，用癸水水能生木爲印綬，謂之坐印，其餘者同。天時月令號提綱，元有元無旺重舉。提綱月支所藏之物，或金或木，以旺相者取之。大抵官星要純粹，正偏雜亂反無情。既用官星又嫌露，官藏殺方爲福，露殺藏官是福胎。官煞混雜爲凶，人狠爲人急暴。殺官俱露將何擬，混雜財官取財議。或有財生之反禍，子小人挾制君。官旺怕官忌刑沖，官輕見財爲福利。年上傷官最可嫌，重怕傷官不可蠲。年上傷官主尅祖，或傷祖。傷官用財乃爲福，財絕官衰福亦然。傷官主爲人喜財，時重見災禍不能免。合忘殺爲己福，官惡者善人。君子旣合之不爲大用，殺者堪差身弱怕財多，更逐官鄉禍相逐。如甲申甲戌四柱見戊己，乃財多身弱受禍。財多身弱食神來，食神會殺必爲災。食神我生之之盜氣之神，會天合地有刑尅，更宜達士細推裁。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-070", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/070/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_070.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-071-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "詳解定眞論（同沈泌）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-071-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫生日爲君者，行君之令，法運四時，陰陽剛柔之情，內外否泰之道。以日爲君者，如人行君之令，四柱每日爲主也。法運四時者，春夏秋冬多旺，假如孟春木旺，火生木能生火也；孟夏火旺，土生火也；孟秋金旺，水生金能生水也；孟冬水旺，木生水能生木也。土旺四季，辰戌丑未月也。故法運四時。剛柔之情者，陰有剛柔，陽有剛柔，月令有氣，日辰剛柔。內外否泰之道，年月日時也，三元配合天干地支。凡有十干，地支透出氣曰成外，暗藏日內否塞也，泰通也。一歲之遇，歲有十二月，日有十時，時有二刻。歲與日陰陽之主也，歲之正朝日之從朝，若臣之朝合從命也，故言日爲主。其驗有官鬼。蓋天地之氣有四時，當用五也，行之氣於春夏之主者，法之運四時：木旺七十二日，夏之氣炎，火旺七十二日；秋之氣涼，金旺七十二日；冬之氣溫，水旺七十二日；土旺四季，各旺一十八日，共七十二日。功四時，爲配上年下。陰陽者，甲丙戊庚壬爲陽，乙丁己辛癸爲陰。陽爲陰，陰爲陽。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-071", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/071/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_071.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-071-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "詳解定眞論（同沈泌）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-071-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "蓋干爲天，能動不靜，乃天之首；子乃地之首，至癸亥而終，子周流，靜不以支爲能，十支不能動，一陰一陽相代用之。取固亨出入之緩急。固者，堅也；亨者，通也。欲知貴賤吉凶，必先看日時身與四柱。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-071", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/071/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_071.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-071-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "詳解定眞論（同沈泌）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-071-003", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：旺之處多福慶，皆以五行之體用陰陽支用。官身爲官鬼之類，不居休敗之地，運到則財官聚之地，皆從生月起。運如常生，四柱財官之類不爲無氣，又行財旺之運爲官聚之地，皆進散而達。當生無財官，以干爲無氣，行財急之運，雖來發入抵犯凶方。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-071", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/071/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_071.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-071-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "詳解定眞論（同沈泌）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-071-004", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：濟者進也，復者退也，是功名進退。散者散也，歛者聚也，財帛聚散。若四柱有財帛之氣，日干更旺，更有敗財羊刃，運臨財之鄉，則居局中財多而大發也；若元有財帛却被鬼奪之，日主又逢運臨財旺之地，則亦不發禍，定是損財傷妻，故其根源淺薄，居福寡也。賦云：福星臨而禍發，以表凶人也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-071", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/071/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_071.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-071-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "詳解定眞論（同沈泌）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-071-005", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：三要三元也，四者年月日時也。擇日之法有三要：以干爲天，以支爲地，支中所藏者爲人元，乃分四柱。以年爲根、月爲苗、日爲花、時爲果。又擇四柱之中，以年爲祖上，則知世代宗派盛衰之理；月爲父母，則知親蔭名利有無之類；以日爲己身，當推其干。搜用八字爲內外生尅取舍之源。干弱則求氣旺之藉，有餘則欲不足之營。以日爲主，年月時中看有官無官、有財無財、有印無印，則其貴賤可知。故年上爲根苗，看年月中先有財官印殺，是根苗先有氣也；然後用神有象，屬花結葉也。經曰：根在苗先，實在花後。日爲己身，搜用八字，有得吉神凶神格局之類，喜者取之，忌者捨之。賦云：喜者存之，惜者棄之。日干弱則求氣旺之藉，日干旺則根深。旺之藉，日干旺却嫌氣旺怕太過，反爲不足之命，值此損財傷妻。本是天元地支，故看根苗花果之說，仔細詳之，四柱年月日時貴賤高低，則有根苗花實之類。如人命有財官，運臨財官則爲福；當生無財官，運臨財官則亦不爲福。爲根先生而後苗，花開而後有實，觀乎前兆以察其源。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-071", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/071/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_071.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-072-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論兄弟", "text_id": "YHZP-T-072-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "同以爲兄弟。如乙以甲爲兄，己庚重也；甲以乙爲弟，畏辛多也。用則爲傷之論，如辛多傷其乙木，庚多傷其甲木，如此則兄弟有四柱之定是起妻害子。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-072", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/072/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_072.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-072-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論兄弟", "text_id": "YHZP-T-072-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：月爲兄弟之宮，男取比和同類便爲兄弟之星。且如六丙日生人，以丁火爲弟妹；六丁日生人，以丙火爲兄妹。若臨酉戌亥子月，言兄弟不得力之論，謂酉火死、戌月火入墓、亥火絕氣、子月火懷胎，故言兄弟不得力之斷，其餘依此而推。五行旺相之方，可作兄弟得力或當或貴之斷。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-072", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/072/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_072.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-073-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論妻妾", "text_id": "YHZP-T-073-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "以日爲妻，如在沖刑尅殺之地，言尅妻妾之斷。論妻妾者，以生日支辰爲妻妾之星，無所尅之物爲上；若在空刑尅害之地，則尅妻妾，不然重婚再娶，尅之輕者主疾癡。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-073", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/073/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_073.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-074-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論子息", "text_id": "YHZP-T-074-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "以時爲子息，臨死絕之鄉，言子少之斷。如丙午、戊午、壬子犯此日者，又死要殺死或殺。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-074", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/074/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_074.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-074-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論子息", "text_id": "YHZP-T-074-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：男取尅干爲嗣，女取干生爲子，有失皆例以時分野。當推貧賤富貴之區，在何分野輕重生旺定居，多少看於四柱。鬼谷子曰：男取尅干爲嗣者，假如六庚日午時生，乃時生子，火多數，謂庚以乙爲財，乙木能生火，尅庚金爲子之星，午時乃火之分野，丁火建祿之鄉，當有子多生顯貴命；若生於戌亥子時，則是金水之分野，火絕之地，則主子息少矣，當主孤獨貧賤之子。看生時在何宮，多嗣當生出美麗富貴之子；若在衰病死墓絕無氣胎養沖利之鄉，定主其子少，當主孤苦貧賤之子。三命云：庚臨坎位時衰兮，後裔凋零；甲到離宮，秋降也，兒孫滿目，此之謂與。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-074", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/074/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_074.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-074-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論子息", "text_id": "YHZP-T-074-003", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：理愚歌云：五行真假少人知，知時須是泄天機。俗以甲子作海中金，即此之謂。乃天地大衍數也。先布大衍四十九數在地，天機五行真假者納音是也。八丙辛寅申七，丁壬卯酉六，戊癸辰戌五，巳亥當屬四等，數除之便減不盡，又按五行之數除之，除者水一、火二、木三、金四、土五，相生取用便是納音。子丑寅卯也，相生者餘一生木，餘二生土，餘三生火，餘四生金，餘五生水，餘六生金，餘七生火，餘八生土，餘九生水，餘十生金，餘倣此推。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-074", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/074/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_074.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-075-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論年爲主", "text_id": "YHZP-T-075-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "世之談三命者皆古法，往往多以年爲主，則可知萬億同者，小運納音爲論，似水之渙漫而無所歸矣，富貴有相同者鑿矣。故子平之法，專以生日爲天元爲主，日下支爲妻，言生年爲本，根枝又爲祖上田宅之宮。如甲子生，便爲本命太歲之尊神，忌生日支干與本歲沖併戰鬥尅害，名爲主本不和，則人生來不諱祖業田宅曠敗，宗親應離，倚黨若生月時中與本命干支會合入局，或遇財官貴氣，則生平當有祖宗田宅豐厚，聲譽之美也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-075", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/075/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_075.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-001", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：著午月日時皆見財官印綬之星定主祖宗父母榮顯之貴妻美貌子多慈善貴連。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "論子息之多少者，當以生時為子息宮。男取尅干為子嗣，女取干生為子息。若臨死墓胎絕衰弱之地，子息甚少。如男命六乙日申時生，當有子息多。乙木以庚金為子息，申時乃金之分野，庚金建祿之鄉，故言子多也。若生在子丑寅卯巳午時，為子息少之斷，謂居尅墓絕胎尅受制之鄉。或四柱中有刑破尅害損於時中，定是晚年少嗣，縱有亦須僧道過房，貧賤夭折螟蛉出祖之輩也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段内嵌现代【校记/存疑】标记，原文与校勘混排；已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著；text_layer UNVERIFIED→ORIGINAL：剥离校記后为纯原著正文", "evidence_grade": "A"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-003", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：蓋此論之皆非人之所為，造物陰陽之所致。傾世術士不知斯理而潛亂於俗，不可以言傳，當攷幽微之妙矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-004", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "前篇論生年於祖，乃父母世代宗派盛衰之宮，切忌四柱中有刑冲破害之物傷於當生年，應主祖宗根基雖有蔭無倚也。以生月為兄弟之宮，若臨死絕墓胎之月，言兄弟不得力也。以日辰為妻妾之宮，若臨空刑尅害之地，言尅妻妾也。以時為子息之星，子星若臨死墓絕之鄉，言子息少之漸。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段内嵌现代【校记/存疑】标记，原文与校勘混排；已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著；text_layer UNVERIFIED→ORIGINAL：剥离校記后为纯原著正文", "evidence_grade": "A"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-005", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：賦云：論其眷屬，審其死絕。三命云：四柱內觀其九族，三元中辨其六親。凡父母祖宗為依倚，兄弟如手足，妻子如心腹。孰不有親愛之眷屬哉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "B"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-006", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "蓋六親多寡存失，貴賤榮枯衰旺，皆非世人可得能為，實天地之造化，誠陰陽之所致，鬼神不能移矣。古云：自古賢達之士，博通經典，窮理盡性，深明造物，發端五行，無不通曉。吾夫子云：不知天命，無以為君子。今世不肖之術士，不能通變之明，陰陽造化幽微之理，差之毫釐，謬以千里，其斯之謂與。是以五行辨通之道，取用多門，故不可以言傳，當攷幽微之妙矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段内嵌现代【校记/存疑】标记，原文与校勘混排；已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著；text_layer UNVERIFIED→ORIGINAL：剥离校記后为纯原著正文", "evidence_grade": "A"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "○喜忌篇", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-008", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-008", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "喜者，吉神也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/008", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-009", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-009", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "忌者，惡神也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/009", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-010", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-010", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：甲日甲子為有氣，春生越為美。甲午甲申支無氣，人無志木神，死絕在坤地矣。正財獨則易取，亂則難取。甲以庚為殺，春水庚暖，庚金乃休囚，身旺則殺輕。六甲時遇庚午午，不書星又年，月時有辛虛名剃耳。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/010", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-011", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-011", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "四柱排定，三才次分，專以日上天元，配合八字支干。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/011", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-012", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-012", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：凡看命，先看四柱年月日時，次分天地人三元。干為天元，支為地元，以支中所藏金木水火土為人元。年為基本，月為提綱，日為命主，時為分野。故以日上天元配合，取其財官印綬有無、敗傷爭鬥，論其八字也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/012", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-013", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-013", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "有見不見之形，無時不有。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/013", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-014", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-014", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：碧玉歌曰：甲官辛兮柱無有，支內宜精究，卯沖酉合喜合巳酉丑，如無喜絕衰旺休。○或三合六合貴地，雖祿馬妻財子孫父母兄弟，皆是有見不見之形，無時而不有也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/014", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-015", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-015", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "神煞相絆，輕重較量。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/015", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-016", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-016", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：神者，貴人也；煞者，七殺也。若神殺混雜，看入節氣深淺。或有去官留殺，或去殺留官，四柱或歲運，亦當知輕重較量。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/016", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-017", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-017", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "若乃時逢七煞，見之未必為凶，月制干強，其殺反為權印。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/017", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-018", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-018", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論時上一位貴格，只有一位方可，別位不要再見，始為清貴。若年月上再見之，反位為辛苦難之命，要日干主旺，不畏刑害陽刃，為人性重。剛執不屈，若四柱中元有制伏，却要行官旺運，然後可發福，又不可專言制伏，貴在屈得其中，乃盡法無民之命。假如史彌遠之命：甲申、丙寅、乙卯、辛巳，此用日天干旺，時上偏官，月上制伏得其中和，故為貴矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/018", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-019", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-019", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：戊辰戊戌丁丑丁未此洪武皇帝命。戊戌壬戌甲午己巳此史太師命。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/019", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-020", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-020", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：碧玉歌曰：戊日戊申食神奇寅卯申丙忌寅，丙是庚煞中乃戊之鬼，乙卯露出填其貴，食神于旺皆為奇。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/020", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-021", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-021", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：財官會印綬，播四海主強名。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/021", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-022", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-022", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "財官印綬全備，藏蓄於四季之中。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/022", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-023", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-023", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論雜氣財官印綬格。四季時，辰戌丑未也，乃天地不正之氣，為雜氣也。蓋辰中有乙木餘氣、壬癸之庫墓、戊己之土，乃辰戌丑未各以所藏之氣而言之。此四者藏蓄雜氣，為我之官星財氣祿馬印綬也，多看四柱天元而用之。透出何字為福，次分節氣淺深。若煞旺官少，要制伏，不喜財，若主旺相沖，要行財運庫旺，大抵聚之不可破，如無所忌，大發財。假史太師命：丙戌、戊戌、甲午、己巳，難雜氣財官格。此命用辛官，己為財，戌中有辛金餘氣，戊己。己土生財旺，生官所以富貴兩全○。但墓庫中物自局錙銖以閉藏，要有刑冲破害開局，錙銖之物則言發財官之貴矣。若四柱元有刑冲破害之物，再不要逢此運氣，則反宜細推之。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/023", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "B"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-024", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-024", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "官星財氣長生，鎮居於寅申巳亥。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/024", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-025", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-025", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此命官生旺於四孟寅申巳亥。乃五行長生之地。假如壬申、辛亥、己巳、丙寅。己用丙為印綬，寅申中有甲木長生；己用壬為財，申中有壬水；丙火長生，此為四孟凶局。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/025", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "B"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-026", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-026", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚申時逢戊日，名食神干旺之方，歲月犯甲丙卯寅，此乃遇而不遇。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/026", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-027", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-027", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論專旺食神格。戊以庚為食神，其中有庚金建祿，戊土用水為財，庚申中有水長生，乃財旺也。戊用乙為官星，庚能合卯中乙木，為戊土官貴氣。若四柱透甲丙寅卯四字，則壞了申中庚金貴氣，此乃遇而不遇。假如己未、壬申、戊子、庚申，此謝丞相之命也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/027", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-028", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-028", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：甲乙亥壬子癸，是不宜見己；貪財破印，守義無害，財官雙美。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/028", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-029", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-029", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：碧玉歌曰。四言獨步。情龍背多。財辰戌。多則富貴多。此言乙己鼠猴。鄉貴人有子忌。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/029", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-030", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-030", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "月生日干無天財，乃印綬之名。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/030", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-031", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-031", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論印綬格。十干生我者是也，為父母、為生氣，又能護我之官星，故印綬無傷官之患矣。大要生旺忌死絕，若四柱中元有官星尤好，忌見財氣格。行官運鄉財發，若行財旺鄉貪財壞印，禍百端。行死絕運必死，假行如丙辰、甲午、乙未、丁卯，此命月生日干為印綬格，係高和尚命。大運丁酉，流年壬午，當年三十歲，至元十九年三月二十四日遭極刑，故謂生逢死絕之運，又見壬來破印也。此當年用天元大運用地支。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/031", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "B"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-032", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-032", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "日祿居時沒官星，號青雲得路。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/032", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-033", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-033", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論歸祿格。要四柱中無一點官星，方為此格，號為青雲得路。最要日干生旺，乘食傷神、傷官之鄉可發福。但歸祿有六忌：一則冲刑，二則作合，三則倒食，四則官星，五則日月天元同，六則歲月天元同。犯此六者不可一有。祿以為貴矣。假如甲子、丙子、癸丑、壬子，此是張都統命。乃子多為聚福歸祿。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/033", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "B"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-034", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-034", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "陽水疊逢辰位，是壬騎龍背之鄉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/034", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-035", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-035", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：如壬辰日生，遇辰字多者貴，寅字多者富。蓋壬以己土為官星，丁火為財星。辰巳暗冲戌中之官庫，所以貴也。寅字多能合午中財，所以富也。詩曰：陽水多逢辰字鄉，壬騎龍背喜非常。柱中俱有壬辰字，富貴雙全在廟堂。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/035", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-036", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-036", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "陰木獨遇子時，為六乙鼠貴之地。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/036", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-037", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-037", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：見官星見官則要其貴矣。此論庚金生長之水得金又生為潤下之象豈不為貴。若有申子合丑制在申則傷財，干旺則丙干傷，庚位祿其。歌曰：庚日水生名，提年時子水傷，凶中歲以逢夫戊已，和中凶者作吉。秦皇親命：丙戌、甲午、丁巳、癸卯。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/037", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-038", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-038", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚日全逢潤下，忌壬癸巳午之方，時遇子申，其福減半。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/038", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-039", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-039", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論大怕午字沖丙子時為妙，謂之聚貴也。或四柱中有庚字辛字申字酉字丑字，內則有庚申金則減分數。歲君大運亦然。如月內有官星則不用此格，若四柱中元无官星方用此格也。此論井欄叉格，只是庚申辰庚子水局為貴。何蓋午庚用木為財，而申沖寅戌，戌土為庚之印，而辰沖之又辰戌為財官印緩，故以申子辰三字來沖寅午戌，為財官印緩。若四柱中須用申子辰全為貴，不止庚金得三庚者，尤為奇。或戊子丙辰亦不妨，喜行東方財地，北方壬癸巳午之方，傷官南方火格不為貴。假如庚子庚辰庚申丁丑，此是王都統制命，丁卯出戍邊，土得十四官誥。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/039", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "B"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-040", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-040", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "若逢傷官月建，如凶處未必為凶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/040", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-041", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-041", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論傷官格，傷官之法務要傷盡而不為禍。四柱若元有官星，傷之尤重。元无官星，傷之則輕。若三合會起傷官之殺，及運行傷官之地，其禍不可言也。故傷官見官，為禍百端。若當生年干有傷官七殺，為禍最重，關之福言受傷，終身不可除去。若月時見傷官之地，可發福矣。若女人命有傷官者，主剋夫。若見合多，則為卑賤，或淫濫如無制者為師尼。合則非良婦也。若遇貴人殺者，亦作命婦而推之。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/041", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-042", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-042", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "內有正倒祿飛，忌官星亦嫌羈絆。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/042", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-043", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-043", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：內有正倒祿飛者，乃丁巳得巳字多沖出亥中壬水，為丁官星，乃正飛天祿馬格也。若辛日得亥字多沖出巳中丙火，為辛官星，乃是倒飛天祿馬。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/043", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-044", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-044", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：宴參政命：辛酉、辛酉、癸卯、甲寅。甲子日子時名進巳西子多，丑酉能合，補者去金已登雲路步金階。此格要暗合官星，論若得自柱作貴而論，四柱見了一點官星，乃只一個秀才。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/044", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-045", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-045", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "飛天祿馬少人知，辛癸多逢亥位宜。不見官殺无羈絆，少年富貴拜丹墀。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/045", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-046", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-046", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：格也柱中有壬癸巳皆是官星，羈絆也則減分數，歲運亦同。時曰祿馬少人知，辛癸多逢亥位宜。不見官殺无羈絆，少年富貴拜丹墀。飛天識者稀，庚壬二日貴非疑，柱無羈絆官星現，平步青雲到鳳池。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/046", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-047", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-047", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "六癸日時逢寅位，歲月怕戊己二方。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/047", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-048", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-048", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論刑合格，以六癸日為主星，用戊土為正氣官星，喜逢印寅月，用巳中戊土，癸日得官星。如庚寅刑不成，惟甲寅時是，行運與飛天祿馬同者。四柱中有戊字己字，又怕庚寅傷申字刑壞了，忌申字。假如癸酉辛卯癸卯甲寅，乃婁參政命也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/048", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-049", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-049", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲子日再逢子時，畏庚辛申酉丑午。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/049", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-050", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-050", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論子進巳格，甲用辛官，辛祿在酉，二酉為甲木之印綬。如甲子進合巳中丙戌，合動酉位之辛為申，是官星巳酉丑三合會起官星，喜壬癸亥子月，忌庚申甲申辛酉戌甲子，乃金來傷甲木，午字來沖子字丑羈絆，則不能去進合矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/050", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-051", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-051", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "辛癸日多逢丑地，不喜官星，歲時逢子巳二宮，虛名虛利。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/051", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-052", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-052", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論丑遙巳格，用辛官癸丑二日，可要但四柱中無一點官星方要用此格。蓋辛用丙官，癸用戊官，丙戌戌祿在巳也。能破巳丙戊之祿出矣，不要填實辛巳位子午午羈絆不能義也。若申酉得一字為好，假如乙丑己丑癸丑癸丑乃是葉侍郎之命，又有丁丑癸丑辛巳癸丑乃王通判之命。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/052", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-053", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-053", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：拱祿拱貴不宜見真，拱祿拱貴只宜虛實，填實如不拱，乃拱貴不真，作此而別格不易可見。時甲日甲日見戌，不以偏官格，偏財名時馬格與時上偏官同用時上天元及支內人元，月忌物比分財年，則損六親若省子。六辛日時逢戊子，此論六陰朝陽格，生故云六陰朝陽，一生官丙丁傷，子祿日西被午火，者朝廷中柱無俸，祿入朝陽。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/053", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-054", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-054", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "拱祿拱貴，填實則凶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/054", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-055", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-055", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論拱貴拱祿二格，乃兩位虛拱祿貴之宮，四柱不可占了，占實物則為災星，只宜虛拱不真。如填實為物，只為常局，若財官二局亦怕填實。假如此丁巳丙午甲寅甲子，此是王郎中之命，此二甲來夾丑中之癸，運行辛丑除通判，庚子運庚金東旺乃甲寅木之財官，之長生豈不為貴，後月衝破甲子子乃天中殺。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/055", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-056", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-056", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "時上偏財別官忌見。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/056", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-057", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-057", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論時上偏財格，又名時馬格，與時上偏官同用時上天元及支內人元。只要時上一位有之便為時上偏財，運行喜旺地。丁酉己酉戊子壬子邵統制命也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/057", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-058", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-058", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "六辛日逢戊子，嫌午未位，運喜西方。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/058", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-059", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-059", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論六陰朝陽格，辛金至亥為六陰之地，而得子時故曰六陰畫之，一陽生丙丙官星為辛官星，丙丙為辛之傷官，方喜也，東方財氣巳鄕次之，不為要行南方火地，辰庚申辛卯戊子此畢甫遇命令戊。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/059", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-060", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-060", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：丁日者若運，丁巳月須要成，亥七日者遇戌，時月殺有卻為食，當月官殺反為貴。快曰戊戌午月，時正刃須看歲，號作刃若丙火，無者成之如。快曰祿拱主何，干克則須慎見丙，火壽信其度，夭窮難得庚甲春。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/060", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-061", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-061", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "五行遇月支偏官，歲月時中亦宜制伏。類有去官留殺，亦有去殺留官。四柱", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/061", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-062", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-062", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "純雜有制，定居一品之尊。略有一位正官，官殺混雜反賤。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/062", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-063", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-063", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論偏官之格，若四柱中全無一點官星，用七殺為偏官，若有正官混雜反賤。七殺之鬼乃克天干也，故謂有不見之形，全要日干生旺，故喜身旺怕沖動羊刃，只要制伏不要四柱中再見官星，有兄不順其弟之說，或四柱中歲運又遇官星，則為不貴。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/063", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-064", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-064", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "戊日午月，勿作刃看。時歲火多，卻為印綬。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/064", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-065", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-065", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論羊刃者，非羊之羊，乃陰陽之陽，此祿前一位是為推陽位，有刃陰位為刃者，得午月午上不為刃，若歲干時干又見火，乃正是印授格也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/065", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-066", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-066", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "月令雖逢建祿，切忌會官殺為凶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/066", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-067", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-067", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：歲干時干又見火，乃正印是即月日干透，也乃陰火生陽土，正謂是月生日干若歲干時干又見火，乃正是印授格也。大凡命中以財為官貴，若四柱中有以作合，謂食合忘官，又黨起七殺，反凶兆且如甲日，用酉月為官星正氣，若年時子辰，又會起申中庚為七殺。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/067", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-068", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-068", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：假如甲日見庚辛，官殺交差就；庚是甲之殺，辛乃甲官；四柱遘乙，合庚救爲貴。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/068", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-069", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-069", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "七殺乃甲之鬼賊故爲凶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/069", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-070", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-070", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：己未，丁卯官旺，戊申土羸，癸亥，鄧元帥命。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/070", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-071", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-071", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "官星七殺交差却以合殺爲貴。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/071", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-072", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-072", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：官星乃貴氣之神，純而不雜乃爲清福，雜而不純便壞造化，有支中合出；七殺爲吉兆，經云合官星不爲貴，合殺則七殺不爲凶，乃是五行賴之救助。且如甲日生人得卯時，卯中之乙能合庚，庚字爲甲之偏官，是爲合殺也；若男子得之和氣與人投合，貴者女子得之，多生心意不足，雖美麗性樂私情；主尅夫害子，如庚日生四柱見丙爲殺，則有申辰，合起子爲水局來救之，丙化爲官，官則爲吉矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/072", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-073", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-073", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "柱中官星大旺。天元羸弱之名。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/073", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-074", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-074", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：羸音雷，弱也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/074", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-075", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-075", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：大抵人生以財官祿馬爲貴，取其中和之氣爲福厚，偏黨之氣爲福薄。若官星太旺，天元身弱，只行官旺鄉，成其禍。且如甲乙日天元用庚辛申酉巳丑爲官貴，四柱中官星既多，元有制伏則妙，本身弱須行制伏之運，乃可發福。若行官旺之鄉，乃造化太過其禍害，破財不可勝言，運數亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/075", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-076", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-076", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：日干旺太甚無依，喜遘印財食，運行官見美財，印發禍填若無，依男爲僧道，女爲尼姑。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/076", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-077", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-077", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "日干旺甚無依若不爲僧即道。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/077", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-078", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-078", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論時旺殺爲主本得地，乃爲時旺之鄉也，其人沉痾不染，蓄年齒牢變。黑天年過數，如此格多出俗避位出家，尙志慕道修禪，乃日干甚旺。且如庚日生人月時在申，或運入西方，此庚以火爲官星，火至西方而死，庚以木爲財，木至西方而絕，旣是財官祿馬俱無，則欲步於前程何以施設。故無依倚，乃持身旺地，蓋順身遠害之命。假如乙卯、丙子、丙午、癸巳，此祁眞人命，日干多旺於東南方運矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/078", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "B"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-079", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-079", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：月中有印授生，日歲時有印授生，運若財怕地至，破官凶災違家。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/079", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-080", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-080", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "印綬生月歲時忌見財星運入財鄉却宜退身避位。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/080", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-081", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-081", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論月生日干，乃印授之名，印綬之若印授乃喜官星畏財氣。印也，印授者乃我氣源，須根固，若行財位者宜退身。徒配也，假如庚戌、甲申、癸卯、丁巳，此命月中正氣庚，合巳中丙火爲癸之財，其水見財，貪財壞印，一生蹭蹬。之地，身亂身亡之故也。後大運行己丑，流年丙寅入墓也。運又行傷運，氣庚申入墓也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/081", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-082", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-082", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：劫刃月甲生，卯年再見乙，已來土之助，乙未之中見，夾來劫去而巳運。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/082", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-083", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-083", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "刦財羊刃切忌時逢歲運併臨災殃立至。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/083", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-084", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-084", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：刦財乃是日上天元分爭。如刦祿馬，甲祿在寅，甲用己土，日併月時相者二丁戊己土，在巳前一辰見午，午有己戊，家失祖施恩反怨，心性卒暴退，智大心高，傷害不足，若運。假如癸未、乙卯、甲子、已巳，此岳飛將軍命，此爲刦財陽刃，乙爲刃見卯陽刃，財而已有損，十九死於獄中。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/084", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-085", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-085", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：如甲日用辛爲，正官柱有甲寅，旺運再逢旺寅，背祿逐馬主妻，分散子別離難。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/085", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-086", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-086", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "十干背祿歲時喜見財星運至比肩號曰背祿逐馬。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/086", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-087", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-087", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：祿之向也，爲順背也爲逆，且四甲得寅爲祿，若遇巳午，主無財之論，主初明後晦，喜財星戊己土助其身，火至亥無氣，比肩見甲。分財經云馬者在乎財位，乃甲見寅爲身旺，庚申用土爲財，土至寅病，金至寅絕，乃祿馬旣不扶身，賦云馬劣財微，宜退身避位，豈不謂之守窮途而僂惶也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/087", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-088", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-088", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：財官印綬三奇，五行之正氣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/088", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-089", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-089", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "五行正貴忌沖刑尅破之宮。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/089", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-090", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-090", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：正氣官星者，提綱之要用，時上財氣，乃貴人也，忌刑沖尅破之神墳之。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/090", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-091", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-091", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：此合財宜于男，命爲吉女人大。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/091", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-092", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-092", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "四柱干支喜三合六合之地。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/092", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-093", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-093", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：凡干支有三合六合者，乃天地陰陽萬物皆有感應，兩相對，所以是眷屬性情，妻貴在乎大人物之重，樂乎生人之祿合，財爲官祿之相從，合刑爲刑煞之相壓也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/093", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-094", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-094", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：日干弱喜身旺，有印助顯其刃，貴神殺無印主。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/094", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-095", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-095", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "日干無氣時逢羊刃不爲凶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/095", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-096", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-096", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：且如甲申日卯時爲刃，此是申中庚金能尅卯中乙木，爲財爲馬爲妻，雖逢刃不爲凶矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/096", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-097", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-097", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：有制則吉無制，則囚。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/097", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-098", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-098", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "官殺兩停喜者存之憎者棄之。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/098", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-099", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-099", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：甲用辛酉爲官星，又見申庚，何以是又見三合之混雜，甲乙用庚辛爲官，貴而有巳有丑，是官殺混雜。福若混雜之命，歲運更在旺伏之運，或去殺用官，去官用財，羊刃合爲官星之用。鄕混官殺，其禍不可具述矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/099", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-100", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-100", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：決曰男兒多合，快日見官，本性聰明畜，任情女，凡性貪合。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/100", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-101", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-101", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "地支天干合多亦云貪合忘官。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/101", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-102", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-102", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：且如甲用辛爲官，而有丙見庚爲殺；乙用庚爲官，而辛爲殺。又有丙及支干多合，此陽官陰殺，則陰官陽殺，乃是造化之必然也。合是貪合忘官，經云合官星不爲貴，合七殺不爲凶，五行有救助之謂也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/102", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-103", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-103", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：甲寅木死午，壬癸丁己，生金土生甲助，壬子、丙午、己酉、戊辰，如雞子命。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/103", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著", "evidence_grade": "C"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-104", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-104", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "四柱殺旺運純身旺爲官清貴。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/104", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-105", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-105", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此七殺即偏官也，宜制伏。四柱內以殺爲官。且如甲忌庚爲殺，而甲生於寅地乃身旺，其甲暗包丙長生，則不畏金爲殺，以殺化爲官星，則甲庚各有所歸。寅地乃身旺，自恃旺勢而行純，旺運乃爲極品之貴。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/105", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-106", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-106", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "凡見天元太弱內有弱處復生。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/106", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-107", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-107", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論日主自坐官殺，乃爲人元弱處復生，乃是胎生元命。且如甲胎在申，申中有庚金庚辛爲偏官，爲六合中受氣相感，氣生胎元，得壬水長生酉。上沐浴、戌上冠帶、亥上臨官，木矣，此格只要官星旺運方可。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/107", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-108", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-108", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：乙酉、乙酉、乙酉，此爲七殺全彰。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/108", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-109", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-109", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "柱中七殺全彰身旺極貧。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/109", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-110", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-110", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：傷官本祿之七殺，敗財本馬之七殺偏官，身之七殺，四柱有之，身旺建祿，不爲富矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/110", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-076-111", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "喜忌篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-076-111", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "無殺女人之命一貴可作良人。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-076", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/076/111", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_076.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-077-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-077-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "女命看男命與女命不同。女命不取官星，取財星；不取夫星，取偏財。夫星若天元運助，貴能分見，此三合六合，不取財馬生旺。女命不取剛強羊刃，女命要干支剛強，如八節霜露雨雪，陰陽豈人者，辨此一陰一陽，若天元運助，貴能分見。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-077", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/077/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_077.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-077-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-077-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：大抵天地陰陽之理也。凡女人之命，大喜要安靜清貴，旺夫子貴，妻時亦多。若絕氣非刑沖破害不美。若女命有夾貴者必爲貴人，妻妾多貴榮。合多定是師尼娼婢。合六者心多也。官者正夫，殺者偏夫，合者地支暗合，三者皆爲偏合，非良婦也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-077", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/077/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_077.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-077-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-077-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "偏官時遇制伏太過，乃是貧儒。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-077", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/077/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_077.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-077-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-077-004", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：偏官主人性聰明，有剛強傲物。若四柱中制伏多，乃是法無民也。中和之氣爲福厚，偏黨爲福薄。假如丙午甲午癸亥乙卯，此乃是錢鵬黃秀才之命，月上有偏官，所以殘目盲足，身貧窮矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-077", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/077/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_077.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-077-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-077-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "四柱傷官，運入官鄉必破。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-077", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/077/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_077.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-077-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-077-006", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論傷官，四柱有官星運入官鄉，被破者極須要明輕重。假如癸未癸亥辛未癸巳，此一者五命，辛以丙爲官，日中有丙又有癸水，則破其官星也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-077", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/077/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_077.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-077-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-077-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "五行絕處即是胎元，生日逢之名曰受氣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-077", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/077/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_077.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-077-008", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-077-008", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：胎元逢生日名曰受氣。詩曰：五行絕處是胎元，生日逢之富貴全，更若支元來祐助，定然衣錦早乘軒。度理可以知幽微之妙，度性可以知生死之元。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-077", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/077/008", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_077.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-077-009", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-077-009", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "理木絕在申，即受氣胎酉，則養戌亥宮，是主死中復生氣，亡又伏存才名遞。是以陰陽罕測，不可一例而推，務要稟得中和之氣，神分貴賤，略敷古聖之遺書，縱約以今賢之博覽，若通此法參詳鑒命，無差無誤矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-077", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/077/009", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_077.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "人禀天地，命屬陰陽，生居覆載之內，盡在五行之中。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：人禀二五之數，猶天地之生物以成形。人得萬物之靈，乃天地之正氣，方爲人所屬。陰陽五行，不離乎金木水火土也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "欲知貴賤，先觀月令乃提綱。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-004", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：月令乃八字之綱領，更知節氣之淺深以知災禍。如寅中有艮土餘氣爲七日半，丙火寄生又七日半，甲木正令共十五日，此三者不知用何爲禍。見正官正印食神則吉，傷官偏印則凶也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "次斷吉凶，專用日干爲主本。三元要成格局，四柱喜見財官。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-006", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：四柱專以生日之干，配合四柱三元而成格局，惟喜財官。用神不可損傷，日主最宜健旺。官貴正人君子，敬畏修知用。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "年月日干神煞：神煞有官不可損，官煞有財不可劫，有印不可破。凡柱中財官干強健，則不能任其財官。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-008", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-008", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "年爲日干，日干爲月，月爲年，年爲日，故曰主本不和，乃父子不相和也。連年爲連旺，莫疑猜只是單衾紙帳。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/008", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-009", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-009", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "歲月時中大怕殺官混雜。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/009", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-010", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-010", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：用要配日時，中既取有官星，又見七殺則不吉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/010", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-011", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-011", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "用憑於生月，當推究於淺深；發覺在於日時，要消詳於強弱。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/011", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-012", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-012", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：水爲用者，月令中所藏者。如甲木生於十一月，乃建子之月，就以子中所藏癸水爲用神，癸爲甲母，忌己土尅之，要日時相輔其旺相休囚可也。餘倣此而推。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/012", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-013", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-013", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "時上偏財怕逢兄弟。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/013", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-014", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-014", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "官星正氣忌見刑沖。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/014", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-015", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-015", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：碧玉歌曰：官星正氣莫混財，多傷食，真金莫真金。且如乙卯見庚辰，時月逢戌酉，印生巳酉丑，月午未火局，休逢若遇官，旺見沖刑，有印見之，吉用。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/015", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-016", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-016", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲生庚金以秋旺身重。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/016", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-017", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-017", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "月刃合相成，見虎相爭，傷官爲羊刃，沖合歲君勃然禍至。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/017", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-018", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-018", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此甲日生人見卯乃爲羊刃，遇酉金而沖之、見戌而合之則禍至。若當生四柱中元有羊刃之神，忽來相對尅破流年太歲，或三合相招尅害歲君，則有勃然禍至。若歲乙巳於甲日生，四柱有巳亥對沖，或巳酉丑爲禍。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/018", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-019", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-019", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "七殺制則爲偏官，偏官喜制伏不宜太過。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/019", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-020", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-020", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：壬日見戊則爲七殺，方要見甲木制之則吉貴也，不宜甲乙木多，若多則太過也。如小人受制於君子，太過必主反逆。傷官復行官運不測災來，羊刃沖合歲君勃然禍至。運則發，若行入戊己巳午運不吉兆矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/020", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-021", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-021", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "生氣印綬利官運，最見財鄉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/021", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-022", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-022", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：甲乙生人見亥子月爲印星，庚辛爲官。甲人見戊辰時爲偏官，見乙字比劫之地則不吉之命也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/022", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-023", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-023", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "有印者官不制，財印者財不制官，官不制財，印者印不制財。也非天則貧，必是身衰遇鬼。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/023", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-078-024", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "繼善篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-078-024", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "經云：財多生官須要身健，財多盜氣本身自柔。且如甲乙以庚辛爲戊己爲財氣，得天干生旺，則土生金，乃木之官也，主先貧後富，蓋是財旺生官也。富而且貴，定因財旺生官。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-078", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/078/024", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_078.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "正氣官星，四柱中未有傷官煞混雜，行旺運，幼年必主登科及第。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：納粟奏名，財庫居生旺之地。少年難發庫中人，只怕有物壓之，若行財旺運或開庫，故云納粟奏名。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "官貴太甚，纔臨旺處必傾。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-004", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：且如甲乙用庚辛申酉爲官星，又有巳酉丑之類，乃是官星多。若四柱中有制伏，更行官旺運，造物太過，其禍患不可勝言。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "印綬被傷，倘若榮華不久。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-006", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：印綬本生氣之源，不可有傷，被傷乃見財也，爲福有損，縱應祿位不久而敗，所謂貪財壞印是也。財見重土者，有事難誇。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "有官有印無破，作廊廟之材。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-008", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-008", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：有官有印，乃雜氣所藏官印也。鬼谷子云：罡中有乙，魁中伏辛，此爲雜氣印綬財官也，乃少年不發庫中人也。假如丙寅辛丑甲辰丙寅，此爲雜氣，甲用辛爲官，己土爲財，癸爲印，提綱中有癸水餘氣，產金庫墓，己土見旺，故得靈封之貴也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/008", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-009", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-009", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "無官無印有格，乃朝廷之用。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/009", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-010", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-010", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：正氣雜氣濕財官印綬爲貴格，貴之命若成格局，要全無一點財官食方爲富貴之命矣。假如己未壬申戊子庚申，此乃斷左丞相之命，此名專合祿之格，若四柱中全無一顆財官神殺，以戊用乙官，發財丁印，國柱中全無矣，取戊食庚於申，申建祿，戊祿在巳，真申合名，前格名翼金秀，須還身旺，逢官星在申，貴在中官全。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/010", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-011", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-011", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "身旺逢正氣官星，又行正運，必登科及第。若四柱中是飛天祿馬沖官合祿，乃文臣稱貴也。沖官者止有四日，見上。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/011", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-012", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-012", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "非格非局，見之焉得爲奇。身若遇官，得後徒然費力。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/012", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-013", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-013", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：若四柱中用神財官見傷，忌非格局有財官，此等命不爲奇妙。又論自身天元羸弱，縱官星得之，榮華不久也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/013", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-014", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-014", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "小人命內亦有正印官星。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/014", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-015", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-015", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：印綬者怕逢財氣壞印，官星者畏見傷官必敗。若四柱中雖有財官印綬，遇其傷害，不成真名，反爲凶惡，豈不爲小人哉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/015", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-016", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-016", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "君子格中也犯七殺羊刃。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/016", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-017", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-017", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：七殺有制化爲官，羊刃無沖極爲貴。偏官發於白屋，羊刃起於逸戍，爲將爲相，豈不爲君子者哉。刃與殺主誅戮之權。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/017", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-018", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-018", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "爲人好殺，羊刃必犯於偏官。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/018", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-019", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-019", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：羊刃者在天爲七星，喜行誅戮之地，爲羊刃殺。偏官者，七殺之暗鬼。羊刃又犯七殺，人多主凶，若遇貴人則吉，無則大凶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/019", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-020", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-020", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "天德主貴，在戊爲必發煞。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/020", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-021", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-021", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：天月德能解煞，正丁二坤申，三壬四辛同，五乾六甲上，七癸八艮逢，九丙十居乙，子巽丑庚中。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/021", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-022", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-022", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此言日主無氣，落於衰鄉，又生了一天元氣，特鬼敗之命，身強殺淺，假殺爲權。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/022", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-023", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-023", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：如命中元犯凶神惡煞，若遇天月二德神救之，則凶不害矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/023", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-024", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-024", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "生平少病，日主高強。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/024", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-025", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-025", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論財者財馬也，財旺有氣來助我身，乘旺必享財而用之，是得安然之樂矣。如甲生於辰戌丑未之鄉，皆作財有氣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/025", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-026", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-026", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "官刑不犯，印綬天德同宮。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/026", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-027", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-027", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此五行自得天時，名爲時旺。若印綬扶身，又帶天月二德，則一生不犯官刑之論。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/027", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-028", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-028", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "少樂多憂，蓋因日主自弱。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/028", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-029", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-029", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：取甲生寅卯之鄉，更逢亥卯未成行，何怕庚金作黨。乙生巳酉丑月，喜未逢木局，相當若逢亥卯。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/029", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-030", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-030", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "生殘處世，艱難貧漢。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/030", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-031", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-031", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "殺重身輕，移身有損。如戊寅壬戌壬戌己酉是也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/031", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-032", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-032", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "歲則變官爲鬼，旺則化鬼爲官。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/032", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-033", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-033", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：若日主衰弱，縱有官星，當他不得，故變官爲鬼；若日主旺，歲縱有七殺，其殺自降伏，當他鬼爲官，乃主大富貴之命也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/033", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-034", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-034", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "月生日干，運行不喜財鄉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/034", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-035", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-035", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：月生日干，即印綬也，印乃母也，故曰生。忌財破之，則運不行。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/035", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-036", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-036", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "日主無依，卻喜運行財地。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/036", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-037", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-037", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：甲乙生於春月，柱中若無財官，謂之無依。若行辰戌丑未運，以土爲財，方可發福。餘者倣此而推。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/037", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-038", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-038", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "時歸日祿，生平不喜官星。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/038", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-039", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-039", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：命中祿居時，最怕官星，所以強破藏，反貴爲賤矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/039", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-040", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-040", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "陰若朝陽，切忌丙丁離位。朝音潮。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/040", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-041", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-041", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此言六辛日見丙丁，子時也。歲月若見丙丁二字，乃南方火傷了辛，所以不喜。若見丙丁，當主大富貴，命居一品之尊，此爲吉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/041", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-042", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-042", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "太歲乃衆殺之主，入命未必爲災，若遇鬬戰之鄉必主刑於本命。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/042", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-043", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-043", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：丙丁反尅庚辛，壬癸遇之不畏，戊己尅運，甲乙干頭須要庚辛壬癸透運，戊己甲乙臨之有救。壬來尅丙須要戊字當頭，癸去傷丁卻喜己來相制。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/043", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-044", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-044", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "歲傷日干，有禍必輕；日犯歲君，災殃必重。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/044", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-045", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-045", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：若太歲尅日干，謂爲父怒其子，其情可恕；日尅歲君，如子怒父，罪不可赦也。假如太歲庚辛，日干甲乙則災輕；日干庚辛，太歲甲乙無救則災重。五行有救，其年反必爲財；四柱無情，故論名爲尅歲。此言日犯歲君，若當生有救，禍減一半，其言反招其財；若無食神救之，便是造意不好，主害歲君還傷日主。如甲日尅戊歲君，得己字在，便是夫婦貪合有情；若無配合，尅己歲君，干頭有庚亦是夫婦貪合有情。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/045", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-046", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-046", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚得壬男制丙，天作長年；甲以乙妹妻庚，凶爲吉兆。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/046", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-047", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-047", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：庚金最怕丙火，有壬水制伏。庚甲忌見庚金，得乙姊配與鶴，妻財旺，甲爲妻兄，以獲凶爲吉也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/047", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-048", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-048", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "天元雖旺，若無依倚是常人；日主太柔，縱遇財官爲寒士。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/048", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-049", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-049", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：碧玉歌曰：天元日主太旺，歲時月印財官三才不顯，主貧寒，借道孤刑之漢。日柔至無生旺，財官多戊生殘，當之不住，守寒窗辛苦囊消貌狀。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/049", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-050", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-050", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "女人無煞帶二德，作兩代之封。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/050", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-051", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-051", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：凡陰人之命不宜見偏官，若有天月二德全者，必主有封贈矣。天月二德命中者，主仁慈惠溫良，鎮壓諸煞不敢犯也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/051", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-052", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-052", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "男命身強遇三奇，爲一品之貴。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/052", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-053", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-053", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：日主高強當貴，財官印較俱全。甲逢辛巳癸爲祿，乙戊庚壬二丙癸辛乙位丁，主庚甲高遇戊喜癸乙丁卯巳，壬申丙三元，庚辛壬癸丙位依前無破，名登金殿。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/053", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-054", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-054", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲逢丁而生旺，定復中正之心。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/054", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-055", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-055", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：甲逢己土合生旺，富貴榮華定可量，常懷中正得人，必當遇貴人須可望。甲屬東方生旺之氣，主乎仁；土屬中央厚重之氣，主乎信，甲己化土，爲而忠厚人正直之輩。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/055", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-056", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-056", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丁遇壬而太過，必犯淫訛之亂。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/056", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-057", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-057", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：丁遇壬而太過，多陰獨隔盛，主淫訛。男因酒色須傾天，女主私通內亂多。丁與壬爲合，丁日見壬水則伏，太過主淫亂。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/057", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-058", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-058", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙臨申位逢陽水，難獲延年。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/058", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-059", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-059", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：丙臨申位火無煙，陽水逢之命不堅，若得土來相助助，卻加福壽享延年。若丙申日主行壬申壬辰壬子運，主夭壽。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/059", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-060", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-060", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "己入亥宮見陰木，終爲損壽。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/060", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-061", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-061", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：己亥日主行乙木及亥卯未運主壽夭。己爲強土見雙魚，陰木臨之壽必磽，四柱若無金救助，置都岳嶺壽元虛。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/061", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-062", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-062", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚值寅而遇丙，生旺無危。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/062", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-063", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-063", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：庚寅日主而遇柱中有丙火，若庚金多亦無害，謂之多則生出艮土，土又生庚金，故無危也。庚逢寅位祿當權，丙火重逢祿必延，身旺鬼長須酒可，殺化爲權。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/063", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-064", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-064", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "乙遇巳而見辛，身衰有禍。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/064", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-065", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-065", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：女木衰殘若見辛金，壽必難，不得丙丁來救助，豈知安樂不成歡。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/065", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-066", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-066", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "乙逢庚旺，常存仁義之風。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/066", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-067", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-067", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：乙日見申月之類，此格有仁義之人也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/067", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-068", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-068", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲日生於春月，柱逢卯二重溫，財食印官旺處，太旺反天窮，術家良究似中談命方穩。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/068", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-069", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-069", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：此官金生火地丙丁童見男主，此格又遇刑傷未破反爲貴，可便作貴推；局相無破害終是貧儒；此言母多子多則爲體全之象；癸亥年甲子月癸亥日癸亥時此影子祖之命；此言行東方運方可論壽。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/069", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-070", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-070", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "木向春生，處世安然必壽。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/070", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-071", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-071", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：甲乙生於三月，丙丁生於夏三月，庚辛生於秋三月，壬癸生於冬三月，戊己生於辰戌丑未月，皆節氣內也，主壽高生平病少無憂。水歸冬旺，生平樂自無憂。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/071", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-072", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-072", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "一木重逢火位，名爲氣散之文。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/072", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-073", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-073", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：甲乙日生重見丙丁之火，則澄澄氣也。木生火木榮昌，木火通明佐廟廊，一木疊逢離火位，終身泄氣落文章。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/073", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-074", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-074", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "獨水三犯庚辛，號曰體全之象。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/074", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-075", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-075", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：壬日生重見庚申酉，則印殺生身主富貴也。獨水三犯庚辛重，金能生水還同年，生骨格天年透，名利雙全福祿豐，主大富貴。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/075", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-076", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-076", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙合辛生，鎮掌威權之職。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/076", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-077", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-077", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：丙日見辛酉辛巳月，此局主有柄之命矣。丙合辛生非是賤，掀轟名利莫羨，不然閣顯公卿執掌威權難有變。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/077", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-078", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-078", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "乙逢庚旺，是官星遇當之宰相逢，若遇五行有衝破，人常存仁義鎮邊疆。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/078", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-079", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-079", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：金弱遇火炎之地，血疾無疑。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/079", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-080", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-080", "text_layer": "UNVERIFIED", "source_text": "（p97-98 疾病論：金主肺，肺者心之華，蓋金若被火來沖，必主因酒色成疾，肺心受傷，血脈病也。土虛逢木旺之鄉，脾傷定論。庚辛金受氣於寅卯，制必受脾腹塞病之症。筋疼骨痛，蓋因木被金傷。眼昏目暗，必是火遭水尅。肝屬木，心屬火，腎屬水，水尅火無相生之道，故有眼暗目昏之疾者矣。下元冷疾，必是水值火傷。腎主北方水，心屬南方火，腎水上昇，心火下降，爲既濟，若上下不交，則有冷疾之症矣。金逢艮而遇土，號曰還魂，得土生金，故曰還魂。水入巽而見金，名爲不絕。壬水受氣於巳，水得金而能生水，故曰不絕。戊土生至卯，死沐浴之地，雖是中年遇退，五行遇此必挫其志氣也。金至於暴敗中，沐浴之地男子至此必挫其志。賦云：不仁不義，庚辛與甲乙爭差；或或是或非，壬癸與丙丁相畏。）", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/080", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段首为（校注前缀：…）括号说明，疑混排", "evidence_grade": "D"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-081", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-081", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "木從水養，水盛而木則漂流。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/081", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-082", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-082", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：水生木弱，用金土爲貴，太旺財官失矣。甲子生居子地，但逢一丁奇，壬癸亥子星干支，則木漂流無倚。辛亥年提庚子甲申乙丑時，支年運通水之災無疑矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/082", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-083", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-083", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "金賴土生，土厚而金遭埋沒。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/083", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-084", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-084", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：金遭土埋沒而乏光輝矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/084", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-085", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-085", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "是以五行不可偏枯，務稟中和之氣，更須絕慮忘思，鑑命無差誤矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/085", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-079-086", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "正氣官星（繼善篇注）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-079-086", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：看命要審節氣淺深，旺相爲福，休囚爲禍，皆須順逆向背之理，只以中和爲貴。命旺相爲福，休囚爲禍，皆絕格非局爲下賤矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-079", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/079/086", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_079.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-080-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論官星太過", "text_id": "YHZP-T-080-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "身不弱者便爲貴命。如命中有官星而行傷官之運則不吉，必待印綬官星旺運可發，必得官。如壬癸生人，四柱是辰戌丑未巳午，天干不露官星與殺，則官殺暗藏於中爲多，若四柱元有爲好。若無制伏，須行木運與三合木局亦好。大凡官星多則雜務，要除而清之乃可發福；若官星多又行官運，亦不濟事。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-080", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/080/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_080.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-081-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論偏官（即七殺）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-081-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫偏官者，蓋甲木見庚金之類。陽見陽，陰見陰，乃謂之偏官，不成配偶，猶如經言二女不能同居、二男不可並處是也。偏官即七殺。要制伏，蓋偏官七殺即小人，小人無知，多凶暴無忌憚，乃能勞力以養君子，而服役護御君子者小人也。惟是不懲不戒，無術以控制之，則不能馴伏而爲用。故楊子曰：御得其道，則馴伏或作使；御失其道，則狙詐或作敵。小人者狙詐也，要控御得其道矣。一失控制，小人得權則禍立見矣。經曰：人有偏官，如抱虎而眠，睡覺錯矣。或見以禍，或遇刑六害，或羊刃，或星相沖，如是之凶不可謂之制伏，但運日及時。又有六害，復遇魁罡相沖，如是人之凶不可具述。制伏得位，運復行制伏之鄉，此大貴之命也。苟於前著凶神俱聚，運游殺旺之鄉，凶害有不可言者可知也。如有一殺而制伏有三，三復行制伏之運，反不作福。何以言之？蓋盡法無法，雖猛如狼不能制伏矣。是又不可專言制伏，要須輕重得所，不可太甚亦不可不及，須仔細審詳而言，則禍福如影響矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-081", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/081/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_081.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-081-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論偏官（即七殺）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-081-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "又云：有制伏則爲偏官，無制伏則爲七殺。譬諸小人，御之得其道則可使，失其道則難敵，在吾控制御之道何如耳。凡見此殺勿便言凶，殊不知帶此殺多有貴，如遇三刑六害或羊刃或星相沖，如是之凶不可謂之制伏，只運日及時。傷官七殺最喜身旺有制伏爲妙，元有制伏可行殺旺之方，元無制伏可行制伏。此貴人命也。苟如前凶神俱聚，其運復行殺旺之鄉，禍不可言。大抵制伏之運，身旺化之得爲偏官，身弱無制伏則爲七殺；制伏復行制伏運，謂之大運，則爲偏官無餘燼矣。月中之氣怕沖與羊刃，其本身弱，若殺強則難制；如身旺殺淺，則是假殺爲權。經曰：七殺不恆刑沖，宜詳之。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-081", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/081/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_081.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-082-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論七殺（即偏官）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-082-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫七殺者，亦名偏官。喜身旺，合殺，喜制伏，喜羊刃；忌身弱，忌見財生，忌無制。身旺有氣爲偏官，身弱無制爲七殺。凡有此殺不可便言凶，有正官不如偏官，多有巨富大貴之人，惟其身旺合殺爲妙。如甲以庚爲七殺，喜丙丁制之，乙合之，謂之貪合忘殺。七殺卻宜制伏，亦不要制之太過，蓋物極則反爲禍矣。身旺又行身旺之運爲福，如身弱又行身弱之鄉，禍不旋踵。四柱中原有制伏，喜行七殺運；原無制伏，七殺出爲禍；如行身旺鄉，更有羊刃，貴不可言。凡居則時見前生殺故也，居退鄉之運時亦多凶。甲申乙酉丑戌寅己卯辛未癸未，此七日生主殺，性急伶俐，心巧聰明。如見殺多者，主人凶夭貧薄。月見之重，時見之輕。何也？日七殺只一位見之，如年時再見殺多爲禍，只要制伏之輕，又要身有制伏爲福，最怕申見羊刃大凶。只一位要本身旺，如年月時三處有制伏爲福，卻要行殺旺運，運三合得地亦發；若無制伏則要行制伏爲福，行殺旺運無制伏則禍作。時上七殺卻不怕羊刃而亦不畏沖。如辛丑乙未乙卯丙子，此命身旺生於六月之中，歲干透出辛丑爲七殺，喜得丙子合辛丑之殺，乃貴而有權。又如甲午丙寅庚子丙子，此命身弱見火局，又見月令丙寅七殺，時又見丙子，火尅庚金，金死於子，身弱殺旺又無制伏，宜乎帶病貧薄。如丁巳戊申壬子戊申，此命身旺見二戊爲七殺，引歸於巳，丁與壬合、戊與癸合，金又長生於巳、戊祿在巳，乃壬戊二字俱旺，所以貴也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-082", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/082/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_082.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-083-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論印綬", "text_id": "YHZP-T-083-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲見癸爲正印，乙見壬爲正印。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-083", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/083/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_083.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-083-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論印綬", "text_id": "YHZP-T-083-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：以言之，大抵人生得物以相助、相生相養，使我得萬物之見成，豈不妙乎？故主人多智慮兼豐厚。蓋印綬畏財，主人括囊，故四柱中及運行官貴反成其禍，蓋官鬼能生我，只要其財而財能反傷我，此印綬之嫌者多受其殃，承父之賞，財見成安享之人。若又以兩三命相併，當以印綬多者爲上，又主一生少病能飲食；或若財多乘旺，必多淹留。雖喜官鬼，而官鬼多或入格，又不可專以印綬言之。假如甲乙日得亥子月生、丙丁日得寅卯月生、戊己日得巳午月生、庚辛日得辰戌丑未月生、壬癸日得申酉月生者是也，其餘以類言之。最怕行印綬死絕之運，或運臨死絕復有物以解之，即入黃泉無可疑也。夫印綬者生我之謂也，亦名生氣，以陽見陰、以陰見陽謂之正印，陽見陽、陰見陰謂之偏印。喜官星生印，忌財旺破印。如甲人生亥子月中，水爲印，忌火傷官，忌土破印，日要行生旺之鄉。傷之則危矣。印綬之人智慮一生，少病能飽食，豐厚享見成財祿，若兩三命相併，當以印綬多者取之。最忌財來乘旺，必生淹滯；若官鬼多或入刑格，又不可專以印綬論。大凡用與時上見者爲妙，而月上最忌。要先論月氣之後有生氣，必得父母之力；年下有生氣，必得祖宗之力；於時上見之有生氣，必得子孫之力，壽元耐久，晚景優游。如帶印綬須帶官星，謂之官印兩全，必爲貴命。若官星雖見，成得父母力爲福亦厚也，須行官星運便發，或行印綬運亦發。若用官不顯，用印綬爲妙。最怕四柱中歲運臨財鄉以傷其印，若傷印主破家離祖出贅，又臨死絕之地，若非降官失職必夭其壽。且如戊戌庚申癸酉庚申，此命癸日生於七月中氣之後，月時皆是庚申，自坐金庫，所以印綬，歲干又透出戊官，謂之官印兩全，極爲貴命。且如癸亥癸亥甲寅甲子，此日用癸爲印，印旺，歲無財星相劫，發福不厚。且如甲寅壬戌壬子，此日戊用丁爲印綬，有寅午戌火局爲好，不合時上壬子水旺，財能沖印，所以失明。生氣是丙丁火屬木故也。且如己卯丁卯丙辰壬辰，此命用卯爲印，用癸爲官，年在卯、日在辰，所以官印兩全，少年清要；至四十二三歲亥運亦不妨；至庚申年，水七殺生於申，乃被庚申破印，故不吉也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-083", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/083/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_083.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-084-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論正財（主尅母）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-084-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "何謂之正財？猶如正官之意，是陰見陽財、陽見陰財。大抵正官吾妻之財也，人之女賣財以事我，必精神康強然後可以享用之。如吾身方且自養，壎而不振，雖妻財豐厚，但能目視，終不可一毫受用。故財要得時，不要財多。若財多，則自家日主有力可以勝任，當化作官，天元一氣羸弱貧薄難治，是樂於身旺，不要行尅制之鄉，尅制者官鬼也。又怕所生之月令正吾衰病之地，又四柱無父母以生之，反喜財。又有見財謂之財多，力不任財，禍患百出，雖少年經休囚之位故不如意，事多頻併；或中年或末年復臨父母之鄉，或三合可以助我者，則劫煞而異，不可釁也。倘少年乘旺，若在脫局，不惟寡蹇，且兼是非紛起，蓋財者起爭之端也。若或四柱相生，別帶貴格，不值空亡，又行旺運三合財生，是皆貴命，其餘福之淺深皆隨入格輕重而言之。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-084", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/084/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_084.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-084-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論正財（主尅母）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-084-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：財多生官要須身健，財多盜財，木自身柔，末年運又或身健亦可奇遇，或帶刑比殺凶不可言也。又云正財者喜身旺印綬，忌官星，忌倒食，忌身弱，比肩劫財不可見，官星忌盜財之氣也，喜印綬者能生身主弱故也。且如甲日用己爲正財，如身弱其禍立至。凡人命帶財下生，須出富豪，不螟蛉必庶出，或沖父母。身旺無劫財無官星爲妙。若命中有官星得地運行，喜財星多生官兼有財星得地，運行忌見官星，恐尅其身怕身弱也。大抵財不論偏正，皆喜印綬必能發福。如辛丑丁酉丁巳丁未，此命丁日身坐財之地，又見巳酉丑金局，故主財旺，蓋金得木庫居未，能生丁火，故身旺能當其財，運行庚南方宜乎壬官，用庚金爲財生壬官，身入旺鄉必能發福，凡用財不見官星爲妙。又如庚申乙酉丙申丙申，此命丙日見三申爲財，豈不美哉？丙用癸官，用辛爲財，見三申爲財旺，蓋緣日弱火病申死酉，乃爲無氣，運行酉方金鄉，身弱太甚，財旺生鬼敗尅其身，故不能勝其財，所以貧也。又如乙卯癸未辛酉戊子，此命若日坐酉、年坐卯，身與財俱旺，又得癸未食神、戊子印綬助之，宜乎巨富貴也。又如戊子丁巳甲辰丙寅，此命甲日生於四月下旬並透出丙丁火，生其月中之戊土，時又歸祿於寅，故財旺矣，然甲木身亦旺。早年行戊午己未運，迤邐行辛酉運乃見官星則凶，壬戌運有壬尅丙，傷官食神之中失官去財，死喪合家，值五十九歲入癸亥身旺運稍可安逸，六十五歲逢壬辰年死矣。初運傷官見財格，取戊土爲財，所以戊午己未二運大旺生土，故財厚矣；及至庚申辛酉西方見官，故凡事費力；雖癸亥爲甲木之印綬，然亦忌木沖水，亥中又有壬水，壬辰透出壬水，運中命中元有之辰死無疑矣。凡傷官見財格忌見官星，喜見財，大忌見壬水尅火，則火不能生甲木之土財也。有化辛之妙。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-084", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/084/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_084.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-085-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論偏財", "text_id": "YHZP-T-085-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "何謂之偏財？蓋陽見陽財，陰見陰財，堪然。偏財者乃衆人之財也，身弱兄弟姊妹有奪之則福不全，若有官星禍患百出，故曰偏財好出，亦不懼藏，惟怕有以分奪，反空亡耳。有一於此，官將不成、財將不住。經曰：背祿逐馬，守窮途而悽惶也。財弱亦待歷旺鄉而榮，財盛無所往而不妙，且恐身勢無力耳。偏財主人慷慨，不甚吝財，惟是得地，不止財豐，亦能官旺。何以言之？蓋財盛自生官矣。但爲人有情而多詐，蓋財能利己亦能招誘，運行旺相禍祿俱臻，只恐太旺兄弟必多破壞亦不美。財多須看財與我之日干強弱相等，行官鄉便可發祿；若財盛而身弱，運至官鄉，是既被財之盜氣復被官之尅身，非惟不發祿，亦妨福患。如論旺相尤宜慎之。惟有合局未中見官星出，縱入官鄉發祿必渺矣，故曰要在識其變通矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-085", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/085/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_085.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-086-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論食神", "text_id": "YHZP-T-086-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "食神者，生我財神之謂也。如甲屬木、丙屬火，名盜氣，故謂之食神。何也？殊不知丙能生我戊土，中食丙之戊財，故以此名之也。命帶此者，主人財厚食豐，腹量寬洪，肌體肥大，優游自足，有子息有壽考，恆不喜見官星，忌倒食恐傷其食神，喜財神相生，獨一位見之則爲福人，然終亦不清，卻喜身旺，不喜印綬亦恐傷其食神也，如運得地方可發福，大概與財神相似。如己未己巳丁未辛丑，丁見巳爲食神，有一丑巳合起金局得之爲財，又喜身不弱，所以有官亦有壽也。如乙巳乙酉癸酉乙卯，此命見三乙爲食神，見巳酉丑合局爲印綬，又有三乙化爲傷官，癸用乙爲食神，被金局來尅乙木，再被三乙木并卯旺尅我官，所以名利都無成也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-086", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/086/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_086.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-087-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論倒食", "text_id": "YHZP-T-087-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫倒食者，《朱氏日者》云：名曰倒食。若甲見壬之類。如甲見丙爲食神，能生土財，然壬尅丙，丙火不能生甲木之土財，所謂甲用食神大忌見之。凡命中帶此二者主福淺壽薄，又見此爲七殺，最忌丁火制之，自是木成。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-087", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/087/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_087.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-088-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論傷官", "text_id": "YHZP-T-088-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "傷官見官，爲禍百端。倘月令在傷官之位，及四柱配合作事皆在傷官之處，又行傷官者，其驗如神。傷官務要傷盡，傷之不盡，官來乘旺，其禍不可勝言。傷官見官，爲禍百端，衆人亦惡之，運一逢官禍不可言。或有吉神可解，必生惡疾以殘其軀，不然運遭官事。如運行剝官財神不旺，皆是安享之人，仔細推詳萬無一失矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-088", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/088/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_088.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-088-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論傷官", "text_id": "YHZP-T-088-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：又云傷官者，我生彼之謂也，以陽見陰、陰見陽，亦名盜氣。印綬若傷盡不留一點，身弱忌官星，不怕七殺。如甲用辛官，如丁火旺能生土財，最忌見官星，亦要身旺。若傷官不盡，四柱有官星露，歲運若見官星，其禍不可勝言；若傷官傷盡，四柱不留一點，又行旺運及印綬運，卻爲貴也。如四柱中雖傷盡官星，雖旺若無一點財氣，只爲貧寒。如遇傷官者須見財爲妙，若能生官也。如用傷官格者，支干歲運都不要見官星，如見官星謂之傷官見官，爲禍百端。用傷官格局見財方可用，傷官之殺甚如傷身七殺，其驗如祿。年帶傷官必凶不全，月帶傷官成不全，時帶傷官成不全。其餘傷官務要傷盡則吉，見財方可；輕則遠竄之災，重則刑辟之難，傷官有戰其命難存。若月令在傷官之位及四柱相合皆在傷官之處，如行身旺鄉貴命也。傷官之人多負才傲物，常以他人不如己，君子惡之、小人畏之，逢官運無財救必主大災，不然主暗昧惡疾以殘其身，或運遭官刑矣。如四柱雖傷盡官星，身若逢財運發福，是爲傷官見財，仔細推詳萬無一失。又云四柱有官而被禍重，四柱無官而被禍則淺。大凡四柱見官者，或見傷官而取其財，財行得地則發，行敗財之地必死，如運支內無財、運干虛露亦不吉也。如己巳庚辰丁巳戊午，傷官只是壬辰金庫，又時上有庚字作財，此人行申酉限如意，入金脫氣遂死矣。大抵傷官星行官運則災連，太歲亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-088", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/088/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_088.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-089-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論劫財（亦名逆刃）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-089-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "如乙見甲爲劫財。乙以庚爲夫，見丙尅庚，故尅夫，男命則尅妻。五陽見五陰爲財，主尅妻；五陽見五陰爲劫財，主破耗，小人尅妻。乙以戊己爲財，甲見奪己壞戊；丁以庚辛爲財，丙能奪辛破庚，類如此也。兄見弟能敗兄之財、奪兄之妻；弟見兄，兄能尅弟之財而不敢取弟之妻。財者人之所欲，方令弟兄見之，多有爭競，如夷齊能幾人？男命見劫財多尅妻，女命見傷官多尅夫，此極論也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-089", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/089/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_089.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-090-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論羊刃", "text_id": "YHZP-T-090-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫羊刃者，號天上之凶星，作人間之惡殺，以祿前一位是也。如甲祿在寅，喜偏官七殺，喜印綬，忌反伏吟，忌魁罡，忌三合。何謂羊刃？甲丙戊庚壬五陽有刃，乙己辛癸丑陰刃，故名羊刃，不有便凶。大率此殺刃之類，凡有刃者多主富貴，人卻喜偏財七殺，然殺無刃不顯、刃無殺不威，刃殺俱全非常人有之。大要身旺，運行身旺之鄉，不要見官刃旺運，若命中元有殺刃，歲運又逢之，其禍非常。若命有刃無殺，歲運逢殺旺之鄉，乃轉生而反成厚福。如傷官財旺身弱殺旺，最可忌也。如庚申己卯甲寅，此命甲日見卯爲刃、庚爲七殺，其殺本傷身，卻藉卯中乙木以配合其殺有情，則殺不能傷身，正是甲以乙妹妻庚之義，其身旺南方運所以爲貴。又如戊午戊午戊午甲寅，此命刃殺全而又以午火爲印，所以爲貴，故喜忌篇云：戊日午月，勿作刃看，歲時火多卻爲印綬。又如辛酉甲午戊午甲寅，此命殺刃全而有印綬，不合年干傷官透出，運行辛卯犯傷官，元有之辰壬爲財，是壬辰歲凶事投水而死。壬水尅火印，日坐甲之七殺，謂之生殺壞印，即此命見辛爲傷官，運行辛卯忌見官，午中丁火爲印綬，最忌傷官與財相見，緣水生木尅身也。又如癸未乙卯甲子己巳，此命卯刃癸印，不合時上己巳破印，運行辛亥，亥卯未合起羊刃，辛酉年辛金又旺於酉，沖起卯刃，二辛則太過，金多見甲。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-090", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/090/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_090.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-090-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論羊刃", "text_id": "YHZP-T-090-002", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：時官中見官傷千綱千，合忌才旺名三大，完損殺不刑輕重，此格在天掌伐之地刑，羊刃無權殺，生殺有印有官無刑或，爲相官合即殺身有利沖，惡殺行辛有財爲宰再如，則嚴順主貢的爲殺行死，及諸殺囉索牢若倒戈羊刃定主砍頭。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-090", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/090/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_090.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-091-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論刑合", "text_id": "YHZP-T-091-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "刑合者，刑中有帶合者是也。如人命犯之，多因酒色喪家成病，至於耽迷不省，乃神迷之也。如十八格中有合祿合格者，何謂也？是乃癸用戊官，戊祿在巳，不見巳字，但見寅刑，但巳酉丑合，此乃見不見之形，所以貴也；如此者皆見於前，所以凶也。且如丙子辛卯丙子辛卯，此命年月日時俱帶刑合，爲子水沖丙火兼身又弱，二十六交甲午、三十六交丙申年，太歲併在羊刃之上，有二字沖午，其刃刑俱合，所以因酒淫佚而亡也。又如己巳己巳甲寅己巳，此命身旺財旺，身入長生，故爲入格，不合帶刑合太重，交癸亥沖巳而飲酒耽色，遂患痼疾而死。又如乙卯癸未戊戌癸丑，此命女人戊戌日生於六月中旬，歲干透出乙字，戊日見之爲官，地支亥卯未木局生戊中之火爲戊之印綬，官印兩全，只不合癸丑時癸水沖戌中之火、丑中之金傷官兼刑合重，身雖貴亦遭刑也。然雖見辛爲貴，所忌羊刃不可合一沖也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-091", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/091/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_091.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-092-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論福德秀氣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-092-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "福德秀氣，專用其主也。且如乙巳乙酉乙丑是也。乙用庚官，露出殺，喜制喜印綬，不喜生於八月之中，恐露其殺，卻喜行印綬官旺運便能發福。四柱中露出辛殺須制伏，如丁巳丁酉丁丑是壬爲官，喜金旺生水，亦不喜生於八月，故火死在酉，卻喜行官旺運便可發福，亦不要露雜其官，爲壽而不耐久。己巳己酉己丑是用甲木爲官，巳酉丑金局皆傷其官，亦名盜氣，何以爲吉？雖然喜得金局能生水財，亦不要四柱見火恐傷金局，卻喜行財運便發。癸巳癸酉癸丑是用金神爲印，見巳酉丑金局能生癸水，不喜生於四月水絕於巳，雖然金生在巳，以金能生水，亦不能絕，得官印運便能發福，最不喜財恐傷金也，大抵與印綬相似，各有例於後。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-092", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/092/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_092.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-093-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論雜氣（辰戌丑未也）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-093-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "雜氣者，蓋謂辰戌丑未之位也。辰中有乙癸戊字，戌中有辛丁戊字，丑中有癸辛己字，未中有丁己乙字，此四者天地不正之氣也。且如甲則鎮於寅位，辰爲東南之陷及春夏交接之界，受氣不純，稟命不一，故名雜氣也，丑未戌亦然。雖看六甲何加以論之，假如日干是甲而得丑月，貴既在中，辛則爲正官，癸爲之印綬，己則爲正財，不知用何者爲福，要在四柱中看透出是何字，隨其所出而言其吉凶，有如前說法。但庫中物皆閉藏，須待有以開其扃鑰方言發福，所以開扃鑰者何物也？乃刑沖破害耳。且如四柱中元有刑沖破害，復行此等運氣，則刑沖破害多反傷其福。大抵雜氣要財多便是貴命，若年時別入他格，當以他格例斷之，蓋此乃天地之雜氣，不能統一故少力耳，別格專於時年乃重事看命。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-093", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/093/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_093.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-094-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日貴", "text_id": "YHZP-T-094-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "日貴者何？即甲戊兼牛羊之類，正有四日：丁酉、丁亥、癸巳、癸卯耳。最怕刑沖破害。運行怕空亡及運行太歲，加會不要魁罡。主人純粹有仁德，有姿色不傲物，或犯前刑尅貧賤。刑沖太甚，貴人生怒反成其禍，不可不察。日貴有時法類同，須分晝夜貴，日要日貴，夜要夜貴矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-094", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/094/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_094.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-095-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日德", "text_id": "YHZP-T-095-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "日德有五：甲寅、戊辰、丙辰、庚辰、壬戌日是也。其福要多，而忌刑沖破害，惡官星、憎財旺加臨會合，但空亡而忌魁罡，此數者乃格之大忌也。大抵日德主人性格慈善，日德俱多，福必豐厚，運行身旺，大是奇絕；若有財官加臨，別奪他祿，正自多主不來，日身已衰。三魁罡主歹必凶，可未登庸；或三魁罡格既好，防生禍患，一脫於此必能再發，終力微矣，不可不知也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-095", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/095/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_095.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-096-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論日刃", "text_id": "YHZP-T-096-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "日刃與陽刃同。日刃有戊午、丙午、壬子也，與陽刃同法。不喜刑沖破害，不喜會合，兼受七殺，要行官祿便爲貴命。若四柱中一來會合，必主奇福，其人眼大髯長，性剛果毅，無惻隱惠慈之心，有刻削不恤之意。三刑自刑，魁罡全，發跡疆場；如或無情或財旺，則主其凶，或有救神要先審察。如刑害俱全，類皆得地，貴不可言也。安得不舉獨陽刃以時言之，四柱中不要入財鄉，怕沖陽刃。且如戊日刃在午，忌行子正財運；壬刃在子，忌行午正財運；庚刃在酉，忌行卯正財運；甲日行巳午并辰戌丑未財運不妨，忌酉運；丙日刃在午，行申酉庚辛丑不妨，忌子運。大抵陽刃要身旺，喜有物以去之。經曰：人有鬼人，物有鬼物，逢之爲災，去之爲福。且如葛參政命：壬申壬子戊午乙卯，戊日刃在午，喜得乙卯時正官制伏去了，所以爲福也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-096", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/096/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_096.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-097-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論魁罡", "text_id": "YHZP-T-097-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫魁罡者有四：壬辰、庚戌、戊辰、庚辰日是也。如日位加臨者，必是福，運行身旺，發福百端，一見財官禍患立至。主人性格聰明，文章振發，臨事有斷，惟是奸狡。若四柱有財及官成帶則發，福不可測；而日對魁中者，大來必是小人，刑責不已，窮必徹骨，運臨財官旺處亦防奇禍。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-097", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/097/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_097.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-098-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論金神", "text_id": "YHZP-T-098-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫金神者，止有三：時癸酉、己巳、乙丑金神，乃破敗之神，要制伏，入火鄉爲勝。如四柱中更帶七殺陽刃，真貴人也。大抵威猛者以強暴爲能威，苟不專人得以侮，故必狠暴如虎，動羣獸既懾威，德行矣，然太剛必折，不有以制之則寬猛不濟，何以上履中和之道？故曰有剛者在駒伏，調致其和，福祿臻至。雖然，其人有剛斷明敏之才、倔強不可馴伏之志，運行火鄉、四柱有火局便爲貴，命罹水鄉則非福矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-098", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/098/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_098.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-099-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論時墓", "text_id": "YHZP-T-099-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫時墓之論，謂財官之墓，時論之也。要刑沖破害以開扃鑰，其人必難發於少年。經曰：少年不發墓中人也。怕有物以壓之，如丁用辰爲庫官，別有戊辰之類制之，則丁不能官矣，如此難作好命，必乃有物以破其戊，雖得之發福也。經曰：長才亦如之，此是秘言不可輕泄。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-099", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/099/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_099.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "月上有官星者是也，時上兼有財星者與喜印殺，喜身旺，怕沖，忌見傷官七殺，大運亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：官星宜露，豈可藏之？似乎爲官者顯揚威德，則用之國家者方爲大丈夫，豈受人之壓伏者則爲臣下之臣，豈非小人。注（p100 正官論）：又曰於月令得之是也，喜身旺印綬，如甲用辛官，喜土生官，最怕刑沖破害羊刃七殺爲貴命。如時干逢殺，乃官殺混雜。蓋四柱有刑沖破害，皆未爲貴命。看官來尅我，我去尅官不爲害，一位若兩官不妨。若月令中有正官，時干支有偏官，便難以正官言之。且如甲用辛爲官，生於八月中氣之後，金旺在酉，故謂之正官。如丁壬不透出，壬與去坤支，不巳酉丑，是丁能入月，印氣之後亦可言官。大要身旺，時辰歸於甲木旺處。如歲時透出正官，地支又有官格，卻不拘八月中氣之後。大率官星須得印綬身旺則發，若無傷官破印，露恐福渺矣。又須看年時上別有是何人格作福去處，方可斷其吉凶。一途而執取之則不能通變，必有差之惡，要以千里之遠。經曰：通變以爲神者是也。正官或多反不爲福，何以言之？蓋人之命宜得中和之氣，太過與不及同。中和之氣爲福厚，偏黨之尅爲災殃。既用提綱作正官，年時支干位或有一偏官便雜矣，不可不仔細以輕重推測也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "○雜氣財官格局，辰戌丑未是也。多則正氣切忌刑沖，官星刑沖官星同。甲辰官殺，升事恐不成。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-004", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此格財官聚殺，如辰、戌、財、有乙木，戊寅戊土成官之辛丑，即木丁火己土也。義壬子則有辛金丁火戊土，丑宮則有癸水辛金巳土，未宮則有乙木丁火己土。批：二寅三卯寅卯巳辰，酉辛戌亥子丑寅卯辰巳午未申酉戌亥（干支循环表，OCR 噪声，略。）", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "喜身旺，怕沖，多爲人性重剛執不屈，時偏官多者亦然。喜見陽刃。月上偏官用地支只要一位，要行偏官運；若有甲子年時上又有之，卻要行偏官旺運，亦不要行官鄉，歲君亦然，爲太過而反成其禍，須要行制伏得地之運方發，與時偏官相似。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-006", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "時上偏財一位佳，是衝破不爲美。雖有時運亦敗。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-007", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（顶部批注）：帖丞相命，官水木喜基命，殺重喜申子時，水旺化爲生，更官行北方所以大貴也。注：如時上偏財與時上偏官相似，只要時上一位不要多，而三鬼不要再见財，卻怕沖，與月上偏官格同，偏財要財旺運。批（王鎮撫命例）：此格殺神太重喜行東方運身衰，八字火多水微，獨喜寅宮火旺，乃是一年之火，運行卯合成火局何益，又係濕木不生無焰火，則木自旺不能火，譬如橫水木於圍爐之上，此火縱悍力亦無由得盛，是以寅運丁卯運中而死，即六丙生人亥子多。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-008", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-008", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "天一立貴，唯時上一位立貴。我年月日時有反見三吉，故之人也。如時上一位七殺，要本身自旺，而三鬼有制，伏多則行七殺旺運。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/008", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-009", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-009", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：日自旺，如甲乙日在正二月生是也。時偏官爲人性重剛執不屈，月偏官多者亦然，合得地可發。若無制伏，則要行制伏之運，可發，或遇殺旺而無以制之，則禍癸。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/009", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-010", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-010", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以庚壬二日用子字多，沖午中丁己爲官星，要四柱中有寅字并未字，或戌字得一字可合爲妙。如六庚日、六壬日以子沖午字，庚日以子沖午中丁火爲官星，若四柱中有丁字并午字則減分數，歲君亦忌。如六壬日以子沖午中己土爲官星，若四柱中有巳字并午字則減分數，歲君大運亦須忌。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/010", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-011", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-011", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此既以子沖午宮己土爲官星，又不合見丙午時重官星，所以貧極爲乞丐之命也。批（詩訣）：庚午日主重逢子，沖祿馬號飛天，祿馬號飛天，貴如金木多清，何金木多清，運入南方虛有，連入南方虛有。又云：官逢多皆號飛天，除是天罡小吉是，天臺利自災宿福業綿。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/011", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-012", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-012", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "凡四柱中元無官星方用此格。以丙日爲主，用午字沖子中癸水，丙日得官星，不論合。若四柱有未字則午不能去沖矣，大忌癸字并子字則減分數，歲君大運亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/012", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-013", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-013", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：丙日須逢午字沖，午能沖子吉相逢；不須論合干嫌水，子癸相逢再見凶；午沖子癸是官星，功名榮達顯神京；最忌未宮相伴合，平生虛利又虛名。批（頂批）：此格要四柱中全無官星，是柱來合時官星不取貴，若虛乃見財不入此格，是衝破不爲貴財。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/013", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-014", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-014", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此以丁日爲主，用巳沖亥宮壬水爲丁之官星，不論合。若四柱中有辰字則巳不能沖矣，大忌四柱中有壬字并亥字則減分數，歲君大運亦同，運重歲君輕，再見亥辛則禍作矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/014", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-015", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-015", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：丁日多逢巳字通，局中無水貴和同；此格宜傷盡，見亥刑沖數必空。又批：丁日以巳多沖亥，巳岳辛巳壬水休，來四柱中何若，地支辰字出，何必來相隸貴雜。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/015", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-016", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-016", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格如月內有官星則不用之，大怕午字沖之。丙子時丙字爲妙，謂之聚貴也。或四柱中有庚字辛字并申字酉字丑字，內有庚金則減分數，歲君大運亦忌。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/016", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-017", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-017", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：陰木天干丙午，乙巳運貴富爲奇，沖官殺方爲無年，美少榮名遠風，池以日子爲主取貴在時。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/017", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-018", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-018", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以子暗合巳，巳動合申，庚祿居申，則用庚官，得引出庚金用事，喜子亥卯時爲妙，忌巳生寅，無沖害傷破子乙二字，及無財星。即六乙日子時，元有官星論，忌寅午戌沖，見庚申酉丑字有一位則減分數，歲君同亦忌，月通財官六格不用，大運亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/018", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-019", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-019", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：此格取秋冬生者爲妙，李武翼命干是庚申，被年干透出，卻合行乙丙字，再遇巳戌則見丙字，又忌酉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/019", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-020", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-020", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以六戊日爲主，以庚申時合卯中乙木爲戊官。四柱有甲乙字丙字巳字刑壞子申，丙傷庚字則減分數，歲君大運亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/020", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-021", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-021", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "六癸日爲主，喜逢庚申時，用申時合巳中戊土，癸日得官星。若四柱中有戊字并巳字刑壞了申時，或丙字及傷庚申時，則減分數，歲君大運亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/021", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-022", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-022", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：時遇庚申癸日生，爲印合官此官印合，不爲官殺嫌，火逢官殺嫌，名聲昭彰拜紫震。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/022", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-023", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-023", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以二甲子，子中癸水遙合巳中戊土，戊來合丙，丙來合酉中辛金，甲子日得官星，則巳酉丑三合官祿，要行官旺鄉運。忌四柱中有庚字七殺、辛金官星并申酉丑字絆住，則子不能去遙矣；若有午字沖子則減分數，歲君大運亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/023", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-024", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-024", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：甲子生逢甲子時，子來遙合巳中，戊能動丙酉知，甲得辛官丙可合，喜庚申辛酉出，丑來相絆亦非宜，更無午字相沖害，運入官鄉運必奇。又批：大忌寅來傷秀氣，庚申庚申庚申若生春夏惹災迍。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/024", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-025", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-025", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格只有辛丑、癸丑二日，用丑字多遙巳中丙戌，辛癸日得官星，丑字多爲妙。若四柱中有子字絆住，則丑不能去遙矣。要四柱中有申字并酉字，更兼壬丑，名爲遙巳合官星。如辛丑日，若四柱中有丙丁字并巳字午字則減分數，歲君大運同；癸丑日亦不要見戌字己字巳字丁字，得一字爲妙。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/025", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-026", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-026", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：甲子生逢甲子時，子來遙合巳中（見上，此頁與子遙巳格詩互見）。又批：喜庚申辛酉出，更無午字相沖害，運入官鄉運必奇。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/026", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-027", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-027", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以辰多者貴、寅多者富。壬日坐辰土，以丁爲財、以巳爲官。壬日以辰沖戌中丁戊，壬辰日得財官，而寅午戌三合，或壬日至寅，卻要年月時上多聚辰字方可用。若壬辰日有年月時上皆在寅字，只爲富命，以有午戌爲財得地；若年月時上辰字多，則沖出財來，所以貴也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/027", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-028", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-028", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：壬騎龍背喜非常，寅少辰多轉發揚；大忌官星來破格，刑沖須見壽元傷。又：壬騎龍背怕官居，重疊逢辰貴有餘；假若寅多辰字少，須應高富比陶朱。又：經曰騎龍背逢，經位是壬木龍腰之格，駝龍經又云壬騎龍背，又云壬辰多則戊戌情，寅貴則富，多則（殘）。又：壬辰日又見辰時，辰多辰來最是，年月辰來最是，四柱又逢寅位，土發財發福兩相宜。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/028", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-029", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-029", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格庚申庚子庚辰三處，須要四柱中申子辰三位全，不必三個庚字，若有三庚尤妙。只要庚日生申年月時，或戊子戊辰不妨，但得支是申子辰全也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/029", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-030", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-030", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：若時遇丙子則是偏官；若時是申時則是歸祿格而非井欄義矣。此格四柱中見寅午戌三字則沖壞矣。庚金爲官，以申子辰三合沖寅午戌火局，庚日得官星，行運如正氣，若行東方財地或南方皆好。若四柱中有巳字丙丁字則減分數，歲君大運亦然。批（詩訣）：庚日全逢井欄義，制官星局中無火方爲貴，破動提綱福亦臨。又：庚日喜逢全潤下，貴神名井欄，又丙丁巳午休相遇，申子辰官全乃佳。批：取庚日生子辰申，庚日生申水，水局庚申能生水，申子辰三合水局，又無井欄面井中積水故（殘）。又：宋大夫命因行歲運午字，原干有午故失職喪妻。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/030", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-031", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-031", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格假令六甲日生人得寅時，謂之歸祿，蓋日祿在寅，餘皆倣此。但四柱全不見官殺，見之則難歸矣。喜行身旺運，行食神傷之則難歸矣，官財運亦可發福，怕沖破。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/031", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-032", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-032", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：日祿歸時格最長，官殺喜身強，官殺見身若比肩，分劫祿見此，刑沖破害更難當。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/032", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-033", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-033", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以六辛日爲主，用丙火爲正官，喜逢戊土來動，丙辛日得官星，子字則要一位，多則不沖。若四柱中有丙字丁字午字，則沖子不沖，減分數，大運亦同。喜行西方，東南次之，最忌北方。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/033", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-034", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-034", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：辛逢戊子最相宜，名利高攀折桂枝；四季子季秋生無亥，榮華富貴正篇奇。又：癸巳巳生人值甲寅（殘）。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/034", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-035", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-035", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以六癸日生人爲主，用戊土爲正氣官星，喜逢甲寅時，用寅刑巳中戊土，癸日得官星。如庚寅刑不成，惟甲寅時是，行運與飛天祿馬同。若四柱中有戊字巳字則減分數，又怕庚寅傷甲字刑壞了，忌申字則減分數，歲君大運亦忌。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/035", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-036", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-036", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：陰水寅時格正清，此爲刑合格篇，俱無戊戌庚申，若是拔金帶葉人，運行若不逢蛇地，方得清高有利名；又愁庚尅不能刑，更忌官星來尅破，只忌塡實見官，好藏一位庫中，拱祿我伴水身比是雨（殘）。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/036", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-037", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-037", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格只有五日，忌塡實，最怕沖了日時拱位，又怕四柱中有傷日干，遇殺皆拱不住則減分數，歲君大運同。經云：拱祿拱貴，塡實則凶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/037", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-038", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-038", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格有五日：丁巳日見丁未，己未日見己巳，戊辰見戊午，癸丑見癸亥，癸亥見癸丑。以日干甲寅取貴人，甲戊庚牛羊是也。丁巳寅辛丑貴人，大忌塡實貴位，怕刑沖了日時拱位，又怕四柱有官沖身、七殺之類皆拱不住，則減分數，歲君大運亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/038", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-039", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-039", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：范都事命不合年月丑字塡實，只爲白衣。此格有六日：寅日見甲子時，壬子日見壬寅時，甲申日見甲戌時，戊申日見戊午時，乙未日見酉時，辛丑日見辛卯時。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/039", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-040", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-040", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格大要生旺，忌死絕，要四柱中有官星爲妙。月上印綬最緊，行官印運便發，見財運破印，反爲貪財壞印，不利也，歲運亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/040", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-041", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-041", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "亦忌財，要行官運。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/041", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-100-042", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "丙十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-100-042", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（葛待詔命）：葛待詔係實職項兒，此命是雜氣之中令透出丙火，乃爲印綬，只是不因時下有癸水財，行戊子丑運，入於壬辰運六年而不遂意，第七年歲在戊子年二月十八日戊戌藏正，乃是財壞印也，不可不仔細推之，記之日以爲術者鑒。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-100", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/100/042", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_100.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "且如壬水日主多見寅字，則用寅中甲木暗邀巳土爲壬日之官星，丙火邀辛金爲壬日印綬，怕午字申字沖之，忌財官壞實，喜身旺地，歲運同。寅爲艮土之方故曰趨艮，謂壬祿在亥，寅與亥合，又謂之合祿，亦忌破害，運行申則壞寅字不吉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "乾爲亥宮，六甲日生亥多者是，有官殺非此格。且如六甲日生，柱中要亥字多，乃爲天門之位、北極之垣。此論甲祿在寅，寅亥合謂之合祿，忌見財星及寅巳二字。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-003", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（詩訣）：甲日生人喜亥時。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-004", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以戊己日爲主，勾陳遇亥卯未木局爲官、申子辰水局爲財地是也。正是戊寅戊子戊申己卯己亥己未日是也。忌刑沖，殺旺則反生災矣，歲君大運亦然。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "且如壬癸二日生，值寅午戌火局爲財、辰戌丑未爲官是也。正是壬寅壬午壬戌癸巳癸未癸丑是也。忌沖破身家則不吉。壬癸屬水故爲玄武，但得火局故曰當權，無非水火既濟之功理。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-006", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "且如丙丁二日見寅午戌全，或巳午未全亦是，但忌水鄉金地，喜行東方運，怕沖，要身旺，歲運同。炎上者火之勢急，又得火局渾然成勢，火爲文明之象，值之者當爲朱紫之貴，蓋非尋常之命也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "且如壬癸日要申子辰全，或亥子丑全是也，忌辰戌丑未官鄉，喜西方運，不宜東方沖，此歲運同。此命得申子辰全、亥子丑水鄉渾然，庚辛又生，湛然福量廣闊，真富貴之人也。潤下者天干地支渾是水，如湖海汪洋飄萬頃，以無際，主人清秀量洪，偷遇土運必主淹滯，若生於冬月又爲奇特者也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-008", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-008", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以庚辛日見巳酉丑金局全，或申酉戌全者是也，忌南方火運，喜庚辛旺運，見亥卯未者爲之金水間革也，忌沖刑庫破，歲運同。此命得申酉戌全，月令戊土生金，得從其類，主任權衡之職。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/008", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-009", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-009", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "以戊己日生值辰戌丑未全者是也，忌東方運及北方財運，止格喜行西南，惟忌東北。所謂稼穡者俱從於土，支干重見則爲土之一類，深有培養之功，主人多信，人品重厚豐肥，生財有人。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/009", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-010", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-010", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格以甲乙日干取地支寅卯辰，或亥卯未木局，要不見辛庚之氣，見庚辛即官殺，非此格也，只從木運論，故曰曲直。方北方有水，木賴水生，故從其類，主人多仁，忌西方運。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/010", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-011", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-011", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "要天干三個乙字，地支巳酉丑全，更有丙子壬子辛卯丁酉日亦是，柔氣怕沖尅，大運同。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/011", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-012", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-012", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格只要己丑日主，地支巳酉丑全者是，忌火鄉官鄉，嫌沖破。名爲福德格。秀氣火來相配鬼德，非獨己土，五陰皆有：陰火丁巳丁酉丁丑，陰木乙巳乙酉乙丑，陰水癸巳癸酉癸丑，陰金辛巳辛酉辛丑，忌刑沖破害，名利日主。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/012", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-013", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-013", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "假如乙日見辰戌丑未財神極旺，乙木四柱無依，則舍而從之，主其人平生懼內，爲填房贅繼之人。財者妻也，身無所托，倚妻成立，故爲此論。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/013", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-014", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-014", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "且如乙日生地支見寅午戌局全，則自以戊己爲財，要行火鄉財運身旺運，怕官鄉，忌刑沖倒則不吉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/014", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-015", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-015", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "且如乙日干見巳酉丑金局大盛，又無制殺，身主無氣，只得捨身而從之，要行殺旺及財鄉，忌日主有根及比肩之地。且如甲乙日生寅午戌地支全，若干頭有庚辛，則藉庚辛爲權，火制之爲福，最要行旺運，忌見財，得中和爲貴。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/015", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-016", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-016", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "且如甲日見庚年是也。正如年爲君位、日爲臣位，臣得君權，然又以年爲祖、日爲己身，七殺有制則祖上曾有要職也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/016", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-017", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-017", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "且如甲日見戊己年是也。若財命有氣，則主其人得祖上物業；身弱者雖有祖業，當耗散而無承也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/017", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-018", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-018", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格用日支與時支共拱其財。且如甲子日甲子時，虛拱丑宮己土爲財庫；又如乙卯日丁巳時、甲午日壬申時、癸酉日癸亥時是也。要虛拱不要塡實，及有牽絆則拱不得，更要日主自旺或財旺運皆吉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/018", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-019", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-019", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格乃謂年月日時連占兩干，統一面不雜也，取兩字不亂之類是也，又謂之兩干連珠格。經云：兩干不雜利名齊，其斯之謂與。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/019", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-020", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-020", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "此格取年月日時胎帶金木水火土全者，是也。此二格亦不論官殺，只取五行爲全，自有貴氣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/020", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-021", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-021", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "支辰一字：甲寅、丙寅、庚寅、戊寅。此取年月日時支辰不雜爲貴。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/021", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-022", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-022", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "天元一氣：乙丑、乙酉、乙亥、乙酉。此取干上、年月日時。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/022", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段内嵌现代【校记/存疑】标记，原文与校勘混排；已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著；text_layer UNVERIFIED→ORIGINAL：剥离校記后为纯原著正文", "evidence_grade": "A"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-101-023", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "外十八格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-101-023", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "鳳凰池：甲子戊午、甲戌戊午、甲寅戊午、甲子戊午。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-101", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/101/023", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_101.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段内嵌现代【校记/存疑】标记，原文与校勘混排；已剥离内嵌现代校勘注记（校記/存疑等），正文恢复纯原著；text_layer UNVERIFIED→ORIGINAL：剥离校記后为纯原著正文", "evidence_grade": "A"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-102-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "六親總論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-102-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫六親者，父母兄弟妻財子孫是也，用日干爲主。正印正母，偏印偏母及祖父也；偏財是父，乃母之夫星也，亦爲偏妻；正財爲妻，偏財爲妾、爲父是也；比肩爲兄弟姊妹也；七殺是男，正官是女，陰爲女；食神是男，傷官是女孫及祖母也。以上有圖必詳。婦人命取六親與男命不同，取官星爲夫星，七殺是偏夫，食神是男，傷官是女。經云：男取尅干爲嗣，女取干生爲子息及奴婢也。年爲祖上，月爲父母伯叔兄弟門戶，日爲妻妾己身。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-102", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/102/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_102.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-102-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "六親總論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-102-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：且如六親受尅何如？印綬見則尅母及祖母也；劫財羊刃尅妻妾及父也；官殺多者難爲兄弟；傷官食神多難爲子息；偏印傷孫，尅祖母也。譬如正印作合母不正，正財作合妻大抵不正，官作合女不正，偏財作合妾不正，比肩作合姊妹不正，傷官作合祖母不正，食神作合孫女不正，偏官作合婢妾不正。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-102", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/102/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_102.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-103-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "男命六親取用圖", "text_id": "YHZP-T-103-001", "text_layer": "UNVERIFIED", "source_text": "（p151 男命六親取用圖：十干×六親对照表，横看甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛壬癸，竖列兄弟姊妹、父母、妻妾、子孙。甲：兄姊弟妹、壽星、孫女、外母、妾姑、正妻、男孫、女、偏母、母親；乙：兄姊弟妹、妻孫母、女孫婿、妾伯、伯父、男姪女、女偏母、婦伯；丙：偏母、正母、兄姊弟妹、男孫女孫、妾伯父、正妻、男妾女伯；丁：正母、偏母、兄姊弟妹、男孫女孫、正妻、妾、男女；戊：男女、偏母、正母、兄姊弟妹、男孫女孫、妾、正妻；己：男女、正母、偏母、兄姊弟妹、男孫女孫、正妻、妾；庚：妾、正妻、男女、偏母、正母、兄姊弟妹、男孫女孫；辛：正妻、妾父、男女、夫弟、正母、兄姊弟妹、男孫女孫；壬：男孫、女孫、妾、妾父、子女、偏母、正母、兄姊弟妹；癸：男孫、女孫、妻、妻父、子女、正母、偏母、兄姊弟妹。）", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-103", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/103/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_103.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段首为（校注前缀：…）括号说明，疑混排", "evidence_grade": "D"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-104-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論父", "text_id": "YHZP-T-104-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "正財者，父之謂也。如甲日以戊己土爲財。若身旺財旺，主得父力。如甲旺戊衰，亦主有疾少靠。如戊臨生旺貴人天月德地，亦主有貴，更得丙丁生助，享父之福無窮。如臨殺地，父死他鄉；居衰敗受制之處墓，絳之地主，須得生也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-104", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/104/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_104.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-105-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論母", "text_id": "YHZP-T-105-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "正印者，乃生我之身也。如甲日以癸爲母。遇己丑未主尅母。癸爲印，連己丑正印，故云見多主母嫁二夫。一戊失地之夫，戊乃癸夫，或被尅，主母傷前夫；戊字受生或尅母。印臨桃花沐浴，母有外情。如印長生，主母慈淑壽長，益和子母；如臨羊刃殺地，或值絕墓孤寡，主母不賢，或有殘疾不睦。須以理推，無不驗矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-105", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/105/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_105.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-106-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論妻妾", "text_id": "YHZP-T-106-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "正財爲正妻，偏財妾也。甲木見己土爲正財，戊土爲偏財。又見乙木，局亥卯未傷身，甲食傷也，身主不正，淫賊也，則主妻有妖不賢，否則年高再嫁。見癸字則妾不正之妾也。見己土丑未字，則主自安，比肩分奪財。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-106", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/106/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_106.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-106-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論妻妾", "text_id": "YHZP-T-106-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：臨沐浴桃花，主妻妾私通。日下月下坐財官，主妻多內助，更得妻財。偏財得，若此則於妻財自旺，財不至富貴。妻妾用於偏財，則官星。偏財人怕妻見殺，尤忌財多身弱，妻反跨夫。財命有氣，妻妾相順，是得妻力。日坐空亡，難爲妻妾。又看孤鸞之日，陽錯陰錯，主尅妻；或因親致眷，寒房冷妾，入於填房。女人犯此，主父母家陵替，或致訟事。餘做此例。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-106", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/106/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_106.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-107-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論兄弟姊妹", "text_id": "YHZP-T-107-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "比肩者，兄弟也。且如甲見甲爲兄，乙爲弟妹，寅卯亦然。見庚則尅兄，見辛則傷弟。甲木旺相，兄姐爭財。甲乙寅卯既多，則兄弟姐妹奪財不和，爭鬨是非。見己合甲，兄姐不正；見庚，弟妹不正。如見殺多，乙木得局，是殺合會乙木而傷己，此見不若弟之福，謂弟之而加。甲木寅卯，乙木受制，主兄弟不睦。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-107", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/107/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_107.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-108-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論子息", "text_id": "YHZP-T-108-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "七殺者子也。如甲見庚申是子，辛酉是女。若見丙火午寅，或殺臨羊刃殺官，主尅子，不然疾病不肖。遇戊己土得命，則子得力和順。見丙巳字，女不正；若臨沐浴桃花，更兼暗合食神多者，其女私通。若殺臨長生、月德、天德所臨之地，貴人祿馬食神財鄉，言有強父貴子。要稟中和：陽日陽時男，見重陽；日陰時先男後女；陰日陰時女，見重陰；日陽時先女後男。傷官見官，子孫兇頑；時上傷官及空亡，難爲子息。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-108", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/108/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_108.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-108-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論子息", "text_id": "YHZP-T-108-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：女命取傷官是子，食神是女，若見印殺梟神，難得子也。男命官殺得地而稟中和者，言其有子，將生成之數斷之：生旺倍加，死絕減半，太過不及不以此斷。太過有子而多尅夭或兇頑，不及則少生養。官殺得地而有扶助吉曜多者，其子忠孝賢明；居休囚死絕破敗衰病勾絞元凶空虛之地，則子當不肖，貧賤疾病之子，更兼孤神寡宿主孤苦伶仃。且如甲子之日甲子之時，庚死於子，死中至老沒見，耶入墓之時難保雙，受氣絕中一個子，胎中頭女有孤娘，養中三子只留二，一長生之位旬中半合主。一八七個兒子也，沐浴一雙保吉康，冠帶臨官三子位，旺中五子自成行，衰中二子，死中一。官殺至亥，死中一化，此推之。且娼尼手中若無子也。生旺運行官殺旺鄉主有子，運過卻無；如柱中有官殺而行傷食，休養弱殺兩停而殺逢旺鄉，就作多子斷之，亦看財神何如，逐時增減多寡推之，無不驗矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-108", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/108/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_108.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-109-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論婦人總訣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-109-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "推婦人之命與男命大不同。草堂丁進士先生作。元神趣八法，照返九伏，屬類從化。女命八法，純和清貴，濁亂娼淫。取官爲夫爲福星，財旺生官則夫納福，印綬食神爲名貴有稱呼，生氣印綬惟爲子息。印綬財官必生於貴之家，才貌賢淑。甲日見辛酉是正夫，丁午字傷正夫，庚申是偏夫。如庚申辛酉重見，乃傷夫再嫁。若財太多官殺太旺，乃明暗夫集，多淫而且濫，財多而淫。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-109", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/109/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_109.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-109-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論婦人總訣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-109-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：故女人要財薄，旺夫益子。如官得地，七殺受傷，食神干旺，印綬天月二德，夫榮子貴，封贈之命。婦人八字傷官、官殺混雜，食神財旺身衰，爲人妬害，好色貪婪，死頑可畏。傷官見官，尅夫再嫁，身心勞役，雖不傷夫亦有病患，平生欠福，多主不安。大忌年上傷官，主產厄帶疾，否則傷壽。傷官主人聰明美貌秀氣。傷官見殺者富，無財者貧；劫財敗財，傷官身旺，貧賤下格。以上十五格皆是沖官逢合，俱有傷官之忌，雖是富貴不免淫濫之風。七殺正官只要一位者良，殺多則夫多。官殺被合，乃婢妾姊妹爭權，且如甲用辛官，丙合是也；乙用庚官，見丁是也；戊用乙官，見辛是也；此是被合取之，餘倣此，主婦人招嫁不定。八字中傷官及官星死絕，孤神寡宿，日時空亡，乃孤尅之命。如天干透出官殺，地支無官殺，更臨休囚死絕退氣之地，乃女絕其夫之氣，當作偏房婢妾推之。命若有天月德，無產厄血光之患，亦無淫濫之氣。女命只要身弱，主性純粹而溫柔，能奉公姑，助益夫主；身強欺夫不孝公姑，是非生事，性多急躁。身弱爲病，身強亦然。八字喜貴，不宜驛馬咸池；要純和柔弱，不宜剛健太強，歲運亦同。外有陰差陽錯孤鸞之日，不利嫁娶，皆無花燭成親，因親至眷墳房孝娶，婚姻轉析。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-109", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/109/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_109.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-109-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論婦人總訣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-109-003", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批（孤鸞殺）：木虎孀無壻，金豬豈有耶，赤黃馬獨臥，黑鼠守空房，主女寡而男孤。時中併沖，女則難爲夫嗣，加以空亡時日孤尅，不待言而可知。八字官殺俱無，卻行官殺財運，乃夫星得地則孤；八字財官俱有，運行傷官劫財之地，難爲夫宮，運過方嫁，細推甚驗。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-109", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/109/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_109.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-110-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "陰命賦（女命爲陰命）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-110-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "凡觀陰命，先觀夫主之盛衰，次論身榮，要見子息之強弱。夫榮子旺，定知富貴榮華；子死夫衰，只是窮孤下賤。有夫有子而貧寒者，蓋因身在衰鄉；無夫無子而昌盛者，亦是身居旺地。若貴人少者不富亦昌，合貴神非妓即尼。論淫賤者，四柱傷官暗招財損；招壻者，夫顯於門戶之中；偏夫者，夫旺於日時之上。夫衰身旺，主爲廉潔之人；鬼旺身衰，必作孤寒之婦。凡觀陰命之五行。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-110", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/110/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_110.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-110-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "陰命賦（女命爲陰命）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-110-002", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：女人甲乙金神爲金神，丙乙金神食，丙丁火食金，官丁火官旺，有財則富，無財則貧之；赤金生人，黃土黑水，土生犯者主此；咸池即桃花殺，主淫，更帶驛馬，私奔淫蕩。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-110", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/110/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_110.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-111-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命富貴貧賤篇", "text_id": "YHZP-T-111-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "要精詳於明辨矣。如命先看官星：官帶殺而貧賤，官得令以安榮。俊官太重必妨夫，且是爲人性重；倒食重逢須減福，那堪更犯孤辰；殺重須奔貴室，合多定損貞名。坐祿乘輿而穩厚，沖身動步以輕浮。若乃桃花浪濱，淫奔之恥不共言；日祿歸時，貴重爲人所敬。天月二德以坐本命，如逢印綬貴當兩國之封。時日羊刃本是凶神，既不利於夫主之宮，兼損壞乎平生之性。身干主禎祥，時犯食神健旺，要觀八字之強，專食子榮，忌偏印竊身之勝。守閨門而正靜，必由陰日守中和；待夫壻以經營，此乃陽干時旺甚。大抵欣逢正祿，怕犯咸池；清貴得長生之輔，雜濁以敗氣之歸。四柱敗多，大忌沖身而犯合；一生忙甚，若非長始即爲厄。印綬與公姑相妨，食專得子嗣之宜。官殺重逢須防淫亂，姊妹透出便見爭夫。魁罡有靈變之機，日貴有安常之福。即以干支分定官殺勝，而無制伏，不爲娼妓定作尼姑。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-111", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/111/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_111.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-112-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命貴格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-112-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "正氣官星、財官兩旺、印綬天德、獨殺有制、傷官生財、坐祿逢財、官星祿合、日貴逢財、官貴逢官、官星坐祿、官星桃花、食神生旺、食神生財、殺化印綬、二德扶身、三奇合局、羊刃有制、拱祿拱貴、歸祿逢財。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-112", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/112/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_112.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-113-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命賤格", "text_id": "YHZP-T-113-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "官殺混雜、官殺無制、殺星太重、傷官太重、貪財壞印、比肩犯重、無官見合、無印見殺、傷官七殺帶合、桃花八字刑沖、財多身弱、羊刃沖刑、金神帶刃、多官多合、倒插桃花、身旺無依、傷官見官、財官遇印、印綬遇劫。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-113", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/113/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_113.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-114-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "衰浪桃花", "text_id": "YHZP-T-114-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "女命用官爲夫或殺，只喜一位，多者尅夫。如命滿盤官星爲忌，滿柱殺星爲福反吉。傷官不爲貴，傷官運復行尅夫；傷官有制，身絕女命，傷官刑子尅夫。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-114", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/114/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_114.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-114-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "衰浪桃花", "text_id": "YHZP-T-114-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：女命官星多者傷夫主賤。傷官桃花爲妓女命，或主妓子息。若見貴人一位，或帶榮神，或犯絕地，多富貴貞潔。祿馬相隨，桃花帶貴，咸池遇馬多淫。婚夫破家，有辰無戌，命猶晚景；越寅戌多無辰，初年勞碌，中年好。不如夫不尅子，風流而淫；辰戌全則淫亂破家，傷夫尅子夭壽殘疾。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-114", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/114/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_114.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-115-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "女命總斷歌", "text_id": "YHZP-T-115-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "擇婦須沉靜，細說與君聽。夫主要強宮，身主要強甚。官星若不合，夫主無所依。合絕莫合貴，此法少人推。專以日爲年，此法少人傳。帶祿人生旺，產死教人謬。驛馬帶貴人，終久落風塵。有辰休見戌，有戌休見辰，辰戌若相見，多是淫賤人。有殺不怕合，無殺卻怕合，合神若是多，非妓亦謳歌。貴人一座正，兩三作籠定。羊刃帶傷官，駁雜事多端。滿盤多是印，損子必須定。二德坐正財，富貴自然來。四柱俱全，則賭禍壽。金才若相逢，必招美麗容。寅申巳亥全，孤淫口便便。子午逢卯酉，定是隨人走。辰戌逢丑未，婦道之大忌。兩貴一位殺，權家富貴說財官，若藏庫沖破豈不富。天干一字連，孤破禍綿綿；地支連一字，兩支成禍事。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-115", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/115/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_115.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-116-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論小兒", "text_id": "YHZP-T-116-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "凡小兒命見財多，必庶出螟蛉，尅父母也。若幼年行運於財旺之鄉亦然。甲側生頂不正，有胎衣遮；丁偏生雙頂，乾生有依應有尅刑；辰復生背父，易生易養；申有聲，寅遲滯未吉；辰有胎衣包，仰生有驚。夫小兒命大要身旺，最喜印綬生之，無財尅之則易生災。少不要官星七殺羊刃傷官太旺，身旺亦多災，身弱則難養。如見所畏之辰，切不要行運歲君助之，大畏財旺，不庶出必螟蛉，尅父母也。更不要行運早，蓋氣難敵也。庚子戊寅戊子丁巳，生月中之後，月逢七殺，頗有丁火爲印綬，實爲長生之地，能生戊土，不合見庚子巳字，金長生，其二子之水爲財，尅丁火，生氣反生月中七殺，七殺來尅身，身弱難敵，故當年十一月其子死矣，此爲生殺壞印之禍也。又如癸酉癸亥己丑乙亥（命例，p162-163 有圖，待對照）。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-116", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/116/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_116.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-117-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論性情", "text_id": "YHZP-T-117-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "皆金木水火土之關係也。且如木曰曲直，味酸主仁，惻隱之心，慈祥信悌，皆物稟民情，猶憂憤淒涕洟皵頤餒訃白，故云木盛多仁。林則折，執物性偏，不及少仁，心生妒意。火曰炎上，味苦主禮，辭讓之心，恭敬威儀，質重淳朴，人物面上尖下員，印堂窄，鼻露，發精神閃爍，言語辭氣急速心焦，面色或青赤，坐則搖膝，太過則足恭聰明性燥鬚赤，不及則黃瘦尖巧妒毒，有始無終。金曰從革，味辛辣也，主義，羞惡之心，仗義疏財，敢勇豪傑，知廉恥，主人中庸，骨肉相應，方面白色，眉高眼深，高鼻耳仰，聲音清響，剛毅有決；太過則自無仁心，好鬬貪欲；不及則多三思，少果決，慳吝，作事挫志。水曰潤下，味鹹主智，是非之心，志足多謀，機關深遠，文學聰明，誦詐飄蕩，無物傾險，陰謀奸惡；不及則聰小，無謀反人，物瘦。土曰稼穡，味甘主信，誠實之心，敦厚至誠，言行相顧，好敬神佛，主人背圓腰闊，鼻大口方，眉目清秀，面如牆壁，面色黃，處事不輕，度量寬厚；太過則愚朴古軌如廢；不及則顏色似憂，鼻低面偏，聲重濁，朴實執拗，太過則孤介硬，吝不得衆情，沉毒狠戾，失信顛倒。且如日干弱則退縮怕羞，日干強則妄誕執一。自傲以上，以輕重言之，萬無一失。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-117", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/117/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_117.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-118-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論疾病", "text_id": "YHZP-T-118-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫疾病者，乃精神氣血之所主，各有感傷。內曰臟腑，外曰肢體。八字干支五行生尅之義，取傷重者而斷之。五行干支太旺不及俱病。金主刀刃傷，水乃溺舟而死，木乃懸梁自縊，虎啖蛇嗔，火則夜眠顛倒，蛇傷燒焚，土乃山崩石壓，泥陷牆崩。且如生命天干內府所屬，詩曰：甲肝乙膽丙小腸，丁心戊胃己脾鄉，庚是大腸辛屬肺，壬是膀胱癸腎藏。天干外支所屬：甲頭乙項丙肩求，丁心戊脇己屬腹，庚係人臍辛爲股，壬脛癸足自來求。子疝氣，丑肚腹，寅臂肢，卯目手，辰背腦，巳面齒，午心腹，未脾肝，申咳疾，酉肝肺，戌背脾，亥頭。肝乃腎家苗，腎乃肝之主，腎通於眼，膽藏魂，肝藏魄，腎藏精，心藏神，脾藏氣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-118", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/118/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_118.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-118-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論疾病", "text_id": "YHZP-T-118-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "木命見庚辛丙丁酉戌丑未金，不能飲食，肌肉瘦瘠，脾傷，則左手口腹有疾，皮膚燥，小兒疳痢脾風，腳氣左癱右痠，口眼歪斜，風症筋骨疼痛，外則皮膚乾燥，眼目之疾，髮鬚疏落，少顱撲手足損傷之患。女生墮胎，血氣不調，小兒急慢驚風夜啼咳嗽。經云：筋骨疼痛，蓋因木被金傷。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-118", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/118/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_118.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-118-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論疾病", "text_id": "YHZP-T-118-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "火命見水及亥子旺地，主小腸心經之患，內則顱啞口心疼痛，急緩驚風，禿舌口咽啞，潮熱發狂；外則眼暗失明，小腸腎氣，瘡毒膿血，小兒痘疹癰疳，婦女乾血淋漓。火主燥，面色紅赤。經云：眼暗目昏，多是火遭水尅。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-118", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/118/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_118.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-118-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論疾病", "text_id": "YHZP-T-118-004", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "土命見木及寅卯旺鄉，主脾胃經受傷，內主膈食翻胃氣噎，蠱腹泄瀉黃腫，不能飲食，食物陳擇，咽壯脾傷；外則左手口腹有疾，皮膚燥，小兒疳痢脾風，腳氣左癱右痠，口眼歪斜，風症筋骨疼痛，外則皮膚乾燥，眼目之疾，髮鬚疏落，少顱撲手足損傷之患，女生墮胎，血氣不調，小兒急慢驚風夜啼咳嗽。經云：筋骨疼痛，蓋因木被金傷。黃土主溫，多淹滯，面色痿黃。經云：土虛乘木旺之鄉，脾傷定論。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-118", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/118/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_118.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-118-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論疾病", "text_id": "YHZP-T-118-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "金命見火及巳午旺處，主大腸肺經受病，咳嗽喘吐，腸風痔漏，蠱魅生死魂勞，怯之症，外則皮膚枯燥，瘋鼻赤疽癰皆膿血之咎。經云：金弱遇火炎之地，血疾無疑。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-118", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/118/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_118.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-118-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論疾病", "text_id": "YHZP-T-118-006", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "水命見土及四季旺月，主膀胱腎經受病，內則遺精白濁，盜汗鬼交，產損耳聾，傷寒感冒；外則牙痛疝氣，偏墜腰疼，腎氣淋瀝，吐瀉疼痛之病。女人主胎崩漏白帶。水主寒，面赤黧黑。經云：下元冷疾，只緣水值土傷。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-118", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/118/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_118.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-119-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論大運", "text_id": "YHZP-T-119-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫大運者，以天干曰五運、地支曰六氣，故名範氣。子平之法，大運看支，歲君看干。交運如同接木，何也？且干支二字六十甲子之說，用花字，若天干地支得其時，則自然開花結子盛矣。月令者天元也，今運就月上起，譬之樹苗，樹之見苗則知名，月之用神則知其格，故謂交運如同接木。然命有根苗花實者何？正合此意也，豈不宜矣。出癸入甲如返汗之人，且如甲戌接癸亥，此乃干支接木；丑運交寅、辰交巳、未交申、戌交亥，此乃轉角接木，東南西北四方轉角謂之接木，格局凶者死，格局善者災。寅卯辰一氣，申酉戌一氣，亥子丑一氣，氣之相連，皆非接木之說。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-119", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/119/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_119.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-119-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論大運", "text_id": "YHZP-T-119-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：且如甲乙得寅卯運，名曰劫財敗財，主尅父母及尅妻破財爭鬬之事；行丙丁巳午運名傷官，主尅子女訟事囚繫；運庚申酉七殺官鄉，主得名發越，太過則災病惡疾；行壬癸亥子生氣印綬運，主吉慶增產；辰戌丑未戌己財運，主名利皆通。此乃死法譬喻，須隨格局喜忌推之，不可執一，妙在識其通變，拙說如神。干旺宜行衰運，干弱宜旺運，正乃干弱則求氣旺之藉，有餘則不足之營，須要通變。更兼孤害空亡、勾絞喪門吊客、宅墓病死、官符白虎諸殺推之，其驗如神。又一法：羊刃桃花伏吟返吟，休囚死絕衰敗者凶；遇帝旺臨官祿馬貴人，生養冠帶庫者吉。如空者凶，空者返吉，吉者返凶。大運不宜與太歲相尅相沖者凶，更刑沖相尅者亦忌；歲沖尅運者吉，運尅歲者凶，格局不吉者死；歲運相生者吉，祿馬貴人合交互者亦吉。宜仔細推之，無有不應驗者矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-119", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/119/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_119.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-119-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論大運", "text_id": "YHZP-T-119-003", "text_layer": "LATER_COMMENTARY", "source_text": "批：忌其大接枝必斷，則損其根守之之可折。宜比流凶者台凶，行主或殺，若有相尅，主東卯，即便是亦移東卯。一遇此乃寅卯支，如氣交主年交辰之後，天不遇風雨之比，此凶不遇之，非松柏則喜以柏松之，不傷命東遇之，不逢以南方則西水不北。圖成若花籽園，曰主木氣移花實主凶接氣不則成。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-119", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/119/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_119.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "C", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-120-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論太歲吉凶", "text_id": "YHZP-T-120-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "太歲乃年中天子，故不可犯，犯之則凶。經云：日犯歲君，災殃必重；五行有救，其年反必招財。且如甲日見戊年太歲是也，尅重者死。甲乙若寅卯亥未日時者，犯尅歲君決死無疑。有救則吉，乃八字庚辛巳酉丑金局也。經云：戊己愁逢甲乙，干臨須要庚辛；或丙丁火局焚木有災，勿咎。效此推之，或得己合甲亦解之。大抵太歲不可傷之，相生者吉，乃五行有救，其年反必爲財；犯歲者其年必主凶喪，尅妻妾及破財是非，犯上之悔。加以勾絞空亡、咸池宅墓、病符死符、白虎羊刃諸殺併臨，禍患百出，神殺加臨輕重推之。日干雖不尅歲，猶恐運尅歲君；若加歲運沖刑羊刃沖合，主破耗喪事。倘有貴人祿馬解之稍吉，八字有救無虞。故云：太歲乃衆殺之主，入命未必爲災，若遇戰鬬之鄉，必少三刑加未命。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-120", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/120/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_120.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-121-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論運化氣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-121-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "於第一看凡太歲死墓旺相，合制伏制劫煞，刑沖破害，殺有刑制之有制。若用行支則合支之，行支乃正支，是故此則有救。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-121", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/121/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_121.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-121-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論運化氣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-121-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "五運化氣：甲己化土，乙庚化金，丙辛化水分清濁，戊癸化木，丁壬化木盡成林。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-121", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/121/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_121.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-121-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論運化氣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-121-003", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：夫五運化氣者，甲己化土，乙庚化金，丁壬化木盡成林，丙辛化水分清濁，戊癸化火。戊癸化火，得辰戌丑未全曰隊牆，勾陳得位；庚辰戌丑未全曰潤下；丁壬化木得亥卯未全曰曲直仁壽。天干化合者秀氣，地支合局者福德。化之眞者名公巨卿，化之假者孤兒異姓。逢龍即化，變作龍飛在天，利見大人。月令生旺養庫臨官之地方化，陰陽得合，夫婦匹配，中和之氣而化，太過不及皆不能化。有夫從妻化，妻從夫化，正化偏化，日下自化，轉角化，乃未坤申丑艮寅。經云：東北喪朋，西北得朋。甲日見己字化土，己見甲亦然，乃化之眞，謂之正化，化之眞者名公巨卿，乃富貴之格；化之假者孤兒異姓，或爲僧道之類，十干效此推之。但戊癸化火，南不化午，金仁義之合，巳酉丑全曰從革；戊癸化火無情之合，得火局曰炎上；丙辛化水，得申子辰水局曰潤下；丁壬化木，得亥卯未全曰曲直仁壽。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-121", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/121/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_121.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "推詳。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "甲從己合，賴土所生。遇乙兮妻財暗損，逢丁兮衣祿成空。貴顯高門，蓋得辛金之力；家殷大富，皆因戊土之功。見癸兮平生發福，逢壬兮一世顯達。遇金家徒四壁，時逢丙火祿享千鍾。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-003", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：己能化甲，秀在於寅。逢丁兮他人凌辱，遇乙兮自己遭迍。陽水重重，奔走紅塵之客；庚金銳銳，孤寒白屋之人。丙內藏辛必得其貴，戊中隱癸不主於貧。若要官職遷榮，先須見癸；家殷巨富，務要逢辛。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-004", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "乙從庚化，氣稟西方。蹇難兮生逢丙位，榮華兮長生壬鄉。丁火當權，似春花之笑日；辛金指世，若秋草之逢霜。最喜己臨，滿堂金玉；偏宜甲向，麻麥盈倉。日日勞神，蓋爲兮陳作亂；時時費力，多因玄武爲殃。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "庚從乙化，金質彌堅。最忌辛金暗損，偏嫌丙火相煎。遇丁官兮似蛟龍之得助氣，有月丙辛日化金局相中，命時生須各。雲雨逢己卯兮，若鵬鶚之在秋天。癸水旺兮田園漂蕩，壬水盛兮財祿增遷。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-006", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丙爲陽火，化水逢辛。有福兮戊土在位，成名兮乙木臨身。官爵遷榮生逢癸巳，家門顯達長在庚寅。強橫起於甲午，禍敗發於壬辰。屢遇陰丁，縱富貴能有幾日；重逢己土，雖榮華一似浮雲。如重見之，必有傷害矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "辛能化水，得丙方成。四柱最宜見戊，一生只喜逢庚。見己兮何年發福，逢壬兮何日成名。癸水旺兮縱困而不困，甲木旺兮須榮而不榮。當貴榮華重重見乙，傷殘窮迫疊疊逢丁。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-008", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-008", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "丁屬陰火，喜遇陽壬。見丙兮百年安逸，逢辛兮一世優游。富貴雙全，喜甲臨於天秤；祿對雙美，欣己共於金口。活計消疎，皆因戊助生；能反覆，蓋爲癸因。乙木重重，財祿決無成就；庚金燦燦，功名切莫妄求。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/008", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-009", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-009", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "壬從丁化，秀在東方。遇甲兮多招僕馬，逢辛兮廣置田莊。丙火相逢，乃英雄之豪傑；癸水相會，爲辛苦之經商。佩印乘軒，己臨官位；飄蓬落泊，戊帶殺官。皓首無成，皆爲庚金乘旺；青年不遇，蓋因乙木爲殃。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/009", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-010", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-010", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "戊從癸合，火化成功。見乙兮終能顯達，逢壬兮亦自豐隆。衆祿拱持，亨丁臨於巳位；六親不睦，緣甲旺於寅宮。丙火炎炎難尋福祿，庚金燦燦易見亨通。妻子損兮皆因己旺，謀爲拙蓋爲辛雄。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/010", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-122-011", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "化氣十段錦（其一）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-122-011", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "癸從戊合，化火當臨。丙內藏辛，一世多成多敗；甲中隱己，百年勞力勞心。倉庫豐肥欣逢丁火，田財殷實喜得庚金。官爵陞榮連綿見乙，貨財富貴上下逢壬。財源得失兮緣辛金之太旺，仕途蹭蹬兮蓋己土之相侵。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-122", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/122/011", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_122.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-123-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "神趣八法（有類屬從化返照鬼伏）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-123-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "類象者，乃天地一類也。如春生人甲乙天干，地支寅卯辰，全無間斷破壞，謂之秀東方一片秀氣，最怕引至時爲死絕之類，謂之破了秀氣，運至死絕則不吉；或時上年上引生旺，爲之秀氣加臨，十分大美。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-123", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/123/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_123.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-123-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "神趣八法（有類屬從化返照鬼伏）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-123-002", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "屬象者，乃天干甲乙木，地支寅卯未全者是也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-123", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/123/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_123.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-123-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "神趣八法（有類屬從化返照鬼伏）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-123-003", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "從象者，如甲乙日主無根也，支全謂之從木；柱無根也，支全水謂之從水；四柱純木謂之從木。只有秀氣者吉，無秀氣者不吉。或天干有甲己字，或有根者不吉。其從火者，大旺運吉，死絕地凶。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-123", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/123/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_123.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-123-004", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "神趣八法（有類屬從化返照鬼伏）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-123-004", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "化象者，乃甲乙日生人在辰戌丑未月，天干有一己字合甲字，謂之甲己化土，喜行火運。如逢甲乙木生旺運，化不成反爲不吉。己字中露出二甲字，謂之爭合；有一個乙字露出，謂之妒合，爲破格不成。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-123", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/123/004", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_123.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-123-005", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "神趣八法（有類屬從化返照鬼伏）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-123-005", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "照象者，如丙日巳午未年月日，遇時上一位卯木，謂之木火相照，甚吉。如壬癸日申子辰全屬象者，遇時上一位金，謂之金水相照，大吉。年干有照者亦吉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-123", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/123/005", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_123.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-123-006", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "神趣八法（有類屬從化返照鬼伏）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-123-006", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "返象者，乃所謂值月令用神，引至時上一位爲絕之鄉，謂之用之不用，皆爲吉也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-123", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/123/006", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_123.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-123-007", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "神趣八法（有類屬從化返照鬼伏）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-123-007", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "鬼象者，乃秋月生甲乙日，地支四位純金，謂之鬼象，只要鬼生旺運皆吉，怕見至死絕之鄉，而又身旺則不吉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-123", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/123/007", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_123.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-123-008", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "神趣八法（有類屬從化返照鬼伏）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-123-008", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "伏象者，乃寅午戌三合全，又值五月生，逢壬日而天干無丁字透，透壬水又無根，乃取午中有丁火合壬水而伏之，所謂伏象，運至木火之鄉皆吉，只愁水旺之鄉則不利也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-123", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/123/008", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_123.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-124-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論格局生死引用", "text_id": "YHZP-T-124-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫格局者自有定論，今略而述之。印綬見財，行財運又兼死絕，必入黃泉，如有比肩庶幾有解。正官見殺及傷官，刑沖破害，歲運相併必死。正財偏財見比肩分奪，劫財羊刃又見歲運沖合必死。傷官之格，財旺身弱，官殺重見混雜，沖刃歲運又見必死，活則殘傷。拱祿拱貴填實，又見官空亡沖刃，歲運重見即死。日祿歸時，刑沖破害，見七殺官星空亡沖刃必死。殺官大忌歲運相併必死。其餘諸格並忌殺及填實，歲運併臨必死。會諸凶神，惡勾絞亡吊客墓病死官諸殺，十死九生。官星太歲財多身弱，元犯七殺身輕，有救則吉無救則凶。金多夭折，水盛瀉木，木旺則夭；火多燒木，金弱木殘，水多木浮。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-124", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/124/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_124.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-125-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論征太歲", "text_id": "YHZP-T-125-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "征者戰也，如臣觸其君，乃下犯上之意。日干支沖尅太歲曰征，運支干傷沖太歲亦曰征，太歲干支沖日干支者亦曰征。但看八字有無救助，仔細推詳，百發百中。日干支合太歲干支曰晦，歲運合歲干亦然，遇此者主晦氣，一年反覆欲速不達。假如乙丑乙亥壬申乙巳運，行辛未丙寅年，日干之壬尅太歲之丙，日支申庚尅太歲之寅，申又忌寅刑巳、巳刑申、申刑寅；行辛未運合太歲之木，尅傷官，皆不爲吉。其年甲午月火旺尅巳土，乙木生丙尅太歲，死於非命矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-125", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/125/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_125.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-126-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "雜論口訣", "text_id": "YHZP-T-126-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "看子平之法，專論財官，以月上財官爲緊要，發覺在於日時，要消詳於強弱。論官星不論格局，論格局不論官星。入格者非富即貴，不入格者非夭即貧。官惟傷財，怕劫印綬，見財愈多愈災。傷官見官爲禍百端，若非疾病傷癡，必當官訟囚繫，子喪妻傷。傷官見官，元有者重，元無者輕；重則遷徙，輕則刑責。傷官見官，心地勾曲，謊誑多詐，傲物氣高，常以天下之人不如己，貴人憚之，小人惡之。傷官用財者富，傷官劫財者貧。年上傷官，富貴不久；月上傷官，父母不完；日上傷官，難爲妻妾；時上傷官，子孫無傳。歲月傷官劫財，生於貧賤之家；日下時中有財官，先貧後富；歲月財官印綬，生於富貴之家；故日時傷官劫財，先富後貧，傷損子息無晚福。故傷官見官、官殺混雜，爲人好色多淫，作事小巧寒賤。乙木巳上爲太乙，亥上登明，男好色女淫濫。官殺混雜，有財者吉，無財印者凶。但看財命有氣，縱背祿而不富；財絕命衰，縱建祿而不富。劫財敗財，心高下賤，見者主貪婪。鬼中逢官須逼迫，彼尅我兮貴，我尅彼兮富，彼生我兮以仗母刀長我精神，我生彼兮常懷逼迫。財入月令，重犯財官者貴，重犯亡神者夭。七殺宜制，獨立爲強；明殺合去，五行和氣春風；暗殺合來，刑傷害己。時殺喜沖，喜刃無制，女多產厄，男犯刑名。二德無破，女必賢良，男多忠孝。傷官用印去財方可馳名，傷官用財傷官處須當發福。入格清奇者富，入格不成者貧。一格二格非卿即相，三格四格財官不純，非隸卒多是九流。六陰朝陽，季月只作印看。吉神惟怕破害，凶神不喜刑沖。財官印食定顯慈祥之德，傷官劫刃難逃寡惡之名。沖夭無合，乃飄流之徒；六壬趨艮逢亥月者貧；馬落空亡，棄落魂之人；惟阻月合逢沖過房。殺奪三刑，母明父暗，多是偷生；財印偏官，庶出已定。干頭波烈，冉伯牛怨於蒼天；時日沖刑，難免卜商莊子之嘆。刑多者爲人不義，合多者疏，合多主晦。沖多主凶，辰多好鬬，戌多好訟，辰戌魁罡多凶少吉。時日空亡，難爲妻子；交馳驛馬，別土離鄉。食神干旺勝似財官，順食者食前方丈，倒食者簞食豆羹。食美息旺不殘也。漁水濺下，每交學點達土，穂穡金當貴，織金水雙清而爲道，火土混濁而爲僧。子午最嫌，巳亥卯酉切忌寅申。巳入亥宮見陰木，移爲損壽；時逢丙寅，則冠帶簪纓。五行絕處即是胎元，生日逢之名曰受氣，化者有十日：甲申乙酉庚寅辛卯壬午癸未丙子丁丑戊午己丑。八字雖不入格，富貴亦是盈餘，另有福德秀氣，各有天地神祇。論化之格，化之眞者名公巨卿，化之假者孤兒異姓，逢龍即化，變飛龍在天，利見大人。又有冬逢炎熱，夏草逢霜，陰鼠棲水，神龜宿火，有合無合，後學難知；得一分三，前賢不載。且夫論格局者明有定例，撮口訣者略舉一二，當謂諸賢經旨，無合取用，庶可易通。道合無學無止法。經云：能過慮忘思，能舍無欲矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-126", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/126/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_126.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-127-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "羣興論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-127-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫人生有秉富貴之榮，而當與富貴而且能享福而保其終身，其何故也？蓋四柱中身主華旺，而其所用吉神，或爲財、或爲官、或爲印綬、或爲食祿，俱各帶祿權，得令不偏不雜，又無刑沖傷損尅害，方爲富貴本源之不雜也。他日能成才，振耀前人之基業，成當代之功名，不招讒謗不致傷害；又在運上步步皆吉，四柱益加吉利，是謂源清流潔，故能享福以過人，保其中而無悔也。皆由命運一路滔滔生旺而然，非幸也，乃命也，可不辯乎！夫人之生又有窮餓其身，愁苦孤寒，顛倒無何，一旦逢時，興然而起，或當營財滿意，白手莊田；或致君澤民，獨步台鼎。斯人也，前後異見，其故何如？蓋因柱中日主生氣未旺，所用貴神悉皆得位而成旺，又且合格，奈何日主無力，不能勝任其福，亦勞困偃蹇，終遂其日主。得其引使月祿出房廩，屈生元命，月祿丁爲我用，我得乘之，則勃然而興，是偏氣乘和，衰以遇旺，故迎吉而能輻起。若夫建業創功，有大小之不同，當於所遭命之輕重辯之可也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-127", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/127/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_127.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-127-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "羣興論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-127-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：又有日主強則四柱五行殺純不雜，身殺俱旺，則根本元無制伏，富貴不成，惟待運來制伏殺神，則化爲權，方能嶇嶇，才德動公卿，功名顯達，出類超羣，是其身旺殺神逢制化爲權也。制神力旺，發福非常，安得其人不顯達以至極品之尊貴乎。實有其命，又要行其運以扶方見嶇嶇也，如苟運不至，即常人耳。又要四柱中日主健旺，用神亦旺，各相停均，爲富屋朱門貴命之賢子也；及其長大，成立豐隆，一逢惡曜運加臨元命，見其財而奪之，因其官而傷之，臨其印而壞之，逢其食而損之，遭逢此運禍不勝言，所以中年見傾而不發。如其惡運一去，又逢好運扶身，使我用神一新，譬如枯苗得雨，勃然而興，鴻毛遇風，飄然而舉，不可禦也。又有人生五行身旺，羊刃比肩俱各爭旺，惟有財官格神等物虛浮輕少，無大成功名矣；出門行運又非作福之地，所以一生飢寒勞苦，落第有志無成，或至中年晚景傾逢殺運，假殺爲權，制伏羊刃，或得權貴以顯揚，或招贊財而發福，當隨五行清濁以遇其運而別之。是一生窮困，忽然而興起於中年晚齡也。故短命用月賄官星無氣，即至運到乃處窮艱，一興利故未興者，乃得運而然也，學者可不勉乎。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-127", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/127/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_127.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-128-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論興亡", "text_id": "YHZP-T-128-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫人生柱中有純殺爲用也。殺神無制，則爲白屋窮途之人，或一豪門營幹之士，故要逢制殺運，假殺而起，進用朝廷，操權威福，功不可量。制伏運一入財鄉，則能黨殺，便興禍患。如此官旺殺旺，運元恐失計，所以命黨殺運，偷來生凶，偶然遇流年財殺少旺，殺神相黨併合興殃，身主孤寒，尅害輕則傾家，徒配重則刑棄其身，故其殺神併合凶亡之可畏也。有如此殺刃者，一一難免禍患。又看柱中月令正氣官星爲一生貴氣，逢刃運則蓋逢財旺以生之，印旺以護之，故令其人能行仁布德，緯國經邦，權重爵高，所以貴也。後遇殺神旺，彌殺神祿位，歲殺併臨，官化爲鬼，喪身必矣。不行殺運，或逢傷官運，又無印綬治之，傷官得地，祿遭傷損，喪妻尅子，剝職生災，立可見矣。更遇流年，儻他損官受尅，必致亡爲慘惡。故欲官祿逢傷而免剝戮者，不其難之乎！如有高見明識，知進退存亡之機而保其身者，官祿逢傷，六親免禍，亦當自己受惡疾而終者矣。又有四柱中所專用神無官殺氣，惟偏財正財當旺而已，財神當道，隱隱興隆，積財聚寶，但少貴矣。欲知且看行運如何：若財逢官祿旺之鄉，又成富貴之局；設有不幸，財神脫局，羊刃相逢，財傾福敗，多患其凶；及流年沖合羊刃，財神盡傷，元命衰絕，羊刃生凶，敗亡極矣。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-128", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/128/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_128.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-129-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "寶法第一", "text_id": "YHZP-T-129-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "夫稟陰陽而生天地間，故造化之賦於人也，稟造化而生物亦如之，莫不由陰陽變化。是故推人吉凶休咎，斯理昭著。然術家之法固多，究徵索子平之外未有矣。子平一法，專以日干爲主，而取提綱所屬之物爲令，次及年月時支以表其端。凡格用月令提綱，勿於傍求，年日時爲格，今人多不知其法。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-129", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/129/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_129.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-129-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "寶法第一", "text_id": "YHZP-T-129-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：取月令實中所含之格，如單取癸水之類，此百法百失。譬如月令以金木水火土爲要，但有一事而定言之，若於傍求則有失契，取其月令貴重淺深，格局破中可也。西山易鑑，生得其變通，將干格分爲六格爲重：曰官、曰印、曰財、曰殺、曰食神、曰傷官，而消息之，無不驗矣。其法曰：逢官看財，逢殺看印，逢印看官。斯有奧妙不傳之法。取四者不偏不倚，生尅制化而遇破體囚爲下運，有生有去爲福，有助有刳爲禍，其理深長，最宜消詳切當，不昧庸術，宜熟讀，幸加勉焉。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-129", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/129/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_129.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-130-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "寶法第二", "text_id": "YHZP-T-130-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "子平之法，以日爲主，先看提綱爲重，次用年日時支合成格局，方可斷之。皆以月令爲用，不可以年取格。凡看子平之數，取格不定，十有九差。惟易鑑先生之法：月令用金只用金，用火只用火，八字水多卻取水，不來取火，況此差矣。以法斷之，誤其大半，是西山易鑑參透玄機。十八格內取六格爲重，用相生定格局，仍用年日下以推輕重淺深，萬無一失。六格法曰：逢官看財，逢財看殺，逢殺看印，逢印看官。如用印不怕殺，是殺拘印，印拘身，還作上格取之。如四柱逢印看七殺，但有官殺在，運行官殺鄉亦作貴格。月令通官，柱中遇財，財生官妙矣，乃富貴之格。柱中見財，要人財旺至興發福矣。但見一殺則以殺爲重，不可又行財旺之鄉，乃財生殺旺，當作貧賤之格。凡格當以殺官言之。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-130", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/130/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_130.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-131-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "寸金搜髓論", "text_id": "YHZP-T-131-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "造化先須看日主，後把提綱看次第。四柱專論其財官，身旺財官多富貴。若還身旺財官損，只是朝求暮討人。見財官旺時日主強，紫袍金帶有何疑。財官旺而日主弱，運行身旺最爲奇。日主旺而財官弱，運入財官名利馳。雖日主坐下有財官，月令相逢貴不難。富貴財官爲總論，早年富貴祿高攀。身旺無依更遷祖，不遷居死在外地。身旺無倚，指財傷妻，或是外家冷落，或過房入舍。身旺印旺，破財不聚，有財只好善破，或置物創屋，或門大而倉廩虛，內不足而外有餘。官喜霹靂則清高，財要藏，藏則豐厚。殺藏官露，惡隱善揚，人生遇此名辰部。官殺太重身宜強，一逢刑伏作賢良。殺宜拱印貴非凡，逢揚定振名。身居九夏火土多，相逢水濟貴中和。水火元來要既濟，管取名利振山河。生居三冬水冷金寒，得火相扶莫作等閒。火勢炎炎如無水，運行水鄉亦是美。水勢滔滔若無火，運入火鄉亦爲奇。南方火炎利入北方水運，北方水寒利入南方火運。東方木多宜入西方金運，西方金旺宜入東方木運。水火有既濟之功，金木有成名之論。五行得其相濟，威名榮振九天。三丘五行辰戌丑未，若是重見骨肉刑悲，父母不足兄弟異離，親戚情疏更輕妻子。沖破提綱多虧父母，或是刑或是離異。身旺比肩坐驛馬，兄弟飄蓬好瀟灑。八字四馬總交馳，身榮勞祿任東西。倘有身閒心不定，動則風流靜則悲。財星入庫主聚財，財星入庫妻慳吝，謹守貲財不做人。若是財星坐四馬，妻賢無處不欣。官殺重重不帶財，妻能內助不和諧，公姑不敬妻無禮，寡卻夫權命所排。官星若也逢生旺，更得長生旺在時，子息聰明多俊秀，兒孫個個著耕衣。比劫傷官旺，傷妻更損兒，養子多不孝，乞養總非宜。日主七殺帶梟神，妻主虛胎小產多，血氣不調成血疾，更看行運又何如。男子梟食重重見，身弱多因癆病隨；女人梟食非爲吉，產難驚人病亦危。女人官旺兼財旺，招得賢夫更好兒。若是財官俱受損，傷夫尅子守空幃。印綬旺身身更旺，爲人刑尅主孤貧。若得官顯財又顯，亦爲超羣拔萃人。惹是招非只緣水火相尅，或是日昏眼暗。女命若也傷官旺，坐下傷官會罵夫，朝暮喃喃口不絕，百年終見帶刑孤。日如乙巳戊辰庚午辛未，日干帶之權貴之妻也，更主賢妻亦主貴，更看四柱又何如。又如丙子丁丑戊寅己卯生人，遇此皆因前道。辛巳壬午甲申乙酉俱是坐下財官，逢之富貴不少。丁亥戊子并庚寅，日主逢之命不輕。辛卯丙申丁酉位，財官內隱顯聲名。己亥甲申見庚戌，印綬財官內裏藏，更得丙辰壬戌至，四時符印非常。甲子丙寅與丁卯，己巳壬辰癸巳同，虛名虛利任飄蓬。乙亥庚申并己巳，生下財官並無有，妻官子女帶虛花，東西南北是身家。甲午戊戌并庚子，女尅丈夫男尅子。乙巳丙午丁未同，重重壬子主孤窮。甲寅乙卯與戊午，支干同類子不足。己未庚申及癸亥，月令更旺成禍害。月主財官印綬全，月時符合福綿綿。干支同類并身旺，尅子刑妻破祖田。好將四柱分強弱，莫犯陰陽執一言。此是五行眞妙訣，不逢智者莫虛傳。師之傳也。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-131", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/131/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_131.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-132-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論命細法（荀倩《印正傳歌》即印淨禪師也）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-132-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "過房七殺帶三刑，母明父暗是僞生。我明我暗從化象，父死之時不送靈。庚金化成火相時，父亡見血不須疑。比肩三合族人害，三刑零落及離妻。比肩暗損及門房，兄弟無情被罔欺。如帶比肩成別象，弟兄不睦報君知。妻帶三合及坐妻，妻曾認得是親支。坐妻透妻成別象，定主離妻再娶妻。多透妻財須怕婦，妻歸絕地不生兒。化成別象尅正夫，必主欺夫禮義疎。身旺食強亦如此，食明旺相懵然殂。陽母專位主傷生，母來父上受其驚。天時地利生過月，七殺兼刑頂上偏。印歸殺地母有病，丙丁雙者頂雙靈。日祿歸時須應夢，小兒無乳食神刑。壬子乙酉時偏生，丙戌丁丑雙靈背，穴而生乙卯，此時須要記分明。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-132", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/132/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_132.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-132-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論命細法（荀倩《印正傳歌》即印淨禪師也）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-132-002", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：此論從化之理。假令申子辰從水也，不然五月無水有火不從也。戊癸化火，巳午天干地支從火也，又將坐日甲木論。珞琭子云：學釋則離宮修定，是如此取用也。杜老先生教鏡鐔僧判，將此爲例，此日參詳，朝暮苦想，似此半年，忽然間得此時入處。云公初學進退了幾番，後獲此法，非與他陰陽也，此別家幽微之經也。又論心印口訣：雙頂者只可言八字有雙丙丁者是也，若只一丙丁下有刑沖者，可信至頂無失也。又一法言八兒女疏面者，是戊己被甲乙尅之，不然主有疤痕，戊己見乙巳乙卯乙亥是矣。如此遞相貫穿，天干地支往來相尅，化合之氣死生破敗，皆此所主也，其干支萬變如神。此化病源，此中出成敗，此中出命之幽微，莫不由此而假外來哉。更論當官。陽土爲父，陰土爲妻，陽金子，陰金女，陽木陰木同法，餘皆倣此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-132", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/132/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_132.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-132-003", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "論命細法（荀倩《印正傳歌》即印淨禪師也）", "text_id": "YHZP-T-132-003", "text_layer": "ANNOTATION", "source_text": "注：妻星入敗地，主妻不正，如己酉庚午癸酉丁丑，是財入敗地也。寅申巳亥乃四長生，必得聰明妻。財官印得氣爲妙。元見財官，蔭旅農家；財多印少，早歿；母不貞潔必重嫁。女人之命日干同者，若我旺他衰我爲正，他旺我衰他爲正。壬癸之水盛者聰明多智，女多淫濫。時上見財者必須入舍。支中有官無刑破者，因妻發官；支中有殺無制，因妻致禍。假令壬癸日運逆行者，生於正月二月，取戊己土爲官，故爲祿絕，此爲背祿；取丙丁火爲財，四柱不透出財神，此爲背祿不貧也。寅卯暗藏三陽四陽之火爲財，如行子丑運遇比肩分奪，交亥運木長生而助火，主發財，戌運亦然，酉運火死水敗，主破敗。如壬癸生寅卯月順運者，巳午運發財福，亦忌財神透露，歲運亦然，如遇比肩，泛出四柱元有羊刃，比肩因妻到廟，忌中酉二運。如四柱元有印者，百物更改，故鼎新；如流年遇殺者凶。酉運裸形沐浴，劫殺主死。庚爲父，遇寅丙多，主父易。或用癸爲妻，若坐酉宮，或主好酒。本元無財官，忌財作凶，財歲戰便爲災。凡坐殺者不可行殺旺運，身旺又加旺運，歲運併來傷殺，與我無情者是。印綬怕行財運，主惡死或血疾。印綬多，母業或食衆乳，或寄養外人家。如四柱有官星，流氣太歲沖官星，必因官訟；如遇比肩助者，言比肩之人救助無事。流氣轉生財官者，凡識生財。傷官有三：傷之不盡，多出吏道。元有物氣，傷官運及印綬歲復見官星者多凶。化氣怕逢返本，不化有變局，如化不成功者，可只用本日干斷。且如己土用癸水爲妾，運逢辰庫，主妾與自家人私通；丙用乙爲母，遇庚申母多外情。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-132", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/132/003", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_132.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "B", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-133-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "傷官說", "text_id": "YHZP-T-133-001", "text_layer": "UNVERIFIED", "source_text": "（p192 傷官說：丙子丁丑戊寅辛卯壬辰癸巳丙午丁未戊申辛酉壬戌癸亥，時犯之，多因孝兩中成親。如用子女入庫，不喜入墓，如子女入庫主無子女庫。日用甲爲偏財爲父，坐甲行西地爲財，臨殺位父死不歸家。陽干女命食神多者爲娼，陰干女命食傷官多者爲妓，有物去之爲良。火至天干多主瘰癧，地支多時生瘡。用殺返輕，多爲僧道之首。）", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-133", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/133/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_133.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段首为（校注前缀：…）括号说明，疑混排", "evidence_grade": "D"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-133-002", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "傷官說", "text_id": "YHZP-T-133-002", "text_layer": "UNVERIFIED", "source_text": "（p193 斷語殘篇：元庚元壬元癸元丁元乙，以主爲喜、以水爲喜、以火爲喜、以木爲喜、以金爲喜。必凶官貴太盛，旺處必傾。土命不論胞胎，只論日時，不怕官殺混雜。陽干方論陰干不取。子怕寅午火，不怕水；寅木不怕金，巳金不怕火，己土不怕木；午火不怕水，未同；申金不怕水，己土庚壬不怕木；卯木怕酉金，辰土怕寅木；乙日五月不怕殺。四柱元有病，要去病，不去病不發。）", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-133", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/133/002", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_133.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "notes": "段首为（校注前缀：…）括号说明，疑混排", "evidence_grade": "D"}
{"source_id": "YHZP-134-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "心鏡歌", "text_id": "YHZP-T-134-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "人生富貴皆前定，術士須詳論。天上星辰有可加，此說更無差。時年月建逢命位，正是福元取。壽元合處是無真，此說不虛陳。官祿貴馬見合刑，一舉便成名。日逢貴地見祿馬，壯歲登科甲。時日若逢祿馬位，爲官必清貴。五行時日無相雜，爲官多顯達。羊刃重重又見殺，大貴登科甲。若逢三奇連祿馬，名譽滿天下。日坐食支又合干，九卿三公看。甲子己巳有一說，天德得合訣。丙子又己身，前舊官聯三公。卯木若逢金三不傷，同府坐中堂。少若逢木三，將權爲將鎮戍邊。金若逢火主大權，方面刺史官。水若逢土入金局，宜作侍從。下土若逢木爲正祿，八座三台福。年得月祿不爲喜，日貴取爲主。生逢貴人值此寡決，定爲官鬼。三台貴貴，人炎流脂作語，五符無氣守孤，三煞必究。作行者，空亡刑害又逢囚，爲僧及裏頭。欲知人命主有權，食神旺必令相沖，羊刃再殺傷，必主上法場。的殺若逢盤足坐，惡鬼死刑獄。麥田相逢共帶星，徒流定分明。大害當權多夭折，少年逢刃殺。日逢官鬼見重刑，惡死其分明。刃神劫殺兩頭居，早歲夢天衢。祿馬俱逢行絕地，勞困難逃避。月若逢時與刑沖，根基定一空。時遇官星生旺位，子孫成行序。向祿臨財官更期貴，顯有家資。日月純官無財位，反主無官貴。卯刑子位子刑卯，癸乙相刑貴子來沖。午未刑戌，甲乙逢申顯貴名。祿馬俱絕又發財，人元尅出來。甲乙見寅卯祿，酉見之，不拘此，得一分三緣何議。祿馬飛天是歲合，時日分兩頭，切須仔細求。君子若逢主奏對，常人主災晦。心懷悔退成何事，重陽剝官位。柱中有祿運逢財，甲乙見辰是也，金玉自天來。言前能說貴與賤，亦須看大運。大凡行運逢祿馬，發跡有能。能者天月二德星上昌，年星并二在日之爲德星，不遇吉中未爲官也。天月二德爲救解，百災不爲害。向祿臨財甚希奇，貴顯主官貴。命中祿馬同貴人，福祿進珠珍。貴人君子坐刑煞，名成少年發。陰陽貴賤宜消息，熟曉於胸臆。日時身命許多般，一訣通變看。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-134", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/134/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_134.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-135-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "妖祥賦", "text_id": "YHZP-T-135-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "命理深微，子平可推。先要取其日干，次則詳其月令，年時共表其吉凶。妖祥不忒於歲月，通參於成敗，禍福無遺。或有不見之形，須當審究；更有分抽之緒，後學難知。天清地濁，自然禀一氣之生；五行正貴，忌刑沖尅破之害。四柱支干，喜三六合六合之地。寅申巳亥乃財官印綬長生，辰戌丑未係祿馬印星奇庫。日貴時貴，大忌刑沖尅破；拱祿拱貴，最怕填實刑沖。觀無合有合，逢凶不凶。傷官之於年，運到官鄉不喜。羊刃沖合歲君，運臨而福至。辰戌魁罡，忌官星沖連十殺。金神日刃，喜七殺而忌刃沖。上偏官要制伏身強，官殺莫逢，鬼旺亦要制伏爲強。但看本有本無，遇而不遇，要禀中和。辛亥多逢，若在秋爲多災，若生夏爲無災，若在冬爲無災，若在秋爲多災。艮山寅宮也。陰逢陽差，辛卯辰子未丑，壬辰庚寅辛亥酉戌亥，癸亥甲子乙丑丙寅丁卯，戊寅己卯庚辰辛巳。丑地怕填實，不喜官星。甲子日再逢子時，嫌丑午亦畏庚辛壬癸亥子。祿馬飛天，離星丁癸巳午酉戌，丙子癸辛癸酉癸亥飛來將酉飛聲名。嗟夫財命有氣，背祿而不貧；財命衰，縱健祿而不富。癸到艮山怕庚辛，忌逢戊土；壬逢丑地忌戊己，怕見庚金。庚遇申子辰乃井欄叉，又謂之入局，忌丙丁，愁巳午。戊見申時怕甲丙，亦忌寅卯。辛金己土若遇，謂之從格，名爲秀氣；四柱火傷又無救，是炎迪遭。辛日戊子時，忌子多怕日相沖。陽水逢辰見戊己，災臨難避。甲見己時偏財運，喜財鄉。丁日辛年號歲財，運逢戊貴。乙逢申位，忌見刑沖；日時歸祿，官逢有禍。另有天衝地震，陰錯陽差。寅合忘官，劫先財後名難成貴。貪合忌殺，身旺時福祿增加。官藏殺見，有制伏亦日輝星。見殺藏身弱，後逢殺身弱喜逢旺運，身弱最愛殺來沖。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-135", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/135/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_135.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-136-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "絡繹賦", "text_id": "YHZP-T-136-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "（p196-198 絡繹賦）日月參天地之奧妙，測造化之幽微，別人生之貴賤，取法則於干支，決生死之吉凶，推得失之玄妙。甲乙之木最喜春生，壬癸之水偏宜冬旺，丙丁火而夏明，庚辛金而秋銳，戊己兩干之土要旺四季之期。日乃自身，須究弱爲本，主宜細推詳。年干父兮支母，日干己兮支妻，月干兄兮支弟，時支女兮干兒。後殺尅年，父母早喪；前殺尅後，子息必虧。馬入妻宮，必得能家之婦；殺臨子位，必招悖逆之兒。祿入妻宮，食妻之祿；印臨子位，受子之榮；梟居子位，破祖之基。財官月旺，得父贊財；所忌財傷祿薄，最嫌鬼旺身衰。原其尅彼爲財，生我爲印。食神暗見，人物豐肥；梟印重生，祖財漂蕩。咸池財露主淫奢，凶殺合年防自刃。土尅水而成腹藏之疾，火鍛金以患瘡癥之災。桃花會海，酒色亡身；財旺身衰，因財喪命。觀乎財生官者，用賄求官；財壞印者，貪財卸職。財旺生官，自身榮顯；財生殺黨，夭折童年。獨殺沖破，廢間人諸殺逢刑兌狼。天干多兮，見千年須當夭折；地支多兮，見支年必見凶災。財生官，官生印，印生身，富貴雙全；干黨財，財黨殺，殺攻身，凶窮兩逼。酉寅刑害繼傷婚，丑卯風雷多性急。殺賞漣絲，刀技藝之忌；賊神生賊，爲綱離之害。馬落空亡遲居，驛流祿遭沖破，別土離鄉。陰多利於女人，陽盛宜於男子；陰盛於陽，主女與家；陽盛於陰，男當建府。純陽則男必孤寒，純陰則女當寡困。官貴生年，伏凶煞而名垂萬古。貴宜乎多，祿宜乎少。絕慮忘思，無差無誤。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-136", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/136/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_136.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-137-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "相心賦", "text_id": "YHZP-T-137-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "人居六合，心相五行。欲曉一生，辯形察性。官星愷悌，貴氣軒昂，性優游而仁慈寬大，懷豁達而和暢，聲音手姿美而秀麗，性格敏而聰明。印綬主多智慧，豐身自在，心慈。食神善能飲食，體厚而喜謳歌。偏官七殺勢壓三公，喜酒色而偏爭好鬬，愛輕量而扶家欲，雖性如虎，急躁如風。梟印常摧，使小機而毒無知，有刻剝之意，無慈善之心。偏正財露，輕財好義，愛人趨奉，好說是非，嗜酒貪花亦係如此。傷官傷盡，多藝多能，使心機而傲物氣高，多謗詐而侮人志大，顱高骨俊眼大眉粗。日德心善穩厚，而作事慈祥；魁罡性嚴有操持，而爲人聰敏；日貴夜貴朝榮暮榮，爲人純粹而有姿色，作仁德而不驕奢。金神貴格，火地奇哉，有剛斷明敏之才，無刻剝欺瞞之心。乙巳鼠貴遇午沖，貧如顏子；壬騎龍背逢丁破，慾比申梔；井欄飛天，其心傲物；刑合趨艮，智足多仁；六甲趨乾，主仁慈而剛介心平；五陰會局，爲人佛口蛇心；二德印生，作事施恩布德。五行有化，看何氣而推；四柱無情，取元干而論也。且火炎土燥，必聲洪而好禮；水清潤下，主言悟而施仁；金白水清，質黑肥圓；土氣厚重，信在四時。彙合如然失時，反此事則舉其大略，須要察其細微。欲識情理，學者用心於此。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-137", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/137/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_137.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-138-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "子機賦", "text_id": "YHZP-T-138-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "太極判爲天地，一氣分有陰陽。日干爲主，專論財官；月支取格，乃分貴賤。有格不正者敗，無格有用者成。有官莫尋格局，有格局喜官星。官印財食無破清高，殺傷梟刃用之爲吉。善惡相交，喜去殺而從善；吉凶混雜，惡害以化凶。有官有殺，宜身旺制殺爲奇；有官有印，畏財與助財爲禍。身強殺淺，殺運無妨；殺重身輕，制鄉爲福。身旺印多，喜行財地；財多身弱，畏入財鄉。男逢此劫傷官，尅妻害子；女犯傷官偏印，喪子刑夫。幼失雙親，財星太重；爲人孤尅，身旺無依。年沖月令，離祖成家；日破提沖，弦斷再續；時日對沖，傷妻尅子；日通月令，得祖安身。木遇春長，遇庚辛反假爲權；火歸夏生，見壬癸能爲福厚；土逢辰戌丑未，木重成名；金坐申酉之中，火鄉發福；水居亥子，戊己難侵。身坐休囚，平生未濟；身旺喜逢祿馬，身弱忌見財官。得時俱爲旺論，失令便作衰看。四柱無根，得時爲旺；日干無氣，遇劫爲強。身弱喜印，主旺宜官。財官印殺，破則無功；殺傷梟劫，去之爲福。甲乙秋生金透露，水木火運榮昌；丙丁冬降水汪洋，火土木方貴顯；戊己春生西南方有救；庚辛夏長，水土運無傷；壬癸逢於土旺，金木宜榮。身弱有印，殺旺無傷，忌行財地。傷官傷盡，行官運以無妨；傷官用印，宜去財；傷官用財，宜去印。是或傷官財印俱彰，將何發福？身旺殺用財去，印用財去印，去財去印者去之。財多身弱，身旺以爲榮；身旺財衰，財旺鄉而發福。重犯官星，只宜制伏；食神疊見，須忌官鄉。頑金無火，大用不成；強木無金，清名難著。水多得土，財多蓄；火熠逢波，祿位高。有官有印無破，無榮無印無官有格取貴。羊刃格喜偏官，金神最宜制伏；雜氣財官，刑沖則發；官貴太盛，旺處必傾。身太旺喜見財官，主太柔不宜祿馬。旺官旺印與旺財，入墓有禍；傷官食神并身旺，遇庫興炎。運貴在於支取，歲重向乎干求。印多者行財而發，財旺者遇比何妨。格清局正，富貴榮華；印旺官旺，聲名特達。合官非爲貴取，合殺莫作凶推。桃花祿馬，貴人君子坐刑煞，名成少年發。身旺者則宜泄宜傷，身衰者則宜喜扶喜助，寡中和莫令太過不及。若逢此法，推詳禍福，驗如影響。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-138", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/138/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_138.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
{"source_id": "YHZP-139-001", "engine": "YUHAI_ZIPING", "book": "渊海子平", "chapter": "斷徵賦", "text_id": "YHZP-T-139-001", "text_layer": "ORIGINAL", "source_text": "天地陰陽二氣，降於春夏秋冬，各生其時，有用者則吉，無用者則凶，是以澄天機之妙理，談大道之玄微。天既生人，人各有命。所以早年富貴，八字運限咸和；中主孤單，五行逢死絕敗。過房入舍，年月中分；隨母從夫，偏財空而印旺，早歲父亡；偏財臨死絕殺宮，幼歲母離，只爲財多印死。比肩多而兄弟無情，羊刃多而妻宮有損。官逢死氣之方，子招難得；若見傷官太盛，子亦難留。如遇沖破提綱，定主離於祖業，再見空亡三番四廢。印綬逢生，母當貴；偏官歸祿，父必疇榮。官星臨祿旺之鄉，子當榮顯；七殺遇長生之位，女招貧夫。自身惜富，所生必是依人過活；星矢半路拋離。若乃惜富所生，亦是他人義女。酒色猖狂，只是桃花帶殺；慈祥敏慧，天月二德聚來。印綬旺而子少息稀，正官旺而女多男少。梟神興，早年折夭；食神旺，老壽而高。偏財逢敗，自身敗在沐浴；水主金主義，仁義星曜人喪夫，主風流子。曜若臨，破家蕩產；自身逢敗，早歲與衰。妻入墓，不得妻財；父臨庫，父當先死。比肩逢祿，兄弟名高。食神多而好飲食，正官旺而受沾滲。身臨沐浴之年，恐愁水厄；生入鬬尅之年，必逢火災。女帶桃花坐殺，定主淫奔；傷多而印綬被尅，母當淫蕩。年月沖者難爲祖業，日時沖者妻子招遲。若見天元刑戰，父母難靠；如遇地支所生，凶中成吉。日主弱水火相戰而招是非，甲木衰逢金旺而無仁無義，此乃男命之玄機。略說女人之奧妙：純粹在於八字。純有富貴者，一官生旺，四柱休囚，必爲貴者；濁淫者，五行沖旺；娼淫者，官殺交乂，命主多合，此爲不良。滿柱殺多，不爲尅制；印綬多而老無子，傷官旺而幼傷夫。荒淫之慾，食神太過。四柱不見夫星，未爲貞潔；官星絕遇休囚，孤孀獨宿。清潔源流，金豬相遇，木虎相見，四柱三夫，羊刃重疊，水火逢蛇，夫宮早喪。食神一位逢生，田招子須當拜聖明。父母之宮，男命同斷。若是此書之如鑑，若遇高士對鏡分明，依其此法萬無一失。", "resource_id": "SRC-YHZP-139", "logical_uri": "source://yhzp/139/001", "relative_path": "sources/yhzp/chapter_139.md", "version": "1.0.0", "status": "CANDIDATE", "evidence_grade": "A", "notes": ""}
